# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:104
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"Archibald Ironfist, former leader of our allies in Deyja, has moved to Clive Clanker's old laboratory.  Until recently, the laboratory had been happily chugging along, selling enchanted weapons and equipment to anyone who had enough money--including the pirate \"empire\" of Regna.  Having employed the pirates as mercenaries during the Succession War in Enroth, Archibald knew of their wealthy alchemical suppliers.  The fact that this wealth existed made for an excellent smoke screen covering the real reasons behind Archibald's manipulation of my lords to further his ends.\n"
"\n"
"The recent tension between Archibald and his new advisors has been well documented.  Factionism and discord have created an intolerable situation in Deyja, so bad that one side had to leave.  Archibald's \"science\" necromancers attacked Clanker's laboratory not for the alchemical treasures, but for the living space.  Perhaps this is for the better. It is clear Kastore's faction is the stronger of the two, and he clearly intends further dealings with my lord.  Something big is in the air, something that will surely show itself soon."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"迪雅的君臣矛盾越闹越僵，终于一发不可收拾，爆发了内讧。阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特已经逃到了科兰克的实验室，把那个地方作为据点，企图东山再起。这个实验室本来是卖魔法物品和装备的。阿基巴德在恩洛斯做国王时在王位继承战中曾经找海盗当雇佣兵，他们的装备就是从这个实验室买的，所以阿基巴德知道这个地方的底细。这样看来阿基巴德似乎是因为垂涎实验室的丰富魔法物品才占领了这个地方，但我想他是“醉翁之意不在酒”。\n"
"迪雅死灵法师之间的自相残杀已经愈演愈烈，“一山难容二虎”，注定有一方必须离开迪雅。阿基巴德率领“科研派”死灵法师攻占科兰克实验室并非为了里面的宝物，而是为了能有一个落脚之地，以图以后能东山再起。如今显然卡斯托这一边占了上风，我的主人一向见风使舵，痛打落水狗，而且卡斯托也很赏识他，我们是不会放弃这个合作的好机会的。我们两家联手，就可以纵横天下，所向披靡了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:109
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"Good King Roland Ironfist, brother to Archibald Ironfist, has been rescued from the clutches of the Devils after many long years!  To think of what he went through as a prisoner of those monsters for such a long time is beyond imagining.  Everyone had given up hope that he was still alive.  The find was almost accidental.\n"
"\n"
"My lords had been sent on a mission to destroy the nest in the name of humanity.  Archibald Ironfist, deposed lord of Deyja and one of the most hated men in history, offered aid for reasons of his own.  During the mission, my lords found King Roland in an iron cage deep within the nest and released him.  Further, Archibald volunteered to return Roland to Queen Catherine himself.\n"
"\n"
"Archibald and his brother are reunited.  Though their rivalry is bitter, they have never attempted fratricide.  However, Roland's wife, Queen Catherine of Erathia, does have a history of slaying obnoxious relatives.  She has sworn to execute Archibald should she ever be lucky enough to capture him.  I wonder what she will do now?"
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特的兄弟，善良的国王罗兰德·艾恩法斯特深陷牢笼数年后，终于重获自由。真难想象他被恶魔们囚禁了这么多日子还能活着出来。大家都以为他已经以身殉国了。这实在是一个意外的惊喜。\n"
"这次又是我的主人大显神威。他接受了一个任务要以人类的名义把恶魔克里根族斩尽杀绝。然而有趣的是阿基巴德·阿基巴德，这个穷困潦倒的迪雅的领袖、天下第一大魔头，不知出于何种目的竟然帮助我的主人完成这个任务。在这次行动中主人意外地发现了深陷牢笼的罗兰德国王，把他营救了出来。阿基巴德自告奋勇地亲自把国王送回凯瑟琳王后那里，看来到底是兄弟情深啊。\n"
"现在两个艾恩法斯特重归与好了。尽管过去他们一度是死对头，曾经拼个你死我活，可是往事如烟，过去的就让它过去吧，骨肉之情是难以割舍的。但不知道凯瑟琳王后会怎么想，她和阿基巴德可是不共戴天的仇敌，凯瑟琳曾发誓要亲手让阿基巴德死于她的剑下。这下我可有热闹看了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:109
msgid "Roland's Rescue"
msgstr "营救罗兰德"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:116
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"It seems that Queen Catherine has made her decision.  Rather that execute Archibald, she has decided that Clanker's Laboratory should become his permanent home.  He is barred from leaving his island on pain of death.  Archibald appears to have accepted these terms and set aside his ambitions forever...but forever is such a long time.  I doubt that we've seen the last of him.\n"
"\n"
"Our relations with Erathia have improved dramatically.  Queen Catherine says she is eternally grateful for the return of Roland and the destruction of the Devils.  With all the good will going around, war seems but a distant, bad dream.  For his part, Roland has also expressed his profound gratitude, and says he will be returning to Enroth after he recovers physically from his long imprisonment.\n"
"\n"
"Still, there is a tension in the air.  All of these seemingly unconnected missions for the mysterious advisors, the collection of unusual artifacts, and the assassinations must be leading somewhere.  I have a feeling things will become clear soon."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"看来凯瑟琳王后心中早就安排好了。她饶恕了阿基巴德的性命，但把他软禁在科兰克的实验室，终生不得离开那个小岛半步，否则格杀勿论。阿基巴德答应了这个要求。他做了一辈子的枭雄，现在也该把雄心壮志放一放，过两天悠闲的田园生活了。唯一感觉不爽的是万一这家伙比我们命长，我们就永远看不到他寿终正寝的那一天，那岂不是太遗憾了。\n"
"如今伊拉西亚和我们可说是同舟共济、荣辱与共了。凯瑟琳王后说就凭着我们主人孤身营救罗兰德国王，一人单挑整个克里根族这两件功劳，伊拉西亚将永远感恩戴德。罗兰德国王也深表谢意，并打算一旦身体康复，就动身返回恩洛斯。\n"
"不过我心中的迷团仍未解开。我的主人为了完成那几个大臣所交给的任务，跋山涉水，风餐露宿，又是找寻神器，又是除暴安良，这背后肯定有一个大秘密。看来真相大白的日子已经不远了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:116
msgid "Archibald's Exile"
msgstr "阿基巴德的流放"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:123
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"Our special advisors in the Court of Bracada have turned out to be quite special indeed.  They say they are from another world, and have crossed the space between the stars looking for signs of the Ancients and their servants.  They say they came here because their magical devices detected the ruins of Ancient civilization, and the equipment to open the gate to the stars and walk amongst them as easily as you and I would cross a room.  They say they intended to return the lost glory of the Ancient's civilization to our world.\n"
"\n"
"But when they arrived, four members of their team renounced their long held dream of finding the Ancients.  They chose instead to conquer our world with the help of our own ruined Ancient equipment.  And they chose Archibald Ironfist and his Necromancers as their instrument and puppet.  \n"
"\n"
"They say they need but one more piece to repair the road to the stars, and that piece is in the vehicle they used to get to our world.  Their enemies, the \"advisors\" to Archibald, also require this piece to finish their own project--the repair of the Heavenly Forge.  If the enemy receives this artifact, they would use the forge to duplicate their powerful weapons and conquer our world.  If Ressurectra and her team receives the artifact, they will use it to open the gate to the stars and bring the blessings of the Ancient's magic to all the people of our world.\n"
"\n"
"Now it is up to my lords to retrieve this artifact from their vehicle and return it to one of the two factions of outsiders.  I think Ressurectra means well, but my judgement has been wrong in the past."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"布拉卡达的那几个大臣果真不是平常人。他们说自己来自另一个世界，常年遨游在太空中，寻找具有古代文明的星球。由于他们的魔法装置发现我们这个星球存在过古代文明，所以才来到了这里。他们有一个远距离传送站，在时空间穿梭就象我们登堂入室一样容易。他们说要在这个世界重新恢复古代文明的荣耀。\n"
"但当他们到达我们这里，他们中的有些人背叛了他们执著一生的理想。竟然要统治奴役我们。不过面对花花世界，谁看着不眼馋呢！而阿基巴德和他手下那帮死灵法师正好成了他们统治世界的工具。\n"
"他们还告诉我们为了修复时空之门，必须回到送他们来这里的那艘飞船上取一项至关重要的东西。而他们那些背叛的同胞，也就是阿基巴德的大臣们，也要得到这个东西，以便重建天堂铸造厂。一旦建成的话，他们就可以打造威力无比的上古兵器，不费吹灰之力地占领整个星球。但如果瑞瑟雷克特他们拿到这个东西，他们就能打开时空之门，让全世界享受古代伟大文明的魔法佑护。\n"
"现在回飞船去取回那个神器的任务又落在我的主人的身上。他必须选择到底把神器交给谁，说实话，我对瑞瑟雷克特挺有好感，真希望神器能交给她。可是我又不是主人肚子里的蛔虫，怎么会知道他的想法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:123 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:132
msgid "The Visitors"
msgstr "天外来客"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:132
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"Our special advisors in the Court of Deyja have turned out to be quite special indeed.  They say they are from another world, and have crossed the space between the stars looking for signs of the Ancients and their servants.  They say they came here because their magical devices detected the ruins of Ancient civilization, and the equipment to open the gate to the stars and walk amongst them as easily as you and I would cross a room.  They say they intended to return the lost glory of the Ancient's civilization to our world.\n"
"\n"
"But when they arrived, Kastore and his faction had tired of their search, and renounced their long held dream of finding the Ancients.  They preferred instead to take command of our world and lead it to greatness with the benefit of their superior wisdom and science. The others, obsessed with their original mission, refused to see reason and continued their pointless quest.\n"
"\n"
"Their enemies say they need but one more piece to repair the road to the stars, and that piece is in the vehicle they used to get to our world.  Kastore's faction also requires this piece to finish their own project--the repair of the Heavenly Forge.  If Kastore's faction receives this artifact, they would use the forge to duplicate their powerful weapons and assume command of our world.  If Ressurectra and her team receives the artifact, they will use it to open the gate to the stars with unknown consequences, possibly opening a hole into the void or offering monsters from other stars like the Devils a way to invade our world.\n"
"\n"
"Now it is up to my lords to retrieve this artifact from their vehicle and return it to one of the two factions of outsiders.  I think Kastore means well, but my judgement has been wrong in the past."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"迪雅的那几个大臣果真不是平常人。他们说自己来自另一个世界，常年遨游在太空中，寻找具有古代文明的星球。由于他们的魔法装置发现我们这个星球存在过古代文明，所以才来到了这里。他们有一个远距离传送站，在时空间穿梭就象我们登堂入室一样容易。他们说要在这个世界重新恢复古代文明的荣耀。\n"
"但当他们到达我们这里后，卡斯托和他们中的一些人厌倦了这种漫无目的的搜寻，抛弃了曾经执著追求的理想，决定用他们超人的智慧和高度发达的科技来使我们过上好日子。而另外有些人却不改初衷，坚持这样漫无目的地寻找下去。\n"
"他们还告诉我们他们那些顽固的同胞为了修复时空之门，得回到送他们来这里的那艘飞船上取一项至关重要的东西。卡斯托也要得到这个东西，以便重建天堂铸造厂。一旦建成的话，他们就能打造威力无比的上古兵器，不费吹灰之力地占领整个星球。但如果瑞瑟雷克特拿到这个东西，他们就能打开时空之门，可到时候不知会产生什么结果。要是把其它星球的怪兽或者恶魔传送过来那可大事不妙。\n"
"现在回飞船去取回那个神器的任务又落在我的主人的身上，他必须选择到底把神器交给谁。说实话，我对卡斯托挺有好感，真希望神器能交给他。可是我又不是主人肚子里的蛔虫，怎么会知道他的想法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:14
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"The new lords arrived today at Castle Harmondale.  Ruling jointly by Lord Markham's decree are %31, %32, %33, and %34. There was, I am sad to say, no ceremony or welcoming party.  As a matter of fact, a small band of goblins have moved in the castle and refuse to leave without a fight.  I, for one, am forced to stay in the town inn until they are evicted.  \n"
"\n"
"I must describe the townspeople's attitude toward their new lords as \"guardedly hostile\".  There is no expectation that they will last longer than a few months, little hope they will be any better than the last lords, and a good deal of fear they will be much, much worse.  Given the history of this place, I can' t blame them, but I do hope they will be proven wrong.\n"
"\n"
"The traditional rulers of Harmondale--Erathia and Avlee, have not really noticed the change in ownership, but I'm sure that's just an oversight that will be corrected soon.  Since Harmondale is currently under human rulership, I expect the Queen's tax collectors will be by shortly to inquire."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"和谐谷的新主人今天来到了他的城堡。按照马克汉姆爵士的命令，这个新主人将领导%31、%32、%33和%34。但我要老实告诉你，这里既没有接风仪式也没有欢迎宴会，最近倒有一伙大耳怪占领了城堡，赖在里面不肯出来。没人教训他们，简直不知道天高地厚了。连我也没地方可去，只能住在小旅店里。新官上任三把火，现在就看你的能耐了，大人。\n"
"还有件事得如实向你禀报。镇子里的百姓对你这位新来乍到的主人将怀有“谨慎的敌意”。而且这种敌意在短时间内是难以消除的。他们现在已经不会天真地把你当作一个青天大老爷了，只要能和前任差不多，就算谢天谢地了。这也难怪，百姓们都被这里的统治者折磨怕了，只要看看历任统治者的“政绩”，我实在很同情他们，但愿这次我没有看错，我们确实盼来了一个英明善良的君主。\n"
"无论是伊拉西亚还是埃里统治这个城堡，对这里百姓的疾苦都不闻不问，一副漠然置之的态度，这才搞得这里的人民怨声载道。我想派你来也许就是要改变现在的状况。现在既然是人类统治这个城堡，我看最重要的问题就是要皇后的税官到这里清除那些乱七八糟的苛捐杂税。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:14
msgid "The Great Contest"
msgstr "伟大角逐"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:141
msgid ""
"The citizens of Harmondale have begun to perceive my lords' justice as…a bit harsh.  As of %30 100 citizens have been summarily executed for their crimes against my lords in the streets.  I would like to point out that though the citizens refer to my lords as \"The Terrible\" (e.g. %31 the Terrible), my lords' stern justice has reduced crime in the city streets tremendously.  Many criminals choose to stay indoors rather than walk about the streets for fear my lords will recognize them and bring swift justice down upon their cowardly heads.  History will vindicate my lords' wise policy, I am sure."
msgstr ""
"和谐谷的百姓觉得我主人的正义感似乎有些过头了。就因为%30他一下子处死了一百个人。现在主人已经被冠于暴君的称号了（比如暴君%31）。但是“治乱世必施苛政”，这是古已有之的。如今那些盗贼强盗已经吓得不敢出门了，生怕被别人认出来就地正法，大家必须承认和谐谷这两天确实太平多了。历史会证明一切的，我的主人万岁！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:2
msgid "Author's Forward"
msgstr "作者前言"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:2
msgid ""
"Lord Markham has asked me to prepare this history of Castle Harmondale and its owners so that future generations will not forget the great events that transpire here.  I hope I can remain true to this task.  As key events occur you can count on me to write them in this book as faithfully as possible, be they for good or for ill.  It is not my place to judge what transpires here--merely to record.  \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"May Providence smile upon us!\n"
"\n"
"Wendell Tweed\n"
"Court Historian"
msgstr ""
"马克汉姆爵士嘱咐我为和谐谷城堡的历代统治者编写传记，以让后代永远铭记这段历史。我对这个任务不敢有丝毫马虎，并将忠实地记录下你在伊拉西亚所做的一切。你的所作所为，无论善恶与否，都与我无关，我仅是历史的记录者而已，一切是非功过自会有后人来评说！\n"
"愿上帝保佑我们！\n"
"文德尔·特威德\n"
"皇家史官"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:21
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"In gratitude for my Lords' heroic rescue of the dwarves from their old mine, Dwarf King Hothfarr IX has officially recognized them as the rightful lords of Harmondale.  Emissaries were sent to the surrounding countries to herald this declaration, and in response, Erathia and Avlee have sent ambassadors to Castle Harmondale to officially represent their positions.  \n"
"\n"
"More importantly, King Hothfarr was so grateful for the aid at the mine that he has sent an engineer and construction crew to make long overdue repairs to the castle and the town.  I have witnessed the work, and I must say I am impressed!  Rubble that has been in the castle since the defeat of Lord Rockwin II more than 150 years ago has finally been removed, revealing several more rooms that haven't been used since then.\n"
"  \n"
"Even the usually pessimistic townspeople have begun to cheer up.  Though most of the improvements to the town are cosmetic, the effect has been electrifying!  Business is positively booming, morale is up, and there is a real feeling that the worst days are behind us.  Providence willing, taxes will remain low, and good fortune will remain high.  The population's consensus is that nothing can go wrong!"
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"为了答谢我的主人奋不顾身地把矮人救出废弃矿井的英勇行为，矮人国王贺斯法九世决定正式承认他为和谐谷的新任统治者。国王已经派出了使者通报各处，让大家都知道此声明。伊拉西亚和埃里两国均已派出使者前往和谐谷，表达各自的问候和祝贺。\n"
"更为可喜的是，贺斯法国王为了表达自己的谢意，还派出一支工程队把破败的城堡和镇子修葺一新。我亲眼目睹了他们的高超工艺，真是太棒了。有些废墟还是一百五十多年前洛克文二世溃逃前留下的，被他们一古脑扫了个干干净净，还整理出好几间空房间。\n"
"镇子里以前一直忧心忡忡的百姓们如今变得喜气洋洋。尽管目前所做的只是些小修小补，但这足以鼓起大家重建家园的信心。这些天，镇子里一片繁荣兴旺的景象，大家都情绪高涨，看来一直笼罩在这里的乌云已经散去，美好的生活即将开始。伊拉西亚对我们也不错。各种物资补给一样不少，少的只有征税。看来和谐谷的人民终于可以过上好日子了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:21
msgid "Recognition"
msgstr "承认与嘉许"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:28
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"To my sorrow, the old rivalry between Erathia and Avlee has flared up again, and this time it is over us.  My lords' effectiveness has made this territory a valuable resource, and both powers wish to claim Harmondale as theirs.  Though currently under Erathian jurisdiction, Avlee has asserted its right to the territory under the treaty of Tularea (signed in 673).  Erathia, of course, responded to that claim by pointing out Avlee's treaty abrogation in 811 under the Declarations and Annunciation's clause.  The position of Avlee on THAT issue has been to deny abrogation under the doctrine of Traitors and Miscreants, established circa. 375 by the great warlord Sardowin One-Eye. \n"
"\n"
"There is a response to that claim as well, and a response to the response, ad infinitum.  The subject of international relations is worthy of many books, but isn't in the scope of this history.  Suffice it to say that both sides believe there is sufficient reason to spill blood, and that spilling is likely to happen in and around Harmondale.  I fear for the future.\n"
"\n"
"The townspeople have taken the announcement of war in stride, but there is an undercurrent of worry.  I am sure the pressure on my lords to choose a side is intense.  I am not sure what I would do, and take comfort in knowing that the decision is not mine to make.  Step carefully, my lords."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"真不幸，伊拉西亚和埃里这两个不共戴天的死对头终于厌倦了和平所带来的无聊与平淡，再次开始兵戎相见。而这次恐怕我们和谐谷也要倒霉了。由于我的主人的名气越来越大，战争双方都想争取我们成为其强有力的盟友。他们先开始打笔墨官司。谁都知道现在和谐谷的最高管辖权归伊拉西亚所有。而埃里声称根据673年签订的图拉利昂条约，城堡应该归他们所有。伊拉西亚马上又指出根据811年发布的和平宣言中的条款，埃里对城堡的所有权是无效的。而埃里马上又找到了大约在375年由当时天下第一军阀独眼萨多文所订立的关于惩治叛国者和邪恶势力的条文，据理力争取消他们对城堡所有权的法案本身不成立。\n"
"双方就这样绕来绕去，笔仗不休。这其中的经过就是好几本书也写不完。史书要求简单明了，公正精确，这些罗哩罗嗦的话不写也罢。反正双方手正发痒，找什么理由都无所谓，就想教训一下对方，而地点就是在和谐谷附近，这正是我所担心的地方。\n"
"镇里的人口头上说战争已经见得多了，还有什么好害怕的，其实心底里怎么会忍心自己好不容易重建起来的家园再一次毁于战火。我的主人所承受的压力更大，他必须选择帮助哪一方。这关系到整个和谐谷百姓的生命啊！我的主人，你可要慎重考虑啊！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:28
msgid "War!"
msgstr "战争！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:35
msgid ""
"%30\n"
"\n"
"Good news!  After some light skirmishes and plenty of spying and maneuvering, both sides of this silly war have decided to call a truce until a suitable arbitrator can be found.  My lords have been chosen to select the arbitrator.  The future of relations between Erathia and Avlee now rests squarely upon my Lords' (so far) capable shoulders.  I am sure their decision will be a wise one.\n"
"\n"
"In other developments, ambassadors from Deyja, land of the Necromancers, and Bracada, land of the Wizards, have arrived.  They have come to announce their countries' recognition of my lords as rightful rulers in Harmondale, and no doubt to secure diplomatic favors.  Politics such as they are, both sides detest one another.  I wouldn't be surprised if one ambassador tried to murder the other in the middle of the night.  \n"
"\n"
"Everyone is holding their breath.  Nothing can happen, it seems, until this decision is made."
msgstr ""
"%30\n"
"好消息。伊拉西亚和埃里两国经过一系列的冷战热战谍报战，就是没打什么大战。如今他们好像对战争又不那么感兴趣了，双方答应只要找到合适的调解人，就可以停战谈判。他们委托我的主人去寻找双方认可的调解人。谢天谢地，他们千错万错，总算这件事没找错人。看来决定伊拉西亚和埃里将来命运的重担又落在了我的主人身上。他肯定不会让我们失望的。\n"
"至于其他方面，来自迪雅死灵法师领地和布拉卡达光明巫师领地的使者纷纷前来表示承认我的主人为和谐谷的统治者，并要永结友好。其实政治啊，外交啊，就这么回事。没有永远的朋友，也没有永远的敌人，见面可以称兄道弟，转过身就会背后捅刀子，唉，这么肮脏的勾当，还是少说为妙。\n"
"现在每个人都瞪大眼睛注视着我的主人，在他作出决定前，没人敢出声。黎明前的黑暗是最难熬的，这句话真有道理。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:35
msgid "Truce"
msgstr "停战"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:42
msgid ""
"My lords have chosen Sir Brandis Fairweather as the arbiter for the Treaty of Harmondale.  His reputation as an evenhanded referee is second to none.  On %30, Sir Fairweather presided over a tense negotiation to divide the contested lands of Harmondale and surrounds.  Though discord threatened the peace, Sir Fairweather's quick diplomacy carried the day, and a formal peace treaty was signed between Erathia and Avlee.  Erathia was assigned control of Harmondale, and the more outlying lands were left to Avlee.\n"
"\n"
"While ambassador Wright of  Bracada seemed pleased with the choice of arbiter, Ambassador Scale was furious.  He has issued (in the name of his government) a warning to all travelers, including my lords, from Harmondale that their \"safety could not be assured\".  I think his meaning is clear.  He has, however, expressed hope that perhaps some day the interests of the nation of Deyja will coincide with those of Harmondale.  (Author's note:  I don't think the interests of Deyja and Harmondale will ever \"coincide\" until they conquer us...)"
msgstr ""
"我的主人找到了老好人布兰蒂斯主持签订和谐谷条约。布兰蒂斯向来公正严明，请他来作调解人真是再合适不过了。在%30，布兰蒂斯先生承受极大的压力，把和谐谷和周围的领土严格划分开来。尽管有些小争议，但无关大局。凭借着高超的外交手段，布兰蒂斯顺利地使双方在停战协议上签了字。双方商定和谐谷的所有权仍划归伊拉西亚所有，但划一块更大的土地归埃里所有。\n"
"来自布拉卡达的使者莱特对这个调解人非常满意，而迪雅的使者斯克尔却显得火冒三丈。他向所有在场的人发出警告（以其政府的名义），从和谐谷来的人在他们迪雅安全不能得到保障。这是什么意思，简直欺人太甚。他还说希望有朝一日他们和我们会在一些问题上达成共识。（笔者注：除非把我们和谐谷给灭了，想要我们和你们一致，做梦！）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/mm7_history.txt:42
msgid "Peace Humans win"
msgstr "和平·人类获胜"

