"Find Lord Kilburn's Shield and return to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist to report."
msgstr "找到科尔本爵士的盾牌并返回铁拳城堡向威尔伯·汉弗里报告。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1113
msgid ""
"Rescue a Damsel in Distress and return with her to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "营救一名处于危难之中的少女，并带着她一同返回铁拳城堡威尔伯·汉弗里处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1114
msgid ""
"Slay Longfang Witherhide in his cave near Castle Darkmoor and return to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "杀死盘踞于黑摩尔城堡附近一洞穴里的长牙巨龙威瑟海德，并返回铁拳城堡威尔伯·汉弗里处。"

