# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1135
msgid "Find and return the Hourglass of Time to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "找到时间沙漏，交还给浓雾镇的阿尔伯特·牛顿爵士。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1136
msgid ""
"Drink from the Fountain of Magic and return to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "喝下魔法喷泉的泉水并返回浓雾镇的阿尔伯特·牛顿爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1137
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Crystal of Terrax and return to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "找回德里克丝水晶并返回浓雾镇的阿尔伯特·牛顿爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1138
msgid ""
"Destroy the Devil's Outpost and return to Lord Osric Temper at Castle Temper."
msgstr "摧毁恶魔据点并返回坦普城堡的奥斯里克·坦普爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1139
msgid ""
"Get Knight's nomination from Chadwick and return to Lord Osric Temper at Castle Temper."
msgstr "得到查德威克的骑士提名并返回坦普城堡的奥斯里克·坦普爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:114
msgid ""
"Bring Thistle on the Dagger Wound Islands the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Speed."
msgstr "将纯粹速度药剂所需要的药材带给匕伤岛上的系斯妥。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1140
msgid "Defeat the Warlord and bring proof to Osric Temper"
msgstr "击败军阀并把证据带给奥斯里克·坦普。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1141
msgid ""
"Fix the prices of all 9 stables in the Kingdom and return to Lady Fleise in Silver Cove."
msgstr "稳定王国内所有9个驿站的价格并回到银湾镇的弗丽斯夫人处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1143
msgid ""
"Visit the Altar of the Sun in the circle of stones north of Silver Cove on an equinox or solstice (HINT:  March 20th is an equinox)."
msgstr "在春秋分或冬夏至前往银湾镇北边的石圈拜祭太阳神坛（提示：3月20日是春分）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1144
msgid ""
"Visit the Altar of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon at midnight of a full moon."
msgstr "在满月的午夜时分来到月亮神庙拜祭月亮神坛。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1145
msgid ""
"End winter for Lord Stromgard at Castle Stromgard, and return to him with the good news."
msgstr "结束冬天，带着好消息返回斯壮姆嘉德城堡的斯壮姆嘉德爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1146
msgid ""
"Retrieve the key to the Dragon Towers from Icewind Keep south of Whitecap, and bring it to Lord Stromgard at Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "从白帽镇南边的冰风堡垒中找回龙塔钥匙，并把它带给斯壮姆嘉德城堡的斯壮姆嘉德爵士。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1147
msgid ""
"Reset all of the Dragon Towers at each town and return to Lord Stromgard in Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "重新设置每个镇的龙塔，并返回斯壮姆嘉德城堡的斯壮姆嘉德爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1149
msgid ""
"Kill Snergle in Snergle's Caverns and return with his axe to Avinril Smythers at The Haunt tavern in the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr "前往斯纳格的岩洞，除掉斯纳格，并把他的战斧交给幽灵沼泽萦绕旅店的阿维里·辛西亚。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1150
msgid ""
"Storm the Silver Helm Outpost near Mist and return with evidence of their corruption to the Constable of Mist."
msgstr "突袭浓雾镇附近的银舵前哨并把他们堕落的证据带给浓雾镇的治安官。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1151
msgid ""
"Retrieve the candelabra from the Abandoned Temple for Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "为新索匹格的安多弗·波特皮洛夺回废庙中的蜡烛台。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1153
msgid ""
"Retrieve the harp from the Dragoon's Caverns south of Castle Ironfist and return it to Andrew Besper in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "前往铁拳城堡南面的龙骑兵岩洞，夺回竖琴，并把它交还给铁拳城堡的安德鲁·贝斯普。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1154
msgid ""
"Retrieve Ethric's skull from his tomb west of Free Haven for Gabriel Cartman in Free Haven."
msgstr "在自由天堂西面的埃斯里克的坟墓中找到埃斯里克的头骨，将它交给自由天堂的盖贝里·卡特曼。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1155
msgid ""
"Kill the Queen of the Spiders in the Abandoned Temple in New Sorpigal and return with her heart to Buford T. Allman in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "除掉新索匹格的废庙中的蜘蛛女王，并把它的心带给新索匹格的布福德·提·奥曼。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1156
msgid ""
"Deface the altar in the Monolith west of Silver Cove and return to Eleanor Vanderbilt in Silver Cove."
msgstr "摧毁在银湾镇西面独立碑中的祭坛并返回银湾镇的埃里诺·范德贝尔特处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1159
msgid ""
"Destroy the crystal in the Temple of the Fist and return to Winston Schezar in Bootleg Bay."
msgstr "摧毁神拳庙中的水晶并返回布特雷格湾的温斯顿·舒则处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:116
msgid ""
"Bring Rihansi in Alvar the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Luck."
msgstr "将纯粹运气药剂所需要的药材带去给阿尔瓦的瑞汉西。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1161
msgid ""
"Rescue Emmanuel from the Temple of the Snake near Blackshire and return him to Joanne Cravitz in Blackshire."
msgstr "从布莱克郡附近的巨蛇庙中解救埃曼纽尔，并把他带回布莱克郡的乔安娜·克拉维兹处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1162
msgid ""
"Find the lost artifact in the Dragoons' Keep near Castle Temper and return it to Zoltan Phelps in Free Haven."
msgstr "在坦普城堡附近的龙骑兵堡垒里找到失落的神器，并把它交给自由天堂的佐尔丹·菲尔普。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1163
msgid ""
"Rescue Sharry from the Shadow Guild Hideout and return with her to Frank Fairchild in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "将雪莉从阴影教隐蔽所救出来，并带她前往新索匹格的弗兰克·费尔基德处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1164
msgid ""
"Rescue Angela from the Abandoned Temple and return her to Violet Dawson in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "将安吉拉从废庙中救出来，并带她前往新索匹格的威尔特·德沃森处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1165
msgid ""
"Rescue Sherell from the cannibals on the islands east of Free Haven and return with her to Carlo Tormini in Free Haven."
msgstr "将谢勒尔从布特雷格湾岛屿上的食人族手中解救出来，并带她前往自由天堂的卡尔罗·托米尼处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1166
msgid ""
"Destroy the Werewolf's altar in the Lair of the Wolf and return to Maria Trepan in Blackshire."
msgstr "摧毁狼穴中的狼人祭坛并返回布莱克郡的玛利亚·特里潘处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1168
msgid ""
"Find the Pearl of Putrescence in the Lair of the Wolf and bring it to the Ghost of Balthasar, also in the Lair of the Wolf."
msgstr "在狼穴中找到褪色珍珠，交给同在狼穴中的幽灵巴塞萨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1169
msgid ""
"Retrieve the jewelled egg from Castle Kriegspire and return it to Emil Lime in Kriegspire village."
msgstr "在克里格斯城堡中找回宝石蛋，交还给克里格斯镇的埃米尔·利姆。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1170
msgid ""
"Unward the doors in the Hall of the Fire Lord and return to the Lord of Fire, also in the Hall of the Fire Lord."
msgstr "解开烈火爵士的大厅中被魔力锁住的门，然后返回烈火爵士处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:118
msgid ""
"Deliver fake report to the Dread Pirate Stanley in the Pirate's Rest Tavern on the Island of Regna."
msgstr "将假的报告带回去给雷格那岛上的海盗休息站酒吧给恐怖海盗史坦力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1187
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Alpha in the Supreme Temple of Baa and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council.."
msgstr "前往超级羊鸣庙，找到阿尔法记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1188
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Beta in Castle Alamos and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "前往阿拉莫斯城堡，找到贝塔记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1189
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Delta in Castle Darkmoor and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "前往黑摩尔城堡，找到德尔塔记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1190
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Epsilon in Castle Kriegspire and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "前往克里格斯城堡，找到伊普斯隆记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1191
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Control Cube from the Tomb of Varn in Dragonsand and return to the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "从飞龙沙漠的维兰坟墓中找回控制方块，并返回高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:12
msgid "Report to Bastian Loudrin, the merchant guildmaster in Alvar."
msgstr "将消息报告至阿尔瓦商人公会会长巴斯沉·卢德林"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:120
msgid "Rescue Arion Hunter's daughter from Ogre Fortress in Alvar."
msgstr "将艾瑞安·韩特的女儿从阿尔瓦的食人妖要塞中救出。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:122
msgid ""
"Bring Talion in the Ironsand Desert the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Endurance."
msgstr "将纯粹耐力药剂的药材带给铁沙漠中的塔力安。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1225
msgid ""
"Find a cure for Slicker Silvertongue in the Superior Temple of Baa east of Castle Kriegspire and return to Wilbur Humphrey with the good news."
msgstr "在克里格斯城堡东面的顶级羊鸣庙中找到治疗斯里克·席尔瓦托恩的方法，并带着好消息回到威尔伯·汉弗里处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1226
msgid ""
"Bring the the letter detailing Silvertongue's treason to the High Council in Free Haven."
msgstr "把证明斯里克·席尔瓦托恩叛国的信件交给自由天堂的高级议会。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1229
msgid ""
"Find and destroy the Book of Liches in Castle Darkmoor and return to Terry Ros in Darkmoor village."
msgstr "在黑摩尔城堡中找到并摧毁巫妖之书，然后返回黑摩尔镇的德里·罗斯处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:124
msgid ""
"Bring Kelvin in Shadowspire the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Intellect."
msgstr "将纯粹智力药剂所需要的药材带去给影旋山脉地区的凯尔文。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1244
msgid ""
"Place the statuettes in Sweet Water, Kriegspire, Dragonsand, Mire of the Damned, and Bootleg Bay and return to Twillen in Blackshire."
msgstr "把小雕像放在甜水镇、克里格斯、飞龙沙漠、幽灵沼泽和布特雷格湾，然后返回布莱克郡的特温伦处。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:126
msgid ""
"Bring Castigeir in Murmurwoods the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Personality."
msgstr "将纯粹个性药剂的药材带给低语之森的卡斯提盖尔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1260
msgid ""
"Obtain Arcane Magic from Archibald in the Royal Library in Castle Ironfist"
msgstr "从铁拳城堡皇家图书馆阿基巴德处获得神秘的魔法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:128
msgid "Recover the shield, Eclipse, for Lathius in Ravenshore."
msgstr "替渡鸦海滨的拉西亚斯找到名为日蚀的盾牌。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:130
msgid ""
"Kill all Ogres in the Alvar canyon area and in Ogre Fortress and return to Keldon in Alvar."
msgstr "杀死阿尔瓦峡谷地区和食人妖要塞中的所有食人妖，然后回到阿尔瓦找凯尔顿。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:133
msgid ""
"Bring Galvinus in Ravage Roaming the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Accuracy."
msgstr "将纯粹准确药剂所需要的药材带给残破镇的加文那斯。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:136
msgid "Find the Prophecies of the Snake for Pascella Tisk."
msgstr "替派赛拉·提斯克找到蛇之预言。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:138
msgid ""
"Find Isthric the Tongue, brother of Rohtnax.  Return to Rohtnax in the village of Blood Drop on Dagger Wound Island."
msgstr "替罗特奈克斯找到他的兄弟利舌埃斯瑞克。完成任务之后回去匕伤岛的血滴镇找罗特奈克斯。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:14
msgid "Form an alliance among the major factions of Jadame."
msgstr "在贾丹姆大陆的主要势力之间结盟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:140
msgid "Kill all Dire Wolves in Ravenshore. Return to Maddigan in Ravenshore."
msgstr "杀死所有渡鸦海滨地区的猛狼，完成任务之后回去渡鸦海滨找马帝刚。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:143
msgid ""
"Deliver Fire Resistance Potions to the six southernmost houses of Rust.  Return to Hobert in Rust."
msgstr "将御火药剂送到铁锈镇六个最南边的屋子里面。完成任务之后回去找铁锈镇的贺伯特。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:15
msgid "Form an alliance with the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire."
msgstr "和影旋山脉区域的死灵法师公会结盟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:151
msgid "Find a Dragonbane Flower for Calindril in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "替绞刑峡谷的卡林最尔找一朵灭龙花。"

# imported from terms.engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1516
