# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:153
msgid ""
"Find a Dragonbane Flower for the Balion Tearwing in the Garrote Gorge Dragon Caves."
msgstr "替绞刑峡谷龙穴中的巴力安·泪翼找一朵灭龙花。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:155
msgid ""
"Kill all the Dragons in the Garrote Gorge wilderness area. Return to Avalon in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "杀死所有绞刑峡谷野外的飞龙，完成任务之后去找绞刑峡谷的阿瓦龙。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:158
msgid ""
"Kill all the Dragon Hunter's in the Garrote Gorge wilderness area. Return to Jerin Flame-eye in the Garrote Gorge Dragon Caves."
msgstr "杀死所有绞刑峡谷野外地区的猎龙人，完成任务之后去找绞刑峡谷龙穴的杰林·炎眼。"

# imported from engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:16
msgid "Form an alliance with the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "和低语之森的太阳神殿结盟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:161
msgid ""
"Find the Legendary Drum of Victory. Return it to Zelim in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "找到传说中的胜利之鼓，完成任务之后去找绞刑峡谷的赛林姆。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:163
msgid "Find Iseldir's Puzzle Box for Benefice of Shadowspire."
msgstr "替影旋山脉的班耐费斯找寻机关盒。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:165
msgid "Find a Vial of Grave Dirt. Return it to Halien in Shadowspire."
msgstr "找到墓土之瓶，完成任务之后去找影旋山脉地区的海林安。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:167
msgid "Find the Bone of Doom for Tantilion of Shadowspire."
msgstr "替影旋山脉地区的坦尼林安找到毁灭之骨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:17
msgid "Form an alliance with the Dragon hunters of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "和绞刑峡谷的猎龙人结盟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1713
msgid ""
"Mysterious woman asked you to travel in time and fulfill destinies of other heroes. Well..."
msgstr "神秘的女子请你准时出发，完成其他英雄的任务。好吧…"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1714
msgid ""
"Enter The Controlled Breach, find Runaway Chaos and bring it to the Uneasy Origin Matter."
msgstr "进入“可控裂缝”，找到“失控混沌”并将其带入“不稳定起源物质”。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1715
msgid "Find your friends."
msgstr "找到你的朋友。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1716
msgid "Find entrance to the main Breach structure."
msgstr "找到大裂缝中主建筑物的入口。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:173
msgid "Challenge the Arcomage Champion in each tavern of Jadame."
msgstr "在贾丹姆大陆上每个酒吧进行魔幻牌挑战。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:174
msgid ""
"Win a game of Arcomage in all eleven taverns, then return to Tonk Blueswan in Ravenshore."
msgstr "在贾丹姆大陆上所有十一家酒吧中赢得至少一场魔幻牌游戏，然后返回渡鸦海滨找汤克·蓝天鹅。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:177
msgid ""
"Find a wheel of Frelandeau Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一块独角兽奶酪，并且带回去交给阿尔瓦的阿萨尔·福罗马哥。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:178
msgid "Find a log of Eldenbrie Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一块艾顿布理奶酪，并且带回去交给阿尔瓦的阿萨尔·福罗马哥。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:179
msgid "Find a ball of Dunduck Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一块登达克奶酪，并且带回去交给阿尔瓦的阿萨尔·福罗马哥。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:18
msgid "Form an alliance with the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "和绞刑峡谷的飞龙们结盟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:19
msgid "Form an alliance with the Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "和残破镇的牛头人结盟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:237
msgid "Find the treasure of the Dread Pirate Stanley."
msgstr "找到恐怖海盗史坦力的宝藏。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:26
msgid ""
"Find a witness to the lake of fire's formation. Bring him back to the merchant guild in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一个目击火湖形成的证人，并且将它带回阿尔瓦的商人公会。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:27
msgid ""
"Find the skeleton transformer in the Shadowspire Necromancers' Guild. Destroy it and return to Oskar Tyre."
msgstr "找到影旋山脉的死灵法师公会中的骷髅转换器，摧毁它之后回去找奥斯卡·提尔报到。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:285
msgid ""
"Return to Fellmoon in Ravenshore and report your success in blackmailing the wererat smuggler, Arion Hunter."
msgstr "回去找阿尔瓦的费尔蒙报到，并且解释你已经成功的勒索了走私贩子艾瑞安·韩特。"

# imported from engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:29
msgid ""
"Bring the Nightshade Brazier to the Necromancers' Guild leader, Sandro. The Brazier is in the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr "将龙葵灯炉带给死灵法师公会的领导者山德罗。龙葵灯炉就在太阳神殿之中。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:31
msgid "Rescue the Minotaurs trapped in their lair in Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "救出被困在残破镇的巢穴中的牛头人。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:32
msgid ""
"Recover the Dragon Egg from Zog's fortress in Ravage Roaming and return it to Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "从残破镇旁索格的要塞中找出龙蛋，并且带回去给绞刑峡谷的查尔斯·吉科德。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:34
msgid ""
"Find the Dragon Egg and return it to the dragon leader, Deftclaw Redreaver."
msgstr "找到龙蛋，并且带回去给飞龙的领袖，达夫克劳·红斧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:37
msgid "Sink the Regnan Fleet. Return to the Ravenshore council chamber."
msgstr "把雷格那的舰队弄沉，回到渡鸦海滨的议会报告。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:4
msgid ""
"Deliver Dadeross' Letter to Elgar Fellmoon at the Merchant House in Ravenshore."
msgstr "将达德洛斯的信送给渡鸦海滨商人之家中的艾德加·费尔蒙"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:40
msgid ""
"Find Cauri Blackthorne then return to Dantillion in Murmurwoods with information of her location."
msgstr "找到考瑞·黑王座。提示：大家只知道她最后一次拜访过的人是低语之森的丹提理安，从此之后便杳无音信。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:42
msgid "Bring the Heart of Water from the Plane of Water to Xanthor."
msgstr "将水之心从水元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:43
msgid "Bring the Heart of Air from the Plane of Air to Xanthor."
msgstr "将风之心从风元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:44
msgid "Bring the Heart of Earth from the Plane of Earth to Xanthor."
msgstr "将地之心从地元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:45
msgid "Bring the Heart of Fire from the Plane of Fire to Xanthor."
msgstr "将火之心从火元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:47
msgid "Find the cause of the cataclysm through the Crystal Gateway."
msgstr "穿过水晶传送门，找到大灾变发生的根源。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:49
msgid "Rescue Pyrannaste, Lord of Fire."
msgstr "救出火之王。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:51
msgid "Rescue Gralkor the Cruel, Lord of Earth."
msgstr "救出土之王。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:514
msgid "Return a red potion to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "找到一瓶红色药剂，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:515
msgid "Return a seashell to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "找到一枚贝壳，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:516
msgid "Return a longbow to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "找到一张长弓，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:517
msgid "Return a floor tile to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "找到一块地砖，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:518
msgid "Return a musical instrument to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "找到一件乐器，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:519
msgid "Return a wealthy hat to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "找到一顶漂亮帽子，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:529
msgid ""
"Find the missing contestants on Emerald Island and bring back proof to Lord Markham."
msgstr "找到有关失踪的参赛者的线索，然后交给翡翠岛的竞赛组织者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:53
msgid "Rescue Acwalander, Lord of Water."
msgstr "救出水之王。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:531
msgid ""
"Go to Lord Markham's estate in Tatalia, steal the vase there, and return it to William Lasker in the Erathian Sewers."
msgstr "进入马克汉姆在泰塔利亚的府邸，偷走那儿的花瓶，回到伊拉西亚的下水道，把花瓶交给比尔·拉斯克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:532
msgid ""
"Go to Watchtower 6 in the Deyja Moors, and move the weight from the top of the tower to the bottom of the tower.  Then return to William Lasker in the Erathian Sewers."
msgstr "潜入迪雅的6号哨塔，把塔顶的顶门石移到塔的底层，然后回伊拉西亚城下水道见比尔·拉斯克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:534
msgid ""
"Go to the Celestial Court in Celeste and kill Lady Eleanor Carmine.  Return with proof to Seknit Undershadow in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "去赛勒斯提的通天院干掉卡米尔，把她身上的匕首交给迪雅的塞克尼特·恩德斯。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:535
msgid ""
"Kill Wromthrax the Heartless in his cave in Tatalia, then talk to Sir Charles Quixote."
msgstr "到泰塔利亚杀死巨龙劳斯莱克，然后去找查尔斯·科切特。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:537
msgid ""
"Rescue Alice Hargreaves from William's Tower in the Deyja Moors then talk to Sir Charles Quixote."
msgstr "把埃莉斯·哈格从迪雅的威廉姆的塔里救出来，然后去找查尔斯·科切特。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:539
msgid ""
"Capture Alice Hargreaves from her residence in Castle Gryphonheart and return her to William's Tower in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "到狮鹫心城堡绑架埃莉斯·哈格，并将她带到迪雅的威廉姆的塔里。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:540
msgid "Find the lost meditation spot in the Dwarven Barrows."
msgstr "在拜尔德斯找到冥想之地。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:541
msgid ""
"Go to the Temple of Baa in Avlee and kill the High Priest of Baa, then return to Bartholomew Hume in Harmondale."
msgstr "到埃里的羊鸣教神庙铲除羊鸣教高级神甫，然后回到和谐谷找巴斯洛缪·海墨尔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:542
msgid ""
"Crack the code in the School of Sorcery in the Bracada Desert to reveal the location of the Tomb of Ashwar Nog'Nogoth.  Discover the tomb's location, enter it, and then return it to Stephan Sand in the Pit."
msgstr "到布拉卡达沙漠中的魔法学院破解密码，找到尼格的坟墓，然后进入坟墓彻底搜查一下。任务完成后去地狱城找斯丹芬尼·山德。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:543
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Perfect Bow from the Titans' Stronghold in Avlee and return it to Lawrence Mark in Harmondale."
msgstr "在埃里的泰坦城堡中找到完美之弓，把它交给和谐谷的劳伦斯·马克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:544
msgid ""
"Sabotage the lift in the Red Dwarf Mines in the Bracada Desert then return to Steagal Snick in Avlee."
msgstr "将布拉卡达沙漠中红色矮人矿井的升降机破坏，然后去找埃里的斯第格·斯尼克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:545
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Perfect Bow from the Titans' Stronghold in Avlee and return it to Steagal Snick in Avlee."
msgstr "在埃里的泰坦城堡中找到完美之弓，把它交给埃里的斯第格·斯尼克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:546
msgid ""
"Win five arena challenges then return to Leda Rowan in the Bracada Desert."
msgstr "赢得五场竞技场挑战的胜利，然后回到布拉卡达沙漠中找立德·罗文。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:547
msgid ""
"Destroy all the undead in the Haunted House in the Barrow Downs and return to Frederick Org in Erathia."
msgstr "消灭拜尔德斯的鬼屋中所有的亡灵怪物，然后回到伊拉西亚找福瑞德里克·奥格。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:548
msgid ""
"Raid the Elven Treasury at Castle Navan in the Tularean Forest and return to Frederick Org in Erathia."
msgstr "到图拉利昂森林的那文城堡洗劫精灵宝库，然后回伊拉西亚找福瑞德里克·奥格。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:549
msgid ""
"Calm the trees in the Tularean Forest by speaking to the Oldest Tree then return to Lysander Sweet in the Bracada Desert."
msgstr "去图拉利昂森林与最年长的老树谈话，设法平息森林的愤怒。然后回到布拉卡达找里桑德·斯维特。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:55
msgid "Rescue Shalwend, Lord of Air."
msgstr "救出风之王。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:550
msgid ""
"Solve the secret to the entrance of the Faerie Mound in Avlee and speak to the Faerie King."
msgstr "设法找到神仙冈的秘密出口，然后去里面和仙帝交谈。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:551
msgid ""
"Collect 10,000 gold worth of bounties from the Bounty Hunts in the town halls, then return to Ebednezer Sower in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "设法完成市政厅的赏金任务，赚到10,000个金币，然后回到图拉利昂森林找埃伯登泽·索渥。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:552
msgid ""
"Find the Heart of the Forest in the Mercenary Guild in Tatalia and return it to the Oldest Tree in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "去泰塔利亚的雇佣兵行会夺回古树之心，把它还给图拉利昂森林里的老树。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:555
msgid ""
"Purify the Altar of Evil in the Temple of the Moon on Evenmorn Isle then return to Rebecca Devine in Celeste."
msgstr "去埃弗蒙岛捣毁月亮神庙的祭坛，然后回到赛勒斯提找蕾贝卡·迪万。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:556
msgid ""
"Find the lost pirate map in the Tidewater Caverns in Tatalia and return to Daedalus Falk in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "去泰塔利亚的潮穴找到海盗的地图，然后回到迪雅找达德拉斯·福克。"

# imported from engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:557
msgid ""
"Deface the Altar of Good in the Temple of the Sun on Evenmorn Isle then return to Daedalus Falk in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "去埃弗蒙岛捣毁太阳神殿的祭坛，然后回到迪雅找达德拉斯·福克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:558
msgid ""
"Collect the six golem pieces and construct a complete golem, then return to Thomas Grey in the School of Sorcery."
msgstr "找到人偶肢体的六个部分，把它拼成人形，然后去魔法学院把人偶交给托马斯·格雷。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:560
msgid ""
"Find the Book of Divine Intervention in the Breeding Zone in the Pit and return it to Thomas Grey in the School of Sorcery."
msgstr "去地狱城的再生之地找到普渡众生魔法，然后回到魔法学院把它交给托马斯·格雷。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:561
msgid ""
"Retrieve the lich jars from the Proving Grounds in Celeste and bring them back to Halfgild Wynac in the Pit."
msgstr "去赛勒斯提的净心堂夺回灵魂之坛，然后到地狱城把它交给哈夫·维克。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:562
msgid ""
"Visit the three stonehenge monoliths in Tatalia, the Evenmorn Islands, and Avlee, then return to Anthony Green in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "去泰塔利亚、埃弗蒙岛和埃里三个地方分别找到石圈，然后到图拉利昂森林找安东尼·格林。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:567
msgid ""
"Retrieve the bones of the Dwarf King from the tunnels between Stone City and Nighon and place them in their proper resting place in the Barrow Downs, then return to Anthony Green in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "去石头城与尼根之间的隧道里找到矮人国王的尸骨，把它带到拜尔德斯妥善安葬，然后到图拉利昂森林找安东尼·格林。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:568
msgid ""
"Retrieve the dragon egg from the Dragon Cave in the Land of the Giants and return it to Tor Anwyn in Mount Nighon."
msgstr "去巨人领地的龙穴找龙蛋，然后把它带回尼根见托尔·安文。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:588
msgid ""
"Clean out Castle Harmondale and return to the Butler in the tavern, On the House, in Harmondale."
