msgstr ""
"御水药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对水造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂两三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:173
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Earth Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to earth inflicted damage.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type plus one of any blue reagent type and  two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御土药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对大地造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂三份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:174
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Mind Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to damage inflicted by Mind Magic.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type plus three of any blue reagent type and  one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御心药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对心智魔法造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:175
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Body Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to damage inflicted by Body Magic.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type plus two of any blue reagent type and  three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御体药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对肢体魔法造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:176
msgid ""
"A gray potions - Catalysts -  can be mixed together to result in potion with higher power. Applying Enchant Item spell on strong enough Catalyst will transform it into philsopher stone."
msgstr "灰色药剂-催化剂- 可以混合在一起制成威力更强的药剂。对足够强的催化剂施展附魔物品法术后，它会转化为点金石。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:176
msgid "Philosopher stone hint"
msgstr "点金石提示"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:18
msgid ""
"The White Flaming Potion turns any normal weapon into a weapon of Flame. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "白色火焰药剂能把任何普通武器变成火焰之刃。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:186
msgid "III = 16 & IV = 4"
msgstr "III = 16 且 IV = 4"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:187
msgid "Die Intruder!"
msgstr "去死吧，入侵者！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:188
msgid ""
"Silvertongue,  My spies report there is a small group of would-be heroes traveling about the land trying to put an end to our little Plan for a New World.  They are reportedly seeking permission to visit the Oracle in Free Haven.  You must not permit this to happen--If the Guardian awakens before our plan has matured it will spell the end for both of us.  Deny them permission to visit the Oracle, even if it reveals you to be a traitor.  We need the time your delay will buy us.  Oh yeah...Praise Baa. \n"
"Zenofex"
msgstr ""
"银舌， 我的间谍报告说，有一小群自诩英雄的人在各地游历，妄图终结我们那小小的\"新世界计划\"。据说他们正在寻求获准拜访自由天堂的先知。你绝不能允许此事发生--如果守护者在我们的计划成熟之前苏醒，那将是我们俩的末日。拒绝他们拜访先知，即使这会暴露你是叛徒。我们需要你拖延时间换来的时间。哦对了……赞美巴阿。 \n"
"泽诺费克斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:19
msgid ""
"The White Freezing Potion turns any normal weapon into a weapon of Frost. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "白色冰冻药剂能把任何普通武器变成寒霜之刃。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:190
msgid ""
"Jarvis,  We have determined that the Mayor of Mist is third on our list of enemies, below only Charles d’Sorpigal and Jennica Bradley.  We need you to DELICATELY gain jurisdiction to patrol Mist and the surrounding island, and then to deal with the Mayor accordingly.  If this goes smoothly, then remove Charles and Jennica as well.  Handle this job with great care and you will be rewarded.  Gerrard Blackames"
msgstr ""
"贾维斯， 我们已经确定，迷雾镇镇长在我们敌人名单上位列第三，仅次于查尔斯·德索匹格和詹妮卡·布拉德利。我们需要你\"巧妙地\"获得巡逻迷雾及其周边岛屿的管辖权，然后相应地处置镇长。如果这一切进展顺利，就把查尔斯和詹妮卡也一并解决。谨慎处理这项任务，你将得到丰厚的奖赏。 杰拉德·布莱克姆斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:191
msgid ""
"Damian,  Congratulations on your new assignment.  The Shadow Guild wants you to ambush caravans passing from New Sorpigal to Ironfist or Free Haven.  Under no circumstances are you to divulge that you have any connection to us, or the deal is off and you will find out what happens to those who betray us.  Do as you are told and there won’t be any problems.  Prince of Thieves"
msgstr ""
"达米安， 祝贺你获得新的任命。暗影公会要你在从新索匹格通往铁拳城堡或自由天堂的商路上伏击商队。在任何情况下你都不得泄露你与我们有任何联系，否则交易作废，你也会知道背叛我们的人会有什么下场。照吩咐去做，就不会有任何问题。 盗贼之王"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:191
msgid "Orders from the Shadow Gu"
msgstr "暗影公会的命令"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:192
msgid ""
"My Dear Sulman, Sep 17, 1152\n"
"You have done well, and I hereby promote you to High Priest of the Second Circle.  There is a sum of gold waiting for you in the hands of Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal that he will turn over to you if you tell him the Sandman sent you and show him the Seal on this letter.  Sandman…I like that.    \n"
"The handling of the Roland affair was masterful, and I especially liked the snowstorm touch—it really put the Fear in him, didn’t it?  Superstitious fool!  His removal has moved our timetable ahead by at least two years and has spared us the trouble of assassinating him at a more delicate time.  All arrangements are in place. My minions have engineered the recall of Queen Catherine to her homeland in Erathia to attend the funeral of her father.  She will not return this year, and that only leaves her worthless brat Nicolai and that idiot Regent Wilbur Humphrey running things at the palace. \n"
"The people have begun to sense that something is wrong, that perhaps the gods are angry.  That perhaps…the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven.  Just a few more disasters and there may well be a full-scale rebellion! And we will be waiting at the breach, ready to step in and tell the sheep what to do and when to do it.  Already our temples spread across the land, offering aid to those displaced by disasters, and comfort to the bereaved...   \n"
"Yes.  Remain in New Sorpigal and stay out of sight.  When the time is right you will be contacted and given further instructions.  So take heart, and know that our plan proceeds smoothly and we will be ruling this world soon.  Your position in our hierarchy will be very high!\n"
"--Zenofex"
msgstr ""
"我亲爱的苏尔曼，1152年9月17日\n"
"你做得很好，我在此晋升你为第二圆环的大祭司。在新索匹格的安德沃·波特贝洛手里有一笔金币等着你，只要你告诉他\"睡魔派你来的\"，并让他看这封信上的印章，他就会把钱交给你。睡魔……我喜欢这个称呼。\n"
"罗兰一事的处理堪称大师手笔，我尤其喜欢那场暴风雪的陪衬--那真的吓坏了他，不是吗？迷信的蠢货！他的出局让我们的时间表提前了至少两年，也省去了我们在更微妙的时刻刺杀他的麻烦。所有安排都已就位。我的仆从们策划让凯瑟琳女王返回伊拉西亚故土，参加她父亲的葬礼。她今年不会回来，只剩下她那没用的崽子尼古拉和那个白痴摄政威尔伯·汉弗莱在皇宫里管事。\n"
"人们已经开始感觉到有些不对劲，也许众神发怒了。也许……铁拳家族已经失去了天命。只要再多几场灾难，就完全可能爆发全面叛乱！而我们将在缺口处等待，随时准备介入，告诉那群绵羊该做什么、何时去做。我们的神庙已经遍布这片土地，为流离失所的人提供援助，为丧亲之人送去慰藉……\n"
"是的。留在新索匹格，不要抛头露面。时机成熟时自会有人联系你，给你进一步的指示。所以打起精神来，要知道我们的计划进展顺利，我们很快就会统治这个世界。你在我们阶层中的位置将会非常之高！\n"
"--泽诺费克斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:198
msgid ""
"The contents of this scroll are difficult to understand, mostly because they are in a strange language.  A few of the diagrams, however, show the locations and patrol patterns for the devils."
msgstr "这份卷轴的内容难以理解，主要是因为它们是用一种奇怪的语言写成的。不过，有几幅图解显示了恶魔的位置和巡逻路线。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:199
msgid "Missive from the Archbish"
msgstr "大主教的文书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:199
msgid ""
"The completion of this temple marks a proud day for the Church of the Sun!  We now have temples in every major area in the world.  This temple, surrounded and isolated by nature, will serve as a center of worship for our new followers- the natives of these isles.  May the glory of the Sun shine on you all and bless your work."
msgstr ""
"这座神殿的落成标志着太阳教会引以为傲的一天！我们现在在世界上每个主要地区都有神殿。这座被大自然环绕隔绝的神殿，将作为我们新信徒--这些岛屿原住民--的礼拜中心。愿太阳的荣耀照耀你们所有人，祝福你们的工作。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:144 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:2
msgid ""
"A Black Potion of Rejuvenation can be valuable in correcting the effects of aging.  To mix such a potion you need to find the correct combination of three of each of the base reagents."
msgstr "返老还童黑色药剂在纠正衰老影响方面很有价值。要调配这种药剂，你需要找到三种基础试剂各三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:20
msgid ""
"The White Noxious Potion turns any normal weapon into a weapon of Poison. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "白色剧毒药剂能把任何普通武器变成剧毒之刃。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:200
msgid ""
"Kergmond,   You lack the skill in arms, the dedication, and most importantly, the ability to command to succeed as a Knight.  Your constant failures leave me no choice but to discharge you from the Knights of Enroth.  I would suggest you find a new profession, as you will never master the arts of warfare.  Osric Temper"
msgstr ""
"克格蒙德，  你缺乏武艺、缺乏奉献精神，最重要的是，缺乏作为一名骑士取得成功所需的统御能力。你屡次的失败让我别无选择，只能将你从恩洛斯骑士团中除名。我建议你另谋高就，因为你永远无法掌握战争的艺术。 奥斯里克·坦珀"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:201
msgid ""
"I must commend you on your excellent work.  Continue to undermine the power of the Ironfists, and no one will be left to challenge us.  If you have the opportunity, dangle the carrot of the throne in front of as many people as you can.  If we play our cards right, the humans will kill each other off in a bloody war for the throne.  The Kreegan will reward their loyal followers well."
msgstr ""
"我必须赞扬你的出色工作。继续削弱铁拳家族的势力，就没人能挑战我们了。如果有机会，就尽可能多地在人们面前吊起王座的胡萝卜。如果我们打好这副牌，人类就会在为王座展开的血腥战争中自相残杀。克里根会好好奖赏他们忠诚的追随者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:202
msgid ""
"Continue to work your dark enchantments on the Monolith.  If we are able to corrupt the Monolith fully, we will weaken Loretta’s druids to a point where we can take over.  This task is critical to our future plans, do not fail!"
msgstr ""
"继续对巨石施展你的暗黑魔法。如果我们能彻底腐蚀巨石，就能削弱洛蕾塔的德鲁伊们，直到我们可以接手。这项任务对我们未来的计划至关重要，不许失败！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:202
msgid "Letter from Cedric Druthe"
msgstr "塞德里克·德鲁特的来信"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:203
msgid ""
"Look to nature where civilization fails- the rocks and trees, the sky and earth all hold a power greater than man."
msgstr "在文明失效之处，去求诸自然吧--岩石与树木，天空与大地，都蕴藏着比人类更强大的力量。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:204
msgid ""
"Snergle,  We have been unable to locate Rocklin anywhere.  Whatever hole he crawled into must have swallowed him.  I know you require his death to subjugate the rest of the dwarves, but we have searched all over Enroth and have not been able to locate him.  Lunstone"
msgstr ""
"斯纳格尔， 我们在任何地方都找不到罗克林。不管他爬进了哪个洞，想必都被吞噬了。我知道你需要他的死来降服其余的矮人，但我们搜遍了整个恩洛斯，始终没能找到他。 伦斯通"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:205
msgid ""
"Continue with your work in Castle Ironfist and New Sorpigal.  The buffoons in the south are unprepared for us, so you should be able to reap a wonderful harvest from them.  Remember to make your examples sharp and clear, and the sheep will follow you anywhere."
msgstr ""
"继续你在铁拳城堡和新索匹格的工作。南边的蠢货们对我们毫无防备，你应该能从他们身上收获丰厚的回报。记住要让你的杀鸡儆猴鲜明而清晰，那群绵羊就会对你唯命是从。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:205
msgid "Letter from the Prince of"
msgstr "盗贼之王的来信"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:206
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 514"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。514"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:207
msgid ""
"Gerrard,  Congratulations on your new promotion.  Now, with the Fraternal Order of Silver under your control, you will have greater freedom in seeking out those not hard enough on evil in Enroth.  Eventually, we hope to assist you in removing the most lax of all in the fight against evil, the Ironfists.  Continue to do your work, and your dreams shall be realized.  Zenofex"
msgstr ""
"杰拉德， 祝贺你获得晋升。现在，在你掌控白银兄弟会的情况下，你将拥有更大的自由，去搜捕恩洛斯那些对邪恶不够严厉的人。最终，我们希望帮助你除掉对抗邪恶最松懈的人--铁拳家族。继续你的工作，你的梦想终将实现。 泽诺费克斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:208
msgid "Letter to the Prince of T"
msgstr "致盗贼之王的信"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:208
msgid ""
"Prince,  Anthony Stone has decided to remove you once and for all.  I’m sure you will be seeing his men soon.  For your safety, I’ve prepared a place in the sewers underneath Free Haven for you.  Leave the Guildhall immediately and come to the sewers.  Once the heat has cleared you will be free to return to the Guildhall.  Fetzil"
msgstr ""
"王子， 安东尼·斯通已决定要一劳永逸地除掉你。我相信你很快就会见到他的人了。为了你的安全，我在自由天堂地下的下水道里为你准备了一个藏身之处。立刻离开公会大厅，到下水道来。风头过去后你随时可以自由返回公会大厅。 费齐尔"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:209
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 517"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。517"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:21
msgid ""
"The White Shocking Potion turns any normal weapon into a weapon of Sparks. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "白色光环药剂能把任何普通武器变成火花之刃。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂三份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:210
msgid ""
"Attempting to use force on the Dragon Towers was a mistake, as the lesson at Kriegspire taught us.  We lost nearly a score of our mounts in the attack, and barely managed to deactivate the Tower.  Fortunately, our allies in Icewind Pass have located the Keys needed to turn off the Towers completely.  Soon we will be able to fly again, the peasants scattering before us as the hares scatter before the wolves.  I have been trapped in these caves for too long- even Goliath, my mount, is becoming restless.  With the Dragon Towers shut off, and the armies to the south delayed from reaching us, we will be able to ride free once more."
msgstr ""
"试图对龙塔动武是个错误，克里格斯派尔的教训已经告诉了我们。我们在那次进攻中损失了近二十头坐骑，勉强才设法关闭了那座塔。幸运的是，我们在冰风隘口的盟友找到了完全关闭龙塔所需的钥匙。很快我们就能再次翱翔，农民们在我们面前四散奔逃，就像野兔在狼群面前四散奔逃一样。我被困在这些洞穴里太久了--就连我的坐骑歌利亚也开始躁动不安。等龙塔关闭，南方的军队又无法及时赶到，我们就能再次自由驰骋。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:211
msgid ""
"Damn!  It appears that I left the Memory Crystal in Kriegspire when we fled from my minotaurs.  Never cross a bull with anything!  I should have known the emotional instability of humans and the bad temper of bulls would have resulted in a complete disaster.  I’ll have to make a trip to the castle to get the Crystal, but first I’ll need some creatures to help me get past the minotaurs.  Maybe if I were to create some sort of flying, magical eye…"
msgstr ""
"该死！看来我逃离我的牛头怪时把记忆水晶落在了克里格斯派尔。永远不要拿牛跟任何东西杂交！我早该知道人类的情绪不稳定加上牛的火爆脾气会造成彻底的灾难。我得去趟城堡把水晶拿回来，但首先我需要一些生物帮我穿过牛头怪的封锁。也许我可以制造某种会飞的魔法之眼……"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:212
msgid ""
"…don’t know how he does it, but Lord Eustace is able to disappear from the throne room so quickly sometimes.  I’m not even sure where he goes, there’s only one exit.  I thought there might be a secret exit from the room, but that’s just plain silly.  Besides, I’ve never found any triggers when I searched the…"
msgstr ""
"……不知道他是怎么做到的，但尤斯塔斯领主有时能那么快从王座室消失。我甚至不确定他去了哪里，这里只有一个出口。我想过房间里可能有秘密出口，但那实在太傻了。再说，我搜遍……时也从来没找到过任何机关。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:213
msgid ""
"Good work on completing the first part of the plan.  With this keep, you’ll be able to prevent any interference from the south.  Use the Dragon Tower Keys to shut off the Dragon Towers, and we’ll be able to raid the towns again.  You will be well rewarded for the fine work you have done.  Come to our caves to the northwest when you are finished to collect your payment."
msgstr ""
"计划第一部分的出色完成。有了这座堡垒，你就能阻止来自南方的任何干涉。用龙塔钥匙关闭龙塔，我们就能再次劫掠城镇。你所做的出色工作将得到丰厚奖赏。完成后到我们西北方的洞穴来领取报酬。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:213
msgid "Letter from the Dragon Ri"
msgstr "龙骑士的来信"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:214
msgid ""
"It appears that the crystal you have uncovered is not quite what we had anticipated, but we do acknowledge its use.  We will send a few Clerics to examine this crystal and then decide what to do.  Prepare for them in a few weeks."
msgstr ""
"看来你发现的这块水晶并不是我们所预想的那样，但我们确实承认它有用。我们会派几位牧师来检查这块水晶，然后再决定如何处理。几周后做好准备迎接他们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:214
msgid "Letter from the Temple of"
msgstr "月亮神庙的来信"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:215
msgid ""
"Rats!  Literally, rats.  We had perfected the Curse of the Endless Vermin, but one of the acolytes messed up, and now instead of New Sorpigal plagued, our temple has become infested with more vermin and insects and pests than I’ve seen anywhere.  We’ve tried for two days to reverse the curse and fight back the tides of annoying creatures, but we’ve failed.  Our only option now is to flee and construct a temple somewhere else in the south."
msgstr ""
"该死！字面意义上的，该死的老鼠。我们完善了无尽害虫之咒，但一名见习生搞砸了，现在遭殃的不是新索匹格，而是我们的神庙里到处都是我从未见过的害虫、昆虫和害兽。我们花了两天时间试图逆转诅咒，抵抗这股讨厌生物组成的洪流，但都失败了。我们现在唯一的选择就是逃走，在南边别的地方另建一座神庙。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:216
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 524"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。524"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:217
msgid ""
"We need at least 150% production from this mine for the next few weeks.  I’m going to need arms and armor for my soldiers to quell any discontent about my rule.  Continue to look for any of the more precious metals, like stalt and kergar.  Ignore the gold and gems for right now, we have enough money to last quite a while- the lack of weapons and armor will be our undoing."
msgstr ""
"未来几周，我们需要这座矿至少150%的产量。我需要为我的士兵准备武器和盔甲，以平息任何对我统治的不满。继续寻找更珍贵的金属，比如斯塔尔特和克加。暂时别管黄金和宝石，我们的钱足够撑相当久了--缺乏武器和盔甲才是我们的致命伤。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:218
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 526"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。526"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:219
msgid ""
"My studies with the Crystal of Terrax have grown tiring.  I don’t think I grasp enough of the basic magics to fully understand the lessons of the Crystal.  My time is growing short here, and I think I will be forced to continue my studies as a lich.  I refuse to let go and embrace death, not after my failure in the Succession Wars, and my failures in learning magic.  I’ll use the time I gain from lichdom to train myself more fully in magic and plot my revenge on the Ironfists for what they’ve done to Archibald and myself."
msgstr ""
"我对泰拉克斯水晶的研究越来越令人厌烦。我想我对基础魔法的掌握还不足以完全理解水晶的教义。我在这里的时间所剩无几，我想我将被迫以巫妖之身继续我的研究。我拒绝放手拥抱死亡，不能在我于继承战争中的失败、以及学习魔法的失败之后就这样放弃。我会利用巫妖身份赢得的时间更充分地研习魔法，并策划对铁拳家族的复仇，为他们对阿奇博尔德和我所做的一切。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:219
msgid "Page from Corlagon's Diar"
msgstr "科拉根的日记残页"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:22
msgid ""
"The White Swift Potion turns any normal weapon into a weapon of Swiftness. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus three of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "白色迅捷药剂能把任何普通武器变成迅捷之刃。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:220
msgid ""
"Brother, we soon will need whatever you can provide us in the way of weapons.  With Gharik gone, you have full control over the facilities of the Forge.  I need you to leverage that control into aid for us.  Soon, we will be able to strike at the heart of our enemies, and you will have a place with me as a ruler of Enroth.  Gerrard Blackames"
msgstr ""
"兄弟，我们很快就需要你能提供的任何武器。加里克走了之后，你对熔炉的所有设施拥有完全的控制权。我需要你利用这种控制权来帮助我们。很快，我们就能打击敌人的心脏，而你将与我一同成为恩洛斯的统治者。 杰拉德·布莱克姆斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:221
msgid ""
"If it’s not one thing, it’s another.  Now, Archibald wants me to work on equipping his army with the best items I can create.  I’ve been forced to move here from Alamos so that I can work as quickly as possible in completing that request.  I’ve left the damned Crystal he was so concerned about with my colleagues in Alamos.  Hopefully, they’ll be able to reach some conclusion about it soon, though I wish Archibald would make up his mind on what he wants done."
msgstr ""
"真是按下葫芦浮起瓢。现在，阿奇博尔德想让我为他装备军队，打造我能创造的最好物品。我被迫从阿拉莫斯搬到这里，以便尽快完成他的要求。我把他那么在意的那块该死的水晶留在了阿拉莫斯的同事那里。希望他们能尽快对它得出什么结论，尽管我希望阿奇博尔德能下定决心，想清楚他想让我做什么。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:221
msgid "Scrap from Gharik's Journ"
msgstr "加里克日记残片"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:222
msgid ""
"…remember that our goal is to become the sole druidic order in Enroth.  Nothing can stand in our path as we attempt to cleanse our ranks and remove all opposition.  To this end we will use both the Monolith and what we can find in this old Temple of the Moon to undermine the power of Loretta and her druids everywhere.  We must endure our hardships to grow stronger.  Cedric Druthers"
msgstr ""
"……记住，我们的目标是在恩洛斯成为唯一的德鲁伊教团。在我们试图净化队伍、清除一切反对势力的道路上，没有什么能阻挡我们。为此，我们将同时利用巨石，以及我们能在这座古老的月亮神庙中找到的一切，来削弱洛蕾塔和她遍布各地的德鲁伊的力量。我们必须经受磨难才能变得更强大。 塞德里克·德鲁特斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:223
msgid ""
"Congratulations on successfully completing your transformation.  I hope you are doing well.  Even if you aren’t, I need the Memory Crystal researched and its information revealed.  I have no more time for delays or failures, and I expect you to meet with success where the others have failed.  I know you have a fetish for Crystals, and I expect that you will use your experience with them to finish this job quickly.  When you have the information, bring it to me at Castle Ironfist.  Perhaps we can use what you find to access the rest of the Crystals.  Archibald"
msgstr ""
"祝贺你成功完成转化。希望你一切安好。就算你不好，我也需要记忆水晶得到研究，其中的信息被揭示出来。我再也没有时间可以浪费在拖延和失败上，我期望你在别人失败之处取得成功。我知道你对水晶有种执念，我期望你利用与它们打交道的经验快速完成这项工作。当你获得信息后，把它带到铁拳城堡来见我。也许我们可以利用你的发现来接触其余的水晶。 阿奇博尔德"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:224
msgid ""
"The Ritual of Endless Night is perhaps one of the most difficult to perform.  Not because of what is physically required, but the mental and spiritual anguish that the Mage must endure.  Giving up your humanity, your soul, is not something easily done.  Only the most greedy, the most ambitious, or the heartless can overcome the strain involved."
msgstr ""
"永夜仪式也许是最难施展的仪式之一。不是因为身体上的要求，而是因为法师必须承受的精神与灵魂上的痛苦。放弃你的人性、你的灵魂，不是一件容易的事。只有最贪婪、最野心勃勃、或最无情的人才能克服随之而来的重压。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:225
msgid ""
"...tried to locate the warded doors.  William refused to take any of the amber we found as he believed it was cursed.  After being lost for almost a day, we found a strange creature that teleported us to the entrance.  In exchange for this service it drained William’s life force, but he managed to recover in a few days.  We are halting all further expeditions until we are able to determine…"
msgstr ""
"……试图找到那些被结界保护的门。威廉拒绝带走我们找到的任何琥珀，因为他相信那是被诅咒的。在迷失了将近一天后，我们发现了一个奇怪的生物，把我们传送到了入口。作为这项服务的交换，它吸干了威廉的生命力，但他在几天内就恢复了。在能够确定……之前，我们将停止一切进一步的探险。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:226
msgid ""
"Desist your current experiments into creature evolution and construction.  I need your efforts directed into learning the purpose of and the information contained in this Crystal.  The Oracle apparently uses these for some purpose, and I need you to determine exactly what that is.  This task is more important than creating flightless birds and bull-men or whatever it is you are doing now.  Archibald"
msgstr ""
"停止你目前在生物进化与构造方面的实验。我需要你把精力转向查明这块水晶的用途和其中所含的信息。先知显然在某种目的中使用这些水晶，我需要你确定那究竟是什么。这项任务比你正在制造的不会飞的鸟和牛头人之类的东西重要得多。 阿奇博尔德"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:227
msgid ""
"Please use your knowledge of arcane items and materials to divest this Crystal of the information it contains.  Use the full resources of Alamos if you have to, but do not fail me.  It is imperative that I know whatever information it is the Oracle is attempting to deny me.  Archibald"
msgstr ""
"请运用你对奥术物品和材料的了解，把这块水晶中的信息提取出来。如果有必要，动用阿拉莫斯的全部资源，但不要让我失望。我必须知道先知试图向我隐瞒的任何信息，这是当务之急。 阿奇博尔德"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:228
msgid ""
"East:  Shadow Guildhall West:  Shadow Guild Hideout North:  Free Haven Thieves’ Guild South:  Dragoons’ Caverns"
msgstr "东： 暗影公会大厅 西： 暗影公会藏身处 北： 自由天堂盗贼公会 南： 龙骑兵岩洞"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:229
msgid ""
"When the Landing commences, Captain, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'krik' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way.  Yours is the last key in the sequence."
msgstr ""
"登陆开始时，船长，请把这份密码卷轴带到中央控制室，在提示时说出激活词'krik'。所有高级军官都必须出示他们的密码卷轴和钥匙才能打开通道。你的钥匙是序列中的最后一把。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:23
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Cure Paralysis eliminates the Paralysis condition. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "治愈麻痹白色药剂能消除麻痹状态。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:230
msgid ""
"When the Landing commences, First Mate, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'kcops' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr ""
"登陆开始时，大副，请把这份密码卷轴带到中央控制室，在提示时说出激活词'kcops'。所有高级军官都必须出示他们的密码卷轴和钥匙才能打开通道。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:231
msgid ""
"When the Landing commences, Navigator, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'ulus' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr ""
"登陆开始时，领航员，请把这份密码卷轴带到中央控制室，在提示时说出激活词'ulus'。所有高级军官都必须出示他们的密码卷轴和钥匙才能打开通道。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:232
msgid "Communication Officer's C"
msgstr "通讯官密码"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:232
msgid ""
"When the Landing commences, Communications Officer, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'aruhu' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr ""
"登陆开始时，通讯官，请把这份密码卷轴带到中央控制室，在提示时说出激活词'aruhu'。所有高级军官都必须出示他们的密码卷轴和钥匙才能打开通道。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:233
msgid ""
"When the Landing commences, Engineer, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'yttocs' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr ""
"登陆开始时，工程师，请把这份密码卷轴带到中央控制室，在提示时说出激活词'yttocs'。所有高级军官都必须出示他们的密码卷轴和钥匙才能打开通道。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:234
msgid ""
"When the Landing commences, Doctor, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'yoccm' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr ""
"登陆开始时，医生，请把这份密码卷轴带到中央控制室，在提示时说出激活词'yoccm'。所有高级军官都必须出示他们的密码卷轴和钥匙才能打开通道。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:235
msgid ""
"Here is the key to the combination door you requested.\n"
"\n"
"A.  Trap.\n"
"B.  Opens door 4 and closes door 5.\n"
"C.  Opens door 5 and closes door 4.\n"
"D.  Opens door 1 and closes door 5.\n"
"E.  Opens door 5 and closes door 1.\n"
"F.  Opens door 2 and closes door 4.\n"
"G.  Opens door 6.\n"
"H.  Opens door 3 and closes door 2.\n"
"I.    Opens door 2 and closes door 3.\n"
"J.   Opens door 2 and closes door 1.\n"
"K.  Opens door 6 and closes door 5.\n"
"L.   Opens door 3 and closes door 4.\n"
"M.  Maintenance.\n"
"N.  Opens door 1 and closes door 2.\n"
"O.  Opens door 5 and closes door 6.\n"
"P.  Reset.  \n"
"\n"
"Sincerely, the Drawkcab Monks."
msgstr ""
"这是你要的组合门钥匙。\n"
"\n"
"A.  陷阱。\n"
"B.  打开门4，关闭门5。\n"
"C.  打开门5，关闭门4。\n"
"D.  打开门1，关闭门5。\n"
"E.  打开门5，关闭门1。\n"
"F.  打开门2，关闭门4。\n"
"G.  打开门6。\n"
"H.  打开门3，关闭门2。\n"
"I.    打开门2，关闭门3。\n"
"J.   打开门2，关闭门1。\n"
"K.  打开门6，关闭门5。\n"
"L.   打开门3，关闭门4。\n"
"M.  维护。\n"
"N.  打开门1，关闭门2。\n"
"O.  打开门5，关闭门6。\n"
"P.  复位。  \n"
"\n"
"谨上，德拉克卡布僧侣。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:24
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Divine Restoration eliminates all conditions except stoned, dead or eradicated. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"神圣恢复白色药剂能消除除石化、死亡或灰飞烟灭之外的所有状态。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:167 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:25
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Divine Cure is more powerful than the Potion of Cure Wounds. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type and any three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "神圣医疗白色药剂比治疗伤口药剂更加强大。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:255
msgid ""
"The ritual described on this scroll seems to be a complex magical formula requiring the caster to face the target from a distance and follow a lengthy and exacting series of steps.  You can't figure out what the effect of the spell will be once it's been cast."
msgstr ""
"这张卷轴上描述的仪式似乎是一种复杂的魔法公式，要求施法者从一定距离面对目标，并遵循一系列漫长而精确的步骤。你无法判断该法术施放后会产生什么效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:256
msgid ""
"I have hidden this letter here hoping it will be found by someone loyal to the Crown.  That I am even able to write it is a miracle--my captors were too stupid to take my writing materials--and I need many more miracles to survive this predicament.  All of my men were lost in the battle against the devils, leaving only Tanir, Ragnar, and myself alive.  Lord Ragnar is in a bad way, and I fear he will not survive the night.  Better for him, perhaps.  Since we have not yet been killed, I'm guessing we are being saved for something special.  Whatever it is, as long as there is life, there is hope.  They will probably carry Tanir and I from this awful place to another awful place to ransom us or torture us for information.  Whatever our fate, you, my loyal subject, must work to ensure the survival of the kingdom and our world.  These devils are a threat much worse than Archibald ever was, and will require the most desperate measures to defeat.  Take those measures, even if it means releasing my evil brother from his tomb of stone.  Above all, seek the advice of the Oracle in Free Haven.  I hear my captors coming down the hall!  Tell my wife and son I love them, and DON'T TRUST SULMAN! He is a traitor.  Good Luck!  --Roland Ironfist, King of Enroth"
msgstr ""
"我把这封信藏在这里，希望它被某个忠于王室的人发现。我能写出它本身就是个奇迹--我的看守们蠢得连我的书写工具都没收--而要在这困境中活命，我还需要更多的奇迹。我所有的部下都在与恶魔的战斗中阵亡了，只剩下塔尼尔、拉格纳和我还活着。拉格纳领主情况很糟，我担心他熬不过今晚。对他来说，或许这样更好。既然我们还没有被杀，我猜我们是被留作特殊用途。不管那是什么，只要有生命，就有希望。他们很可能会把塔尼尔和我从这个可怕的地方带到另一个可怕的地方，去勒索赎金或拷问情报。无论我们的命运如何，你，我忠诚的子民，必须努力确保王国和我们世界的存续。这些恶魔构成的威胁比阿奇博尔德任何时候都严重得多，需要采取最极端的手段才能击败。采取那些手段，即使那意味着把我邪恶的兄弟从他的石棺中释放出来。最重要的是，去自由天堂寻求先知的建议。我听到看守们走过走廊了！告诉我的妻子和儿子我爱他们，还有，别相信苏尔曼！他是个叛徒。祝好运！ --罗兰·铁拳，恩洛斯国王"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:257
msgid "Congratulations!  I hereby proclaim you all Super-Goobers!"
msgstr "恭喜！我在此宣布你们都是超级大笨蛋！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:26
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Divine Power is a more powerful spell point restorative than is the Magic Potion. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any blue reagent type and any three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "神圣力量白色药剂是一种比魔法药剂更强效的魔法值恢复剂。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:169 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:27
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Luck Boost temporarily boosts your luck just when you need it. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type and three of any blue reagents."
msgstr "白色运气药剂会在你最需要的时候临时增强你的运气。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂三份以及任意蓝色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:28
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Fire Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to fire inflicted damage.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"火系抗性白色药剂会临时提高你对火焰造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:29
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Air Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to air inflicted damage.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御风药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对空气造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂三份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:3
msgid ""
"A Black Potion of Pure Might is any adventurer's dream.  The addition to permanent might can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒力量黑色药剂是每一位冒险者的梦想。永久力量的提升能让任何人都变成战斗机器。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂四份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:30
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Water Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to water inflicted damage.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus three of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "御水药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对水造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:31
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Earth Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to earth inflicted damage.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御土药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对大地造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂三份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:32
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Mind Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to damage inflicted by Mind Magic.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus three of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御心药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对心智魔法造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:33
msgid ""
"The White Potion of Body Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to damage inflicted by Body Magic.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"御体药剂白色药剂会临时提高你对肢体魔法造成的伤害的抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:34
msgid "Certificate of Authentica"
msgstr "真品证书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:34
msgid ""
"I Dadeross, certify, that the individuals who bear this letter with my seal, do indeed carry with them the Axe of Balthazar. Treat these fine warriors as family and give them all possible honors.  Dadeross, Journeyman Merchant of Alvar Axe Master of the Ravage Roaming Herd"
msgstr ""
"我，达德洛斯，在此证明，凡持有这封盖有我印信的书信之人，确实随身携带着巴尔萨煞之斧。请把这位优秀的战士当作家人对待，并给予他一切应有的荣誉。 达德洛斯，阿尔瓦行商学徒，掠夺游牧部落的斧术大师"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:35
msgid ""
"My Brethren,  I have decided to find the Sarcophagus of Korbu in the hopes that Korbu himself may be able to provide the answers I seek.  The trip will be long and dangerous, for the denizens of Ravenshore, and the Dragon Hunters of Garrote Gorge will not receive any of our kind with a warm welcome. I will seek out what shelter I can on my way to Ravage Roaming.  I leave these notes behind to document my journey. If I am not heard from again, perhaps you will find Korbu.  Ciatlen Venitius"
msgstr ""
"我的同胞们， 我已决定去寻找可布的棺椁，希望可布本人能提供我所追寻的答案。此行漫长而危险，因为渡鸦海滨的居民以及绞刑峡谷的猎龙人不会以热情的姿态接待我们这类生物。我会在前往掠夺游牧的路上尽力寻找栖身之所。我留下这些笔记记录我的旅程。如果此后杳无音讯，也许你们能找到可布。 西亚特兰·维崔那斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:36
msgid ""
"My Brethren,  As I had feared, Ravenshore is not a friendly place to our kind.  I was chased from the city limits by a torch wielding crowd.  It was like something from one of the stories told to frighten us when we first undergo the hunger, meant to scare us away from populated areas.  The dire wolves of this area did not seem to mind my presence, perhaps they recognize a kindred spirit. Tomorrow I will try to make it to Garrote Gorge, hopefully I will find shelter there.  Ciatlen Venitius"
msgstr ""
"我的同胞们， 正如我所担心的，渡鸦海滨对我们这类生物并不友善。我被一群举着火把的人群赶出了城界。这就像是那些在初次经历饥饿时用来吓唬我们的故事里的情节，意在让我们远离人群聚居之处。此地的恐狼似乎并不在意我的出现，也许它们认出了同类。明天我将尝试前往绞刑峡谷，希望在那里能找到栖身之所。 西亚特兰·维崔那斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:37
msgid ""
"My Brethren,  Garrote Gorge is a battlefield.  The Dragon slaying knights of Charles Quixote and the Flights of Deftclaw Redreaver battle daily, with no end to their conflict in site. This battle seems senseless.  At least we have reached an uneasy relationship with the Necromancers of Shadowspire upon which we feed. Perhaps Korbu was indeed mad, for at least we do not battle to feed. Or is it right that another race give up their lives to sustain us?  I wonder.  Tomorrow I leave for Ravage Roaming.  None of our kind has been to this region since Korbu left us.  I do not know what I will find. Answers? Korbu himself?  Ciatlen Venitius"
msgstr ""
"我的同胞们， 绞刑峡谷是一个战场。查尔斯·吉科德的屠龙骑士与达夫克劳·红斧的飞行部队日复一日地交战，这场冲突似乎永无休止。这场战斗似乎毫无意义。至少我们与赖以进食的影旋山脉亡灵法师达成了某种不安稳的关系。也许可布确实疯了，因为至少我们不是为了进食而战。或者说，让另一个种族付出生命来供养我们，这难道是正确的吗？我思忖着。明天我将出发前往掠夺游牧。自从可布离开我们之后，我们一族还没有人到过那片地区。我不知道自己会找到什么。答案？还是可布本人？ 西亚特兰·维崔那斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:38
msgid ""
"My Brethren,  Here in the Crypt of Korbu I have found nothing but tragedy.  Korbu has perished.  Perhaps he no longer had the will to prey upon others to sustain himself.  Guardian Nagas have infested the crypt, and reaching Korbu was indeed difficult.  Instead of answers, I find myself confronted with only more questions.  Why would Korbu accept his own death, instead of taking the life of another for sustenance. The greatest of our kind is nothing but a pile of bones and dust.  I will bring these remains back to the elders, perhaps they will find the answers that I cannot.  Ciatlen Venitius"
msgstr ""
"我的同胞们， 在这可布地穴里，我找到的只有悲剧。可布已经亡故。也许他再也没有意愿去捕食他人以维持自身。守护娜迦已经占据了地穴，到达可布身边确实十分艰难。我没有得到答案，反而只遇到了更多的问题。为什么可布甘愿接受自己的死亡，而不是夺取他人的生命来维生。我们一族最伟大的存在，如今只剩一堆白骨与尘土。我会把这些遗骸带回去交给长老们，也许他们能找到我找不到的答案。 西亚特兰·维崔那斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:39
msgid ""
"My Brethren,  I fed today upon the body of a young knight. For the first time since I experienced the hunger, I felt something as I drained this woman of her life. I have no way to describe this sensation, only that it was very unpleasant. My mind wanders, and I think more and more of the reasons why Korbu left us so long ago. We experience eternal life, but at the cost of the lives of others.    There was a terrible wind storm from the north today.  I saw trees caught in the storm high about the northern range of the Dragon's Teeth.  I have never seen such a storm.   I will continue back through Ravenshore and then onto home.  Ciatlen Venitius"
msgstr ""
"我的同胞们， 今天我以一名年轻骑士的尸体为食。自从经历饥饿以来，我第一次在吸干这位女子的生命时感受到了某种东西。我无法描述这种感觉，只知道它非常令人不快。我的思绪飘忽不定，越来越频繁地想起可布为何在那么久之前离开我们。我们拥有永恒的生命，但代价是他人的生命。 今天从北方刮来了一场可怕的风暴。我看到树木被风暴卷起，高悬于龙牙山脉北缘的上空。我从未见过这样的风暴。 我将继续穿过渡鸦海滨，然后回家。 西亚特兰·维崔那斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:4
msgid ""
"A Black Potion of Pure Accuracy is any archer's dream.  The addition to permanent accuracy can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any yellow reagent type, plus two of any red reagent type and one of the blue reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒准确黑色药剂是每一位弓箭手的梦想。永久准确的提升能让任何人都变成战斗机器。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意黄色试剂四份、任意红色试剂两份以及任意蓝色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:40
msgid ""
"Brethren,  I approached the outskirts of Ravenshore today.  As I did, a strange glow emanated from the center of the town.  I could feel dark magics in the air.  After considering my reception the last time through this area, I have decided to head north through Alvar, and then east to the Ironsand Desert. From there I will return home to Shadowspire.  As I fed again this night, I felt that same feeling of dread as when I fed on the young knight.  I still see the terror in her eyes. Perhaps Korbu was right?  Is it wrong that we take lives to live?  Ciatlen Venitius"
msgstr ""
"同胞们， 今天我接近了渡鸦海滨的郊区。就在这时，小镇中心散发出一道奇异的光芒。我能感觉到空气中弥漫着暗黑魔法。考虑到上次经过此地时的遭遇，我决定向北穿过阿尔瓦，然后向东前往铁砂沙漠。从那里我将返回影旋山脉的家乡。今夜进食时，我又感受到了那种与吞噬年轻骑士时相同的恐惧感。我仍然看见她眼中的恐惧。也许可布是对的？我们靠夺取生命而活，这真的错了吗？ 西亚特兰·维崔那斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:41
msgid ""
"I was burned today.  The cover here in Alvar is few and far between.  The sun has scarred my face and hands. If only I had thought to ask the elders for a Nightshade Amulet to protect me.  Then my journey surely would have been a swift one.   I have not fed since Ravenshore as I do not wish to experience the sense of dread I picked up in Garrote Gorge. Perhaps I will feed upon the Trolls of Ironsand when I reach there. I know that the Cyclops in that region are non-hostile to our kind since we arranged for a Alvarian merchant caravan to be waylaid near their camp.  I will rest in their Larder and then return home.    Ciatlen"
msgstr ""
"我今天被灼伤了。阿尔瓦这里可供藏身之处少之又少。太阳在我的脸上和手上留下了伤疤。要是我当初记得向长老们讨要一枚夜影护符来保护自己就好了。那样我的旅程想必会顺利得多。 自从离开渡鸦海滨后我就没有再进食，因为我不愿再体会在绞刑峡谷沾染上的那种恐惧感。也许到达铁砂后我会以那里的巨魔为食。我知道该地区的独眼巨人对我们一族并不敌对，因为我们曾安排一支阿尔瓦商队在他们营地附近遇袭。我会在他们的储藏室里休息，然后回家。 西亚特兰"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:42
msgid ""
"I am through.  Korbu was right.  It is not right for us to take the lives of others to sustain ourselves.  The feeling I have been experiencing must be remorse.  This must be what Korbu felt as well.  I will not feed again.  I will lay down as Korbu did and perish here in the Cyclops Larder.  It is my hope that Korbu will be forgotten and that his remains will be left here. I will secret them away, as I believe that he would not wish to experience life again.  Ancient legends of our people speak of a curse that was placed upon us.  It is my belief that we are indeed cursed.  Once you have felt remorse the only desire you have is for forgiveness.  For me this is now only a dream.  Ciatlen"
msgstr ""
"我受够了。可布是对的。我们靠夺取他人的生命来维持自身，这并不正确。我一直感受到的那种感觉必定是悔恨。这一定也是可布所感受到的。我不会再进食了。我会像可布那样躺下，在这独眼巨人储藏室里死去。我希望可布被人遗忘，他的遗骸留在这里。我会把它们藏好，因为我相信他不愿再经历一次生命。我们民族的古老传说提到曾施加在我们身上的诅咒。我相信我们确实受到了诅咒。一旦你感受到了悔恨，你唯一的渴望便是宽恕。对我来说，这如今只是一个梦。 西亚特兰"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:43
msgid "Dadeross' Letter to Fellm"
msgstr "达德洛斯致费尔蒙的信"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:43
msgid ""
"Guildmaster Fellmoon,  I am sending this to inform you of disturbing events on the Dagger Wound Islands. My caravan is trapped here, but that is the least of it. Soon after we arrived, a great volcano rose from the nearby sea. It pushed before it a great wave which washed away the bridges connecting the islands to one another and to the mainland. Day and night the island is pelted by burning rocks hurled from the volcano. On top of all, the Regnans have taken this as opportunity to raid. I tell you, it is chaos!  Caravan Leader Dadeross"
msgstr ""
"费尔蒙会长， 我写此信是为了告知您匕伤岛上发生的令人不安的事件。我的商队被困在这里，但这还是最次要的。我们抵达后不久，附近的海中升起了一座巨大的火山。它推动着巨大的海浪冲毁了连接各岛屿之间以及岛屿与大陆之间的桥梁。日夜之间，岛屿不断受到火山抛出的燃烧岩石的袭击。雪上加霜的是，雷格那人趁此机会发动了劫掠。我跟您说，这里一片混乱！ 商队首领达德洛斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:44
msgid ""
"Dear Hunter,  Recent matters require me to request your cooperation and assistance. Specifically, I would like you to gift my guild immediate use of your boats for an indefinite period of time. Oh, I imagine this will impact your business, so let me make, as a gift in return, assurances of the continuing safety of your lovely daughter, Irabelle. I understand she is a pupil at the Alvar Academy. It would be a pity if her studies were interrupted by misfortune, no? I'm sure we agree, so I thank you in advance for your generosity.  Elgar Fellmoon"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的猎人， 近期的事务要求我请求您的合作与协助。具体来说，我希望您把您的船只无限期借给我行会使用。哦，我想这会影响您的生意，所以作为回礼，请收下我对您可爱的女儿伊拉贝尔持续安全的保证。据我所知她是阿尔瓦学院的学生。如果她的学业因不幸而中断，那将十分遗憾，不是吗？我相信我们会达成共识，因此提前感谢您的慷慨。 艾尔加·费尔蒙"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:45
msgid ""
"…and now we make ready to win what we have so long sought. The improbable wasp nest lies in the canyon just north of our campsite and the prize within will be ours. I'm sure we'll succeed where so many others have failed. Not to say they were not stout enough, but rather that they were ill-prepared.  It meant several months of careful collecting, but we have with us the magic we will need to maneuver in the hive. All the gold we spent gathering the scrolls will be well worth the investment. Money will not be a problem once we..."
msgstr ""
"……现在我们准备去赢取我们觊觎已久的战利品。那不可思议的黄蜂巢就位于我们营地正北的峡谷中，里面的宝物将属于我们。我相信我们会在众多失败者中取得成功。不是说他们不够强悍，而是他们准备不足。这花了好几个月仔细收集，但我们已经带上了在蜂巢中行动所需的魔法。我们花在收集卷轴上的所有黄金都将物超所值。一旦我们……金钱将不再是问题。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:46
msgid "History of the Vault of T"
msgstr "时光宝库史"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:46
msgid ""
"Located in what is currently the city of Ravenshore, the Vault of Time is a curious relic of the Amberly Dynasty, the monarchy which ruled the areas along the southern coast of Jadame during the period 342-621 R.E. The last Amberlian emperor, Thorn III (589-633 R.E.) knowing the empire was crumbling, sealed his regalia away in the specially constructed vault to safeguard them for a day when he or his kin could return the empire to its former glory.  Now that the Amberlians have definitely passed into history, Thorn's vault has become the focus of many treasure hunters. The magics sealing the vault have proven potent against any attempt to penetrate it. To this day, Thorn's treasure remains locked away from the eyes of all."
msgstr ""
"位于当今渡鸦海滨城内的时光宝库，是琥珀王朝的一件奇特遗物。琥珀王朝是公元342年至621年间统治贾达姆南海岸地区的王朝。琥珀王朝的最后一位皇帝索恩三世（公元589年至633年在位）深知帝国正在崩塌，便将他的王权徽记封存于这座特别建造的宝库中，以待他或他的后人有一天能让帝国重振昔日荣光。如今琥珀王朝已成历史，索恩的宝库成为众多寻宝者关注的焦点。封印宝库的魔法经证明足以抵御任何渗透的尝试。时至今日，索恩的宝藏依然深藏不露，不为世人所见。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:47
msgid ""
"STONE PORTALS  These strange devices appear as stone squares set in the ground, and have short pillars at each corner. It seems they were built by the temple builders as a means of transportation between the islands. Magic is clearly involved. They are powered by enchanted onyx stones. I found one myself near the temple, and I know Onefang has another. Each portal requires its own stone for power.  ABANDONED TEMPLE  I have uncovered an engraving which seems to suggest that the abandoned temple at the northwest island connects underwater to the island to the northeast. If this is so, the builders possessed very advanced construction techniques."
msgstr ""
"石制传送门 这些奇特的装置看起来像是嵌入地面的方形石板，每个角落都有短柱。它们似乎是神殿建造者建造的，用于岛屿之间的交通。魔法显然参与其中。它们由附魔的黑曜石驱动。我亲自在神殿附近找到过一块，而且我知道独牙还有另一块。每座传送门都需要它自己的石头来供能。 废弃神殿 我发现了一幅雕刻，似乎暗示西北岛屿的废弃神殿通过水下与东北岛屿相连。如果确实如此，那么建造者掌握了非常先进的建造技术。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:48
msgid ""
"Arion Hunter,  We will be watching you to guarantee your compliance with Zog's requests.  Any deviation from his orders, and the Pack Master will lead the Dire Wolves into your hidden sanctuary and drive you out into the sea.   Remember, your opinions are not requested, only your compliance.  Deliver the reports on the Merchants of Alvar to the Dread Pirate Stanley as ordered and your family will be returned to you.  Eventually.    Zog"
msgstr ""
"艾瑞安·韩特， 我们会监视你，以确保你遵从佐格的要求。任何偏离他命令的行为，都会让狼群之主率领恐狼冲入你隐蔽的庇护所，把你赶进大海。 记住，没人征求你的意见，只要求你服从。按命令把关于阿尔瓦商人的报告交给恐怖海盗史坦力，你的家人就会被还给你。迟早会的。 佐格"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:49
msgid ""
"ANSWER SECTION  Riddles, page 56: 1) Fifteen Ducks!  2) The Troll's Grandmother  3) Prison  Riddles, page 57: 1) Egg  2) The chicken was upside-down. 3) Wasp Jelly on a Cracker  Riddles, page 58: 1) Ogre Feet 2) Inside 3) They made soup."
msgstr ""
"答案部分 谜语，第56页：1)十五只鸭子！ 2)巨魔的祖母 3)监狱 谜语，第57页：1)蛋 2)鸡是倒着的。 3)黄蜂蜜涂在饼干上 谜语，第58页：1)食人魔的脚 2)里面 3)他们做了汤。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:5
msgid ""
"The Black Potion of Pure Personality will add to a character's permanent personality. This will increase the total spell points based off Personality. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus four of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒个性黑色药剂会提升角色的永久个性。这将基于个性值增加总魔法值。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂四份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:50
msgid ""
"Plan: Use old siege door system to drain lair.  Lever Order: A, B, C, E, G, D, J, C, E, F, D, I, C, Lowest  Reset: A  Tritons: Watch out!"
msgstr "计划：利用旧攻城门系统排干巢穴。 杠杆顺序：A、B、C、E、G、D、J、C、E、F、D、I、C、最低 复位：A 三叉戟人：小心！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:51
msgid ""
"Finally! After years of failure, we've had a successful test fire of the Cannonball of Dominion. Not only did the cannon not explode, the shot produced the expected, wide area of fury destruction. Now, the challenge is to develop a suitable ship mounting for the experimental cannon located outside the fortress. Once we've accomplished this, we will forever rule the seas! Our ships will be capable of sinking entire fleets with a single shot from just one of these new cannons!"
msgstr ""
"终于！经过多年的失败，我们成功试射了支配炮弹。不仅大炮没有爆炸，炮弹还产生了预期的、大范围的毁灭性怒火破坏。现在，挑战在于为堡垒外的那门实验性大炮开发合适的舰载安装架。一旦我们完成这项工作，我们将永远称霸海洋！我们的舰船将仅凭一门这种新大炮的一发炮弹就能击沉整支舰队！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:52
msgid ""
"It is inevitable; the temple is lost to us. Never did we think that our own creations would turn against us. Nor did we think they could so handily bring about our annihilation. Only I and my assistant, Khsth'thck, are all that remain of the Relic Wardens. This note is for any of the Keepers of the True Vision who come to reclaim the temple.  Khsth'thck and I have already secured the holy idol. Remember, it is the sixth plate, not the fourteenth! We lost Warden Rsh'Dhx when that mistake was made last. I only pray the defenses will hold until you arrive.  Faithfully yours,  Yvwch'vhs xhl'brck, High Nestmaster"
msgstr ""
"大势已去；这座神殿我们守不住了。我们从未想过自己亲手创造的东西会反噬我们。也从未想过它们能如此轻易地带来我们的覆灭。圣物守卫如今只剩我和我的助手克斯特克。这张便条是留给任何前来收复神殿的真视守护者的。 克斯特克和我已经藏好了圣像。记住，是第六块石板，不是第十四块！上次犯下那个错误时我们失去了守卫尔什德克斯。我只祈祷防御能撑到你们到来。 你忠实的， 伊夫奇夫赫斯·赫尔布鲁克，高巢主"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:53
msgid ""
"The black potion of Divine Boost temporarily increases all your Seven Statistics. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of eleven reagents: of which there are always three blue and three yellow ones. The remaining five differ in the many possible mixes that lead to obtaining this potion."
msgstr ""
"神圣提升黑色药剂会临时提升你的全部七项属性。要调配这种药剂，你需要十一份试剂的正确组合：其中始终有三份蓝色和三份黄色。其余五份在通往此药剂的多种可行配方中各不相同。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:54
msgid ""
"The black potion of Divine Protection combines the effects of the white resistance boosting potions, temporarily increasing all your resistances. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of twelve reagents: of which there are always three red and three yellow ones. The remaining six differ in the many possible mixes that lead to obtaining this potion."
msgstr ""
"神圣保护黑色药剂结合了各白色抗性提升药剂的效果，临时提升你的全部抗性。要调配这种药剂，你需要十二份试剂的正确组合：其中始终有三份红色和三份黄色。其余六份在通往此药剂的多种可行配方中各不相同。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:55
msgid ""
"The black potion of Divine Transcendence temporarily increases a character’s level. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of ten reagents: three of each color plus an additional one of a random color."
msgstr "神圣超越黑色药剂会临时提升角色的等级。要调配这种药剂，你需要十份试剂的正确组合：每种颜色各三份，再加上随机颜色的一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:56
msgid ""
"Essence of Luck increases a character’s Luck by 15, while subtracting 2 from the other statistics. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "运气精髓药剂会提升角色15点运气，同时从其他属性中扣除2点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:57
msgid ""
"The magnificent Potion of the Gods increases all seven statistics of a character by 20, once. There are many ways to mix this potion, but all involve ten reagents: four of one type and three of the other two types."
msgstr "宏伟的众神药剂一次性地将角色的全部七项属性各提升20点。调配这种药剂的方法有很多，但都需要十份试剂：一种四份，另外两种各三份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:58
msgid ""
"The Potion of Doom increases a character’s Seven Statistics, Life, Spell Points, Armor Class and Resistances by 1 at the cost of magically aging them 5 years. This potion can be mixed in more than one way, but always requires eight reagents: two of one type and three of the other two types."
msgstr ""
"末日药剂会将角色的七项属性、生命、魔法值、防御等级和各项抗性各提升1点，代价是魔法性地使角色衰老5年。这种药剂调配方法不止一种，但总是需要八份试剂：一种两份，另外两种各三份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:59
msgid ""
"Pure Fire Resistance increases your character’s Fire Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least three red, four yellow and two blue reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒御火药剂一次性地将角色的火焰抗性提升40点。它是调配最复杂的药剂之一，需要整整十二份试剂。这种药剂的调配方法不止一种，但每一种都至少涉及三份红色、四份黄色和两份蓝色试剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:6
msgid ""
"A Black Potion of Pure Endurance is any adventurer's dream.  The addition to permanent endurance can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine, increasing their hit points far beyond normal.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus four of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒耐力黑色药剂是每一位冒险者的梦想。永久耐力的提升能让任何人都变成战斗机器，使其生命值远超常人。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂四份以及任意黄色试剂一份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:60
msgid ""
"Pure Air Resistance increases your character’s Air Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least four red, four blue and one yellow reagent."
msgstr ""
"永恒御风药剂一次性地将角色的空气抗性提升40点。它是调配最复杂的药剂之一，需要整整十二份试剂。这种药剂的调配方法不止一种，但每一种都至少涉及四份红色、四份蓝色和一份黄色试剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:61
msgid ""
"Pure Water Resistance increases your character’s Water Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least two red, three yellow and four blue reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒御水药剂一次性地将角色的水系抗性提升40点。它是调配最复杂的药剂之一，需要整整十二份试剂。这种药剂的调配方法不止一种，但每一种都至少涉及两份红色、三份黄色和四份蓝色试剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:62
msgid ""
"Pure Earth Resistance increases your character’s Earth Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least four red, three yellow and two blue reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒御土药剂一次性地将角色的土系抗性提升40点。它是调配最复杂的药剂之一，需要整整十二份试剂。这种药剂的调配方法不止一种，但每一种都至少涉及四份红色、三份黄色和两份蓝色试剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:63
msgid ""
"Pure Body Resistance increases your character’s Body Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least two red, four yellow and three blue reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒御体药剂一次性地将角色的肢体抗性提升40点。它是调配最复杂的药剂之一，需要整整十二份试剂。这种药剂的调配方法不止一种，但每一种都至少涉及两份红色、四份黄色和三份蓝色试剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:64
msgid ""
"Pure Mind Resistance increases your character’s Mind Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least three red, two yellow and four blue reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒御心药剂一次性地将角色的心智抗性提升40点。它是调配最复杂的药剂之一，需要整整十二份试剂。这种药剂的调配方法不止一种，但每一种都至少涉及三份红色、两份黄色和四份蓝色试剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:65
msgid ""
"Essence of Might increases a character’s Might by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Intellect. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "力量精髓药剂会提升角色15点力量，同时从智力中扣除5点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:66
msgid ""
"Essence of Intellect increases a character’s Intellect by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Might. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "智力精髓药剂会提升角色15点智力，同时从力量中扣除5点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:67
msgid ""
"Essence of Personality increases a character’s Personality by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Speed. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "个性精髓药剂会提升角色15点个性，同时从速度中扣除5点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:68
msgid ""
"Essence of Accuracy increases a character’s Accuracy by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Endurance. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "准确精髓药剂会提升角色15点准确，同时从耐力中扣除5点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:69
msgid ""
"Essence of Endurance increases a character’s Endurance by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Accuracy. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "耐力精髓药剂会提升角色15点耐力，同时从准确中扣除5点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:7
msgid ""
"The Black Potion of Pure Intellect will add to a character's permanent intellect, increasing the total spell points based off of intellect. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and four of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒智力黑色药剂会提升角色的永久智力，从而基于智力值增加总魔法值。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂一份、任意蓝色试剂两份以及任意黄色试剂四份的正确组合。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:70
msgid ""
"Essence of Speed increases a character’s Speed by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Personality. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "速度精髓药剂会提升角色15点速度，同时从个性中扣除5点。调配这种药剂需要六份试剂，任一种颜色四份，其余两种颜色各一份。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:71
msgid ""
"The Protection from Magic potion grants the drinker the effect of the spell for a duration dependent on potion strength. This potion requires seven reagents to mix: two of each type plus the seventh, which can be of any color. This means the potion can be obtained in three distinct ways."
msgstr ""
"御魔奇术药剂会为饮用者提供该法术的效果，持续时间取决于药剂的强度。调配这种药剂需要七份试剂：每种类型两份，再加上第七份，可以是任意颜色。这意味着这种药剂可以通过三种不同的方式调配获得。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-2.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:72
msgid ""
"Hello, caravaneer.\n"
"\n"
"I have an offer for you, which would eclipse the career of any adventurer! Meet me in Murmurwoods, inside circle of stones. Won't trust more details to paper.\n"
"I will be there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n"
"\n"
"V."
msgstr ""
"商队领队，你好。\n"
"\n"
"我有一个提议，足以让任何冒险者的职业生涯黯然失色！请到低语之森的巨石圈里与我会面。更多详情，恕我不便诉诸笔墨。\n"
"你们什么时候来，我就什么时候在那里等候。不过，哪怕这有违我们组织的规矩，我也要恳求你们，不要拖得太久。\n"
"\n"
"V."

# imported from zh-cn-todo-2.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:78
msgid ""
"Hello, nobles.\n"
"\n"
"I have an offer for you, which would eclipse the fate of any hero! Meet me in empty tower of Clancer's laborathory in Tularean forest. Won't trust more details to paper.\n"
"I will be there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n"
"\n"
"V."
msgstr ""
"贵族们，你们好。\n"
"\n"
"我有一个提议，足以让任何英雄的命运黯然失色！请到图拉雷安森林中科兰克实验室的空塔里与我会面。更多详情，恕我不便诉诸笔墨。\n"
"你们什么时候来，我就什么时候在那里等候。不过，哪怕这有违我们组织的规矩，我也要恳求你们，不要拖得太久。\n"
"\n"
"V."

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:8
msgid ""
"The Black Potion of Pure Speed could be the answer for a party who just doesn't get the jump on the monsters.  The addition to permanent speed could be just what is needed to allow you to recover and act before the monsters do.  You can never be too quick. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒速度黑色药剂或许正是总是抢不到怪物先手的小队的答案。永久速度的提升也许正是让你能在怪物行动之前恢复并出手所需的一切。你永远不会嫌自己太快。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂四份、任意蓝色试剂一份以及任意黄色试剂两份的正确组合。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-2.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:84
msgid ""
"Hello, adventurers.\n"
"\n"
"I have an offer for you, which would eclipse the fate of any hero! Meet me in Abdul's Resort in Dragonsand. Won't trust more details to paper.\n"
"I will be near pedestal there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n"
"\n"
"V."
msgstr ""
"冒险者们，你们好。\n"
"\n"
"我有一个提议，足以让任何英雄的命运黯然失色！请到龙沙漠的阿卜杜度假村与我会面。更多详情，恕我不便诉诸笔墨。\n"
"你们什么时候来，我就什么时候在那里的基座旁等候。不过，哪怕这有违我们组织的规矩，我也要恳求你们，不要拖得太久。\n"
"\n"
"V."

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:9
msgid ""
"The Black Potion of Pure Luck could be the answer for a party who is disarm trap skill challenged.  The addition to permanent luck could be just what is needed to allow you to duck before a trap goes off.  You can never have too much luck. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus three of any blue reagent type and three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"永恒运气黑色药剂或许正是拆陷阱技能欠佳的小队的答案。永久运气的提升也许正是让你能在陷阱触发前及时躲开所需的一切。你永远不会嫌自己运气太好。要调配这种药剂，你需要任意红色试剂两份、任意蓝色试剂三份以及任意黄色试剂三份的正确组合。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-2.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:91
msgid "Advertisment."
msgstr "广告。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-2.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:91
msgid ""
"Fellow journeman!\n"
"\n"
"Noble Lord Markham organizes a grandiose match on the Emerald island!\n"
"Take your chance to enter the pantheon of the nobles, winning the right to rule the famous castle Harmondale and all it's neighborhoods!\n"
"\n"
"Boats from Steadwick shipping Emerald Island each wednesday, while contest is on the way."
msgstr ""
"各位同行！\n"
"\n"
"高贵的马卡姆领主将在翡翠岛举办一场盛大的比武！\n"
"抓住机会跻身贵族殿堂吧，获胜者将赢得统治著名的哈莫尼达城堡及其周边全部领地的权利！\n"
"\n"
"比赛期间，每周三都有从斯特德威克开往翡翠岛的船只。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:10
msgid "Protection as per Shield spell."
msgstr "相当于施展“护体神盾”魔法"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:10 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:12
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:13
msgid "Recovery penalty eliminated"
msgstr "无恢复时间惩罚"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:10
msgid ""
"Shield skill directly improves a character’s armor class while a shield is employed.  Expert and master rankings in the shield increase this defensive bonus."
msgstr "盾牌技能可在手持盾牌时直接提高防御等级。盾牌的专家和大师可进一步提升此项防御加成。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:10 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:34
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class (double effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可提高防御等级（效果乘以2）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:11
msgid ""
"Leather armor is the lightest armor a character can wear.  While leather provides less protection than chain or plate armor, it also slows your character down the least.  Leather armor skill increases the protection offered by leather armor."
msgstr "皮甲是冒险者所能穿着的最轻护甲。虽然皮甲的防护力比锁甲或钢甲都要低，但它使角色行动减缓得最少。皮甲的技能等级将会增加皮甲所提供的防护力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:11
msgid "Skill added to Elemental (Fire/Earth/Air/Water) Resistances."
msgstr "技能等级可增加元素（火系/水系/风系/土系）抗性"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:12
msgid ""
"Chain armor is the medium armor type.  It provides more protection than leather and less than plate, but it also slows your character down more than leather.  Chain armor skill increases the protection offered by chain armor."
msgstr "锁甲是中型盔甲。它比皮甲能提供更多的防护力，但比钢甲要少，它对角色行动的减缓也介于二者之间。锁甲的技能等级将会增加锁甲所提供的防护力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:12
msgid "Receive 2/3 damage from physical attacks."
msgstr "使经受的物理攻击伤害减少三分之一"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:12 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:13
msgid "Recovery penalty halved"
msgstr "恢复时间减半"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:13
msgid ""
"Plate armor is the heaviest armor type.  It provides the most protection, but it slows your character down more than leather or chain.  Plate armor skill increases the protection offered by plate armor."
msgstr "钢甲是最重的盔甲种类。它提供了最大的保护，但比皮甲或锁甲更能减慢角色的行动。钢甲的技能等级将会增加钢甲所提供的防护力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:13
msgid "Receive 1/2 damage from physical attacks."
msgstr "使经受的物理攻击伤害减少二分之一"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:14
msgid ""
"All fire magic spells are all combat-oriented and include some of the strongest direct damage spells. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "所有火系魔法均以战斗为目标，包含了一些最强的直接伤害类魔法。火系魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的火系魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:14 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:15 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:16
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:17 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:18 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:19
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:20 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:21 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:22
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:917 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:918 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:919
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:920 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:925 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:926
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:927 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:928 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:934
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:935 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:936 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:937
msgid "Effects vary per spell"
msgstr "每种魔法效果不同"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:15
msgid ""
"Air magic has a mixture of combat, informational and maneuvering spells, including the very useful, Fly. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "空气魔法融合了战斗、信息和移动的能力，更包含非常有用的飞行奇术。空气魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的空气魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:16
msgid ""
"While it does have some combat spells, water magic is more loaded with travel and item spells. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "虽然水系魔法确实包含了一些战斗魔法，但是更多还是旅行和物品的法术。水系魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的水系魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:17
msgid ""
"Earth magic has a balanced mix of offensive and defensive spells, and includes some healing and adventuring magic.  At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "土系魔法在进攻和防御之间取得平衡，还包括一些治愈和冒险的魔法。土系魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的土系魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:18
msgid ""
"Spirit magic concentrates on spells involving life and death.  Included are spells to raise the dead, which affect the undead, and which increase combat effectiveness.  At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""
"灵魂魔法主要是有关生命和死亡的魔法。它包括了复活死者、影响不死生物和提高战斗力的魔法。灵魂魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的灵魂魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:19
msgid ""
"Mind magic spells directly affect the minds of their targets. They can heal or cause mental states, and cause direct damage. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""
"心智魔法直接影响对方的思想。这类魔法可以治愈目标或扰乱目标的精神状态，并造成直接伤害。心智魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的心智魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:2 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:8
msgid "Chance to stun equal to skill"
msgstr "可以将敌人击晕，其概率百分比等于技能等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:10 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:12
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:2 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:3
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:34 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:6
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class"
msgstr "技能等级可提高防御等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:2 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:3 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:35
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:4 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:5 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:6
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:7 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:8 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:9
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击点数"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:2
msgid "Skill added to Attack Damage. Staff usable with the Unarmed skill."
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击杀伤力。持手杖时手杖技能和空手搏斗术技能同时有效"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:2
msgid ""
"Staves are blunt two-handed pole weapons effective on both offense and defense. At expert rank, skill increases your armor class. Masters have a chance of stunning their opponents, and grandmasters gain a bonus to their attack damage."
msgstr "手杖是双手持用的长棍，可攻可守。专家可以增加的防御等级。大师有机会击晕对手，并获得额外的攻击伤害加成。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:20
msgid ""
"While body magic includes some direct damage spells, it is the magic most concerned with healing. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr "虽然肢体魔法也包含一些直接伤害的魔法，但更多是与治疗相关的魔法。肢体魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的肢体魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:21
msgid ""
"Light magic includes some of the most powerful offensive an protective spells, but is only usable by clerics. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""
"光明魔法中包含了某些世界上最强的攻击和保护性魔法，牧师等职业能够使用这类魔法。光明魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的光明魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:22
msgid ""
"Only usable by necromancers, dark magic has the most spectacular damaging and creature controlling spells available. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""
"死灵法师等职业施展的暗黑魔法包含杀伤力最强大的攻击魔法和生物控制魔法。暗黑魔法的专家、大师和宗师可以学到更多的暗黑魔法，并提升这类魔法的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:23
msgid ""
"Can cast Blind. Targets of the spell wander aimlessly and cannot use spells or missiles."
msgstr "可施展盲目能力，其目标将会漫无目的地乱跑，无法使用魔法和远程武器。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:23
msgid "Can cast Darkfire, a magic bolt which does Dark and Fire damage."
msgstr "可施展暗火能力，该能力可同时造成黑暗系和火系伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:23
msgid "Can cast Glamour which increases caster's appeal to others."
msgstr "可施展魅力能力，以增加施法者对于其它人的吸引力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:23
msgid ""
"Can cast Travelers' Boon which has effects of Torchlight, Wizard Eye and Feather Fall."
msgstr "可施展宝囊能力，该能力拥有光明之火、魔力神眼、凌空飞降的效果。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:23
msgid ""
"Dark Elves are born with abilities not shared by other races. Like the racial abilities of Vampires and Dragons, Dark Elven abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. Dark Elves start out able to cast Glamour, then gain Travelers' Boon, Blind, and Darkfire Bolt as they gain expert, master and grandmaster ranking."
msgstr ""
"黑暗精灵天生就拥有其它种族没有的能力。如同吸血鬼和飞龙一样，黑暗精灵的能力可以像魔法一般施展，而学习的方式和技能类似。黑暗精灵一开始可以施展魅力能力，专家可施展宝囊能力，大师可施展盲目能力，宗师可施展暗火能力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:24
msgid ""
"Can assume Mistform. In mistform a vampire cannot take or deal physical damage."
msgstr "可施展雾化能力。在雾化的状态下吸血鬼无法造成也不会经受物理性的伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:24
msgid ""
"Can cast Levitate to move party over harmful surfaces taking no damage."
msgstr "可施展漂浮能力，让队伍通过危险的地面而不受到伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:24
msgid "Can cast Lifedrain which harms its target and heals the caster."
msgstr "可施展吸血能力，直接对敌人造成伤害，同时治愈能力施展者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:24
msgid "Can cast the Charm spell on nearby targets."
msgstr "可对邻近的目标施展魅惑能力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:24
msgid ""
"Vampires are innately powerful creatures with special abilities. Like the racial abilities of Dragons and Dark Elves, Vampire abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. All Vampires can cast Lifedrain, and gain Levitate, Charm and Mistform at expert, master and grandmaster rankings."
msgstr ""
"吸血鬼是拥有强大能力的特殊生物。如同黑暗精灵和飞龙一样，吸血鬼的能力可以像魔法一般施展，而学习的方式和技能类似。所有的吸血鬼都可以施展吸血能力，专家可施展漂浮能力，大师可施展魅惑能力，宗师可施展雾化能力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:25
msgid "Can cast Fear which causes its targets to flee."
msgstr "可施展龙威能力，令敌人不战而逃。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:25
msgid ""
"Dragons are powerful creatures with innate abilities. Like the racial abilities of Dark Elves and Vampires, Dragon abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. Dragons begin able to cast Fear, then gain a second breath weapon, Flight, and Wing Buffet at expert, master and grandmaster rankings. Skill in Dragon ability increases both Armor Class and breath weapon damage."
msgstr ""
"飞龙是拥有强大能力的特殊生物。如同黑暗精灵和吸血鬼一样，飞龙的能力可以像魔法一般施展，而学习的方式和技能类似。所有飞龙起初都可以施展龙威能力，专家可施展焰爆能力，大师可施展飞行能力，宗师可施展翼击能力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:25
msgid "Gains Breath Weapon which launches an exploding fireball."
msgstr "可施展焰爆能力，即从口中发射出高热的火球。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:25
msgid "Gains Flight which allows dragon to carry party through the air."
msgstr "可施展飞行能力，载着所有队员飞行。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:25
msgid "Gains Wing Buffet which pushes back opponents."
msgstr "可施展翼击能力，将对手推开。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:26 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:28 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:31
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:33
msgid "100% success"
msgstr "100％的成功率"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:26
msgid "Ability to identify items"
msgstr "可以鉴定物品"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:26 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:27 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:28
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:29 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:30 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:31
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:33 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:38 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:40
msgid "Double effect of skill"
msgstr "效果乘以2"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:26
msgid ""
"The identify item skill is automatically applied when you right-click on an unidentified inventory item. If your character's skill is high enough, the item becomes identified."
msgstr ""
"当你用鼠标右键点击物品时，如果你的技能足够高，将会自动启动鉴定物品的技能鉴定你所点击的物品。某些物品必须要等到技能等级提升到专家级或是大师级的时候才能够正确鉴定。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:26 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:27 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:28
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:29 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:30 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:31
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:33 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:38 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:40
msgid "Triple effect of skill"
msgstr "效果乘以3"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:27
msgid "Buy and sell items at cost."
msgstr "以原价买卖物品"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:27
msgid ""
"Merchant skill helps adjust prices in your favor, whether you are buying or selling."
msgstr "经商术能让你在买卖物品时讨价还价，提出对你最有利的价格。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:27
msgid "Skill adjusts shop prices in your favor"
msgstr "技能等级越高，还价还得越厉害"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:28
msgid "Ability to repair items"
msgstr "可以修补破损物品"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:28
msgid ""
"The repair skill allows your characters to repair broken equipment. Higher skill levels allow them to repair better items. The skill is automatically applied when you right-click on a broken item in your inventory."
msgstr ""
"修补术让你的角色可以修理破损的物品。更高的技能等级可以使他们能够修理更高等级的物品。当你右键单击物品栏中的破损物品时，这个技能将会自动启动，协助你修理这个破损的物品。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:29
msgid ""
"Bodybuilding skill adds hit points directly to your characters' hit point totals. Hit points gained are equal to a character's Base Hit Points/Level time skill. Expert ranking doubles this total and master triples it."
msgstr "健身术能增加角色的最大生命值。健身术技能等级乘以职业的基础奖励点即为增加的点数。专家可再将总值乘以2，大师乘以3。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:29 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:30 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:38
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:40
msgid "Quintuple effect of skill"
msgstr "效果乘以4"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:29
msgid "Skill adds to Hit Points"
msgstr "技能等级可提高生命值"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:3
msgid "Permits use of sword in left hand"
msgstr "可左手运剑"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:3 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:5 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:7
msgid "Skill reduces recovery time"
msgstr "技能等级可减少恢复时间"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:3
msgid ""
"The sword skill covers most types of blades longer than a knife.  Expert swordsmen gain quicker attacks. Masters may use any one-handed sword in their left hand and another weapon in their right."
msgstr "长剑技能涵盖了所有刀锋比小刀要长的武器。专家攻击更快。大师可以左手使用单手剑，右手则使用别的武器。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:30
msgid ""
"Meditation skill adds spell points directly to your characters' spell point totals.  Spell points gained are equal to a character's Base Spell Points/Level times skill. Expert ranking doubles this total and master triples it. Meditation also regenerates spell points every five game minutes: 1 at Normal, 2 at Expert, 3 at Master, and 4 at Grandmaster, plus 1 for every 10 effective skill points."
msgstr ""
"冥想术能直接增加角色的魔法值。增加的魔法值等于角色每级基础魔法值乘以技能等级。专家可使该数值翻倍，大师则翻三倍。冥想术还会每 5 个游戏分钟自动恢复魔法值：普通 +1、专家 +2、大师 +3、宗师 +4，此外每 10 点有效技能值再额外 +1。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:30
msgid "Skill adds to Spell Points"
msgstr "技能等级可提高魔法值"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:31
msgid "Skill increases chance to avoid traps and notice treasures"
msgstr "技能等级可提高避免陷阱伤害和发现财宝的概率"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:31
msgid ""
"The perception skill gives your characters a chance to notice hidden doors and traps, and to avoid damage from traps when they are triggered. At expert and master levels, your characters will notice more. Grandmasters will see all hidden objects."
msgstr "洞察术使角色有机会发现隐藏的门和陷阱，并避免受到陷阱伤害。专家和大师发现的更多。宗师将看到所有隐藏的物品。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:32
msgid ""
"Characters with the regeneration skill will slowly regain lost hit points over time. Higher skill levels increase how quickly damage is healed."
msgstr "拥有再生术的角色将可以随着时间慢慢恢复失去的生命值。技能等级越高，恢复越快。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:32
msgid "Increases hit points regained over time"
msgstr "随着时间慢慢恢复失去的生命值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:32
msgid "Larger increase to hit points regained over time"
msgstr "恢复生命值更快。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:32
msgid "Largest increase of hit points regained over time"
msgstr "恢复生命值最快。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:33
msgid "Skill increases chance to disarm traps on chests"
msgstr "技能等级可提高拆除箱子陷阱的成功率"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:33
msgid ""
"The disarm traps skill is checked automatically when you open a trapped chest or other container.  A higher skill in disarm traps gives a better chance of disarming the trap.  Experts and masters enjoy an increased chance of disarming traps, while grandmasters always succeed."
msgstr ""
"当你打开宝箱或是其他容器时，陷阱拆卸术会自动启动。陷阱拆卸术等级越高，成功解除陷阱的概率就越高。专家和大师将会使成功解除陷阱的概率变成两倍和三倍。宗师则总是能够成功。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:34
msgid ""
"Dodging skill can be used only when you are not wearing armor or using a shield.  Additional ranks of dodging will increase your armor class while not wearing armor."
msgstr "闪躲术只有在你没穿铠甲没用盾牌时方可生效。技能等级越高，防御等级越高。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:34
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class (triple effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可提高防御等级（效果乘以3）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:34
msgid "Skill is usable while wearing leather armor"
msgstr "穿上皮甲时也能使用该技能"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:35
msgid "Chance to evade an incoming attack equal to skill"
msgstr "可以躲避攻击，其概率百分比等于技能等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:35
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus and damage (double effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击点数和杀伤力（效果乘以2）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:35
msgid ""
"Unarmed skill is your ability to use only your hands and feet in combat, no weapons.  This skill only works with your hands empty.  Additional ranks of unarmed skill will increase your chance to hit."
msgstr "空手搏斗术是指无武器战斗的能力，所以队员手持武器时该技能无效。等级提高以后，队员无武器战斗中击中怪物的几率会上升。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:36
msgid "Learn Attack type and damage of monster"
msgstr "了解怪物的攻击方式和杀伤力"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:36
msgid "Learn Hit Points and Armor Class of monster"
msgstr "了解怪物的生命值和防御等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:36
msgid "Learn the monster's resistances"
msgstr "了解怪物的抗性指标"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:36
msgid "Learn which spells the monster can cast."
msgstr "了解怪物能够使用的魔法"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:36
msgid ""
"The identify monster skill is applied when you right-click on a monster. At basic level, the skill allows you to see a monster's hit points and armor class. At higher expertise levels, more information is displayed."
msgstr "怪物鉴定术让你可以在用右键单击怪物的时候获得对方的信息。基础级别时你将能看到怪物的生命值和防御等级。专家和大师将可以获得更多额外的信息。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:37
msgid ""
"Armsmaster skill represents the warrior's tricks of the trade.  Initially, armsmaster reduces the recovery times of your melee weapons. At higher expertise levels it gives you a bonus to hit then to damage."
msgstr "武器使用术表示战士武器使用的技巧。一开始，武器使用术将会减少近战武器的恢复时间，专家和大师可以增加击中目标的机会甚至攻击杀伤力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:37
msgid "Double all the previous bonuses"
msgstr "技能等级可增加近战武器的攻击点数和杀伤力（效果乘以2）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:37
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus of all melee weapons"
msgstr "技能等级可增加近战武器的攻击点数"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:37
msgid "Skill added to damage of all melee weapons"
msgstr "技能等级可增加近战武器的杀伤力"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:37
msgid "Skill reduces the recovery time of all melee weapons"
msgstr "技能等级可以缩短近战武器的恢复时间"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:38
msgid "Skill gives chance to steal"
msgstr "可以进行偷窃"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:38
msgid ""
"Stealing allows you to take items that don't belong to you from shops, or to steal money or items from people.  Being caught, however, can lead to severe fines-- and outstanding debt is a punishable offense in castles."
msgstr ""
"偷窃术能让队员从店里以及人们身上偷东西。技能等级越高，成功的概率越大。不过，如果偷窃被抓住的话，可能会导致严厉的罚款——未偿债务更是可受惩罚的罪行。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:39
msgid "Allows mixing of complex potions to make compound potions"
msgstr "可以调配复合药剂"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:39
msgid "Allows mixing of compound potions to make white potions"
msgstr "可以调配白药剂"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:39
msgid "Allows mixing of simple potions to make complex potions"
msgstr "可以调配药剂"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:39
msgid "Allows mixing of white potions to make black potions"
msgstr "可以调配黑药剂"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:39
msgid ""
"The alchemy skill allows you to mix potions.  Without the alchemy skill, you barely have the knowledge to make a simple potion, though alchemy skill is added to the strength value of the base ingredient to determine the strength of a simple potion. Higher rankings allow you to mix more complicated potions."
msgstr ""
"炼金术让你能够混和各种药剂。没有这种技能，你只能够勉强制造出简单的药剂来。炼金术等级可以增加药剂的能量，从而加强它们的威力。专家和大师能配置更复杂的药剂。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:4
msgid "Chance to cause triple damage equal to skill"
msgstr "可以击出三倍伤害，其概率百分比等于技能等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:4
msgid "Permits use of dagger in left hand"
msgstr "可左手使用匕首"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:4 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:5 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:8
msgid "Skill added to Attack Damage"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击杀伤力"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:4
msgid ""
"While daggers don’t do the kind of damage that a sword or an axe can deliver, they are very quick—sometimes letting you get two attacks for every one of your slower opponents'.  Expert dagger fighters can wield a dagger in their left hand while using another weapon in their right.  Master dagger fighters have a chance of doing a triple damage attack."
msgstr ""
"匕首虽没有长剑和战斧的杀伤力，但疾如闪电——有时对于一个行动迟缓的敌人，他攻击你一次的时间内你可以攻击他两次。匕首专家可左手持匕首、右手挥舞其它武器；匕首大师则有概率使出三倍伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:40
msgid "Skill increases amount of experience received"
msgstr "增加所获得的经验值"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:40
msgid ""
"The learning skill directly increases the experience a character receives.  Every point of skill is a percent of awarded experience that is given as a bonus (plus a starting bonus of 9%).  Five skill points would turn a 100 experience point award into a 114 experience point award.  Expert doubles and master triples this bonus, so 10 points of learning at master rank would give a 39% bonus to all experience point gain."
msgstr ""
"学习术可以直接增加角色获得的经验点数。每点技能等级增加一个百分比的额外经验点数（初始基础额外点数为9％）。比如，5点技能等级将会把100点经验点数变成114点。专家和大师将有双倍和三倍的效果。所以大师10级将会使所有获得的经验点数增加39％。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:5
msgid "Chance to halve the Armor Class of the target."
msgstr "有一定的概率使敌人的防御力减半"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:5
msgid ""
"While slow on the attack, axes do a lot of damage when they hit.  Expert axe fighters gain a little more speed on their attacks while master axe fighters can deliver extra damage."
msgstr "虽然战斧的攻击速度较慢，不过一旦击中目标，就会造成非常大的伤害。专家攻击速度更快些。而大师则可以增加额外的杀伤力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:6
msgid "Ability to use a spear in one hand."
msgstr "可以单手挥舞长矛"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:35 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:6 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:7
msgid "Skill added to damage."
msgstr "技能等级可增加杀伤力"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:6
msgid ""
"The spear skill allows use of bladed pole weapons. Expert spearmen strike for greater damage, and masters can wield spears in one hand."
msgstr "长矛技能涵盖了各种带有刀刃的杆式武器用法。长矛专家出击时可以造成更大的伤害，而大师则可以一只手挥舞长矛。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:7
msgid "Bow fires two arrows on every attack"
msgstr "每次攻击发射两支箭"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:7
msgid ""
"Bow skill covers both bow and crossbow usage.  Expert archers gain a speed increase with their weapon, while master archers can fire two arrows with every attack."
msgstr "弓箭技能涵盖了长弓和十字弓的用法。弓箭专家可提高射箭速度；而弓箭大师每次可射两支箭。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:8
msgid "Chance to paralyze equal to skill."
msgstr "可以将敌人麻痹，其概率百分比等于技能等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:8
msgid ""
"Mace skill covers all kinds of blunt trauma weapons ranging from large clubs to flails.  Expert mace swingers do extra damage with their weapons. Masters and grandmasters can stun or paralyze their opponents."
msgstr "钉锤技能涵盖了各种钝器，包括锤子、链枷等。专家可以造成额外的伤害。大师则可以震昏对手或使其麻痹。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:9
msgid ""
"A weapon from before the Silence, their making has long since been lost.  Expert and master blasters gain double and triple accuracy with these awesome weapons."
msgstr "这种武器是寂静时代之前所制造出来的，实际的制造方法很久以前就已经失传了。专家和大师使用这个武器时有双倍和三倍的精度。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/skill_des.txt:9
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus (quintuple effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击点数（效果乘以4）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:17
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to air damage by an amount equal to your skill in Air. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的空气抗性。增加的抗性等于空气魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于空气魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:21
msgid ""
"Lightning Bolt discharges electricity from the caster’s hand to a single target.  It always hits and does 1-8 points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "霹雳闪电从施法者手中向单一目标释放电流，必定命中，每点空气魔法技能等级造成1-8点伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:29
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to water damage by an amount equal to your skill in Water Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的水系抗性。增加的抗性等于水系魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于水系魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:3
msgid "Brighter light"
msgstr "使光线更明亮"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:3
msgid "Brightest light"
msgstr "光线最明亮"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:3
msgid "Duration 1 hour per point of  skill"
msgstr "持续时间为1小时乘以施放者的魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:3
msgid ""
"Torch Light increases the radius of light surrounding your party in the dark."
msgstr "光明之火会提升队伍周围的亮度。效果只有在黑暗中才看得出来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:36
msgid ""
"Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions except the caster’s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-6 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""
"向施法者面朝的方向发射一颗冰球。冰球撞到物体时会碎裂，向除施法者外的各个方向射出7块冰屑。冰屑会弹射，直到击中生物或融化为止。每块冰屑造成12点伤害，外加每点水系魔法技能等级1-6点伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:37
msgid ""
"Lloyd’s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill in Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place a marker or return to one.  Each beacon will decay after 1 week per point of skill in Water magic after it is placed."
msgstr ""
"时空道标允许你在某个地点放置一个标记，以便日后传送回来。能保留多久取决于你的水系魔法技能等级。想放置标记或返回某个标记时就施展此法术。每个道标在放置后，每点水系魔法技能等级可保留一周。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:41
msgid ""
"Increases all of your characters’ resistance to Earth Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Earth. The effect lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "施法者的土系魔法等级每一点可以增加目标对象对于土系魔法一点的抵抗力，每一点的土系魔法技能可以增加魔法一个小时的持续时间。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:45
msgid ""
"Removes the stoned condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Earth Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果某个角色被石化了，及时施展这个魔法，将可以把他们恢复过来。施法者的土系魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的石化状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:49
msgid ""
"Increases the weight of a single target enormously for an instant, causing internal damage equal to 25% of the monster’s hit points plus another 2% per point of skill in Earth Magic.  The bigger they are, the harder they fall."
msgstr "瞬间使单一目标的体重急剧增加，造成的内伤等于该怪物当前生命值的25%，外加每点土系魔法技能等级2%。体型越大，跌得越重。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:5
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to fire damage by an amount equal to your skill in Fire Magic. The effect lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的火系抗性。增加的抗性等于火系魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于火系魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:52
msgid ""
"Blessed characters have an increased chance to hit monsters in hand to hand combat and with missiles.  A character’s bonus to hit is increased by 5 + 1 per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "受祝福的角色在近战和远程攻击中命中怪物的几率提高。每点灵魂魔法技能等级使命中加值提高5+1点。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:55
msgid ""
"Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展，将可以消除某个角色所受到的诅咒。施法者的心智魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的恐惧状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:59
msgid ""
"Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer a character can have been dead before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展这个魔法，它可以让一个已经死去的角色复活。施法者的灵魂魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的死亡状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。刚被复活的角色将会比较虚弱。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:65
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Mind Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Mind Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的心系抗性。增加的抗性等于心智魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于心智魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:70
msgid ""
"All creatures in the caster’s sight fear the caster and flee.  If a creature takes damage while under the influence of this spell, the spell will be broken. The duration of Mass Fear is 3 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic.  Mass Fear will not work on undead creatures."
msgstr ""
"施法者视野内的所有生物都会因恐惧而逃离。若生物在此期间受到伤害，法术立即失效。凶神恶煞的持续时间为每点心智魔法技能等级3分钟。对亡灵生物无效。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:71
msgid ""
"Cures insanity if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the character can have been insane before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展，将可以消除目标角色的痴狂状态。施法者的心智魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的痴狂状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:76
msgid ""
"Cures hit points on a single target when cast.  The number cured is equal to 5 plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr "恢复单一目标损失的生命值。恢复的生命值是5点，施法者的每一个肢体魔法的等级可以额外增加2点生命值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:77
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Body Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Body Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的体系抗性。增加的抗性等于肢体魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于肢体魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:80
msgid ""
"Cures poison in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been poisoned before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展，目标角色中毒的状态可以被解除。施法者的肢体魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的中毒状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:82
msgid ""
"Cures disease in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been diseased before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展，目标角色染病的状态可以被解除。施法者的肢体魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的染病状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:89
msgid ""
"Removes all spells on all creatures in the caster’s sight, both helpful and harmful.  Recovery is reduced by an amount equal to skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "移除施法者视野内所有生物身上的所有法术，无论有益还是有害。恢复速度的加快量等于光明魔法技能等级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:99
msgid ""
"Reanimate allows you to raise a lifeless creature from the dead (sort of).  The zombie will fight against monsters hostile to the caster until it is killed (again) or until the party leaves the map.  The zombie will have 10 hit points per point of skill in dark magic, up to its normal maximum."
msgstr "把死尸化为僵尸。僵尸会为你作战，直到战死或你离开地图。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:10
msgid ""
"Armor Class is a measure of how difficult it is for a monster to hit a character.  The higher the Armor Class, the better the chance of avoiding an attack."
msgstr "护甲等级衡量怪物击中角色的难度。护甲等级越高，越有可能避开攻击。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:11
msgid ""
"Spell Points are needed to cast spells.  Every spell has a Spell Point cost that is deducted from this statistic when it's cast.  Spell Points are restored after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr "施放魔法需要法术值。每个法术都有法术值消耗，施放时从该属性中扣除。连续休息 8 小时后法术值恢复。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:12
msgid ""
"Condition shows the worst \"effect\" your character is suffering, such as poisoned, diseased, or dead.  Many conditions seriously hurt your character's ability to fight or perform other actions, and should be cured as soon as possible."
msgstr "状态显示你的角色当前最严重的“异常状态”，例如中毒、患病或死亡。许多状态会严重削弱角色战斗或执行其他行动的能力，应尽快治愈。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:13
msgid ""
"The Quick Spell is the spell that will be cast when you use the \"s\" key to cast a spell.  You can set the quick spell by opening your spell book (\"c\" key), clicking on the spell you want to set, then clicking on the set spell tab at the left-bottom corner of the spell book."
msgstr ""
"快速施法是当你按“s”键施法时所使用的法术。你可以打开法术书（按“c”键），点击要设置的法术，然后点击法术书左下角的“设置法术”页签来设置快速施法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:14
msgid ""
"Age shows the current age of your character.  The first number is the temporary age number, and the second is your real age.  Certain monsters and magical effects can raise your temporary age above your real age."
msgstr "年龄显示角色的当前年龄。第一个数字是临时年龄，第二个是真实年龄。某些怪物和魔法效果可以使你的临时年龄超过真实年龄。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:15
msgid ""
"Level is a measure of the training your character has gone through.  A high level contributes to hit points and spell points."
msgstr "等级衡量角色所接受的训练程度。高等级有助于提升生命值和法术值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:16
msgid ""
"Experience is a simple indicator of your character's overall understanding of the world.  With enough experience points (and a little gold), you can train your characters in training grounds throughout the land to increase their level and gain skill points to spend on skills."
msgstr ""
"经验是角色对世界总体理解程度的简单指标。拥有足够的经验值（外加少量金币），你就可以在全大陆的训练场训练角色，提升等级并获得技能点来学习技能。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:17
msgid ""
"Attack Bonus is the sum of all factors (skills, spells, Accuracy, etc.) that influence your character's chance to hit monsters with an equipped weapon."
msgstr "攻击加成是所有影响角色使用装备武器击中怪物几率之因素（技能、法术、精准等）的总和。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:18
msgid ""
"Attack Damage is the sum of all factors (Might, spells, certain weapon skills at expert or master, etc.) that influence the damage your character does with an equipped weapon."
msgstr "攻击伤害是所有影响角色使用装备武器造成伤害之因素（力量、法术、专家或大师级别的某些武器技能等）的总和。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:19
msgid ""
"Shoot Bonus is the sum of all factors (skill, spells, Accuracy, etc.) that influence your character's chance to hit monsters with an equipped bow."
msgstr "射击加成是所有影响角色使用装备弓击中怪物几率之因素（技能、法术、精准等）的总和。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:2
msgid ""
"Might is the statistic that represents a character's overall strength, and his or her ability to put that strength where it counts.  Characters with a high Might statistic do more damage in combat."
msgstr "力量代表角色总体力量的数值，也代表他/她将力量用在关键之处的能力。力量值高的角色在战斗中能造成更多伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:20
msgid ""
"Shoot Damage is the sum of all factors (spells, weapon bonuses, etc.) that influence the damage your character does with an equipped bow."
msgstr "射击伤害是所有影响角色使用装备弓造成伤害之因素（法术、武器加成等）的总和。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:21
msgid ""
"Fire Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from fire based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce fire damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "火焰抗性代表角色降低火焰攻击所造成伤害的能力。虽然高抗性可以大幅减少火焰伤害，但并不能让角色免疫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:22
msgid ""
"Air Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from air based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce air damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "空气抗性代表角色降低空气攻击所造成伤害的能力。虽然高抗性可以大幅减少空气伤害，但并不能让角色免疫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:23
msgid ""
"Water Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from water based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce water damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "水系抗性代表角色降低水系攻击所造成伤害的能力。虽然高抗性可以大幅减少水系伤害，但并不能让角色免疫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:24
msgid ""
"Earth Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from earth based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce earth damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "土系抗性代表角色降低土系攻击所造成伤害的能力。虽然高抗性可以大幅减少土系伤害，但并不能让角色免疫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:25
msgid ""
"Mind Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from mind based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce mind damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "心智抗性代表角色降低心灵攻击所造成伤害的能力。虽然高抗性可以大幅减少心灵伤害，但并不能让角色免疫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:26
msgid ""
"Body Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from body based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce body damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "肢体抗性代表角色降低身体攻击所造成伤害的能力。虽然高抗性可以大幅减少身体伤害，但并不能让角色免疫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:27
msgid ""
"Skill Points are awarded whenever your character trains for a new level.  You can spend Skill Points on your skills at any time."
msgstr "每当角色通过训练提升等级时都会获得技能点。你可以随时将技能点用于学习技能。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:3
msgid ""
"Intellect represents a character's ability to reason and understand complex, abstract concepts. Maximum spell points for Necromancers and Dark Elves are based on Intellect."
msgstr "智力代表角色推理和理解复杂抽象概念的能力。死灵法师和黑暗精灵的最大法术值基于智力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:4
msgid ""
"Personality represents both a character's strength of will and personal charm.  Maximum spell points for Clerics, Vampires and Minotaurs are based on Personality."
msgstr "个性代表角色的意志力与个人魅力。牧师、吸血鬼和牛头人的最大法术值基于个性。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:5
msgid ""
"Endurance is a measure of a character's physical toughness and durability. A high Endurance gives a character more hit points."
msgstr "耐力衡量角色身体的强韧与耐久。高耐力会赋予角色更多生命值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:6
msgid ""
"Accuracy represents a character's precision and hand-eye coordination.  A high Accuracy will allow a character to hit monsters more frequently in combat."
msgstr "准确代表角色的命中精度与手眼协调能力。高准确能让角色在战斗中更频繁地击中怪物。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:7
msgid ""
"Speed is a measure of how quick a character is.  A high Speed statistic will increase a character's armor class and the rate with which the character recovers from attacks."
msgstr "速度衡量角色的敏捷程度。高速度属性会提高角色的护甲等级，并加快角色受击后的恢复速度。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:8
msgid ""
"Luck has a subtle influence throughout the game, but is most visible in the ability of a character to resist magical attacks and avoid taking (as much) damage from traps."
msgstr "幸运在整个游戏中有着微妙的影响，但最明显体现在角色抵抗魔法攻击以及减轻陷阱伤害的能力上。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/stats.txt:9
msgid ""
"Hit Points indicate how much damage your character can sustain before falling unconscious or dying.  A character is unconscious at 0 Hit Points or less, and dies when Hit Points reach -10  All Hit Points are restored after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr ""
"生命值表示角色在昏迷或死亡之前所能承受的伤害量。生命值为 0 或更低时角色昏迷，生命值降至 -10 时死亡。连续休息 8 小时后所有生命值恢复。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:10
msgid ""
"From the looks of the trash and decaying garbage on the ground outside, many generations of bandits have used this cave to hide from the law."
msgstr "洞穴的外面堆满了垃圾杂物，但里面却是盗贼们逃避法律制裁的安乐窝。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:100
msgid ""
"A frightening spectacle of shadowy claws and twisted demonic figures beckons you inside.  You can hear a woman singing in the distance, but can't quite make out the words."
msgstr "一些阴森可怕的身影从不远处向你招手，你隐约听见有女人唱歌的声音，但听不清歌词。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:101
msgid ""
"The last of a series of watchtowers that once guarded the border of Deyja, Watchtower 6 is battle scarred, but still standing tall."
msgstr "6号哨塔长久以来一直守护着迪雅，它虽然饱受战火的摧残，但依然高高耸立。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:102
msgid ""
"The sharp, electric smell of magic fills the air outside the School--the result of hundreds of years of magical experiments and juvenile pranks happening in the same building."
msgstr "学院外的空气中弥漫着一股魔法的神秘气息，几百年来，这里盛行魔法试验和恶作剧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:103
msgid ""
"Though recently abandoned by the Dwarves, you can still easily see the craft and care they put into this mine."
msgstr "虽然此地最近被矮人们遗弃了，但他们精良的雕刻作品仍然随处可见。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:104
msgid ""
"The proving grounds of the Wizards, the Walls of Mist floats on the clouds like a mirage of the sky.  It is an entirely magical construct."
msgstr "这是法师们聚集的地方，终年烟雾缭绕，充满了魔力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:105
msgid ""
"The Temple of the Light is one of the most beautiful and serene places in the world.  Any follower of the Light can feel their troubles slipping away as they walk in these hallowed halls."
msgstr "光明神庙是世界上最美丽宁静的地方，善良的人们在这里会忘记所有的烦恼。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:106
msgid ""
"Traitors and prisoners of war are frequently thrown in this horrible pit as object lessons in cruelty.  All Necromancers must also enter the pit and escape before they can complete their apprenticeships."
msgstr "叛徒和战俘都被扔进此地受刑，这也是巫师们“进修”的场所。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:107
msgid ""
"The Temple of the Dark is still in use by the forces of evil.  Sacrifices are held monthly, and foul rites are performed routinely on the front steps."
msgstr "暗黑神庙被邪恶势力所控制，他们经常在此进行各种可怕的祭祀。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:108
msgid ""
"The sound of unholy chanting and the screams and moans of the undead can be heard quite clearly from the entrance."
msgstr "大门后隐约传来亡灵的呻吟和邪恶的祷告声。"

# imported from engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:109
msgid ""
"Overgrown and weather beaten, the Grand Temple of the Sun has seen better days.  It appears someone is still taking care of the place."
msgstr "高级太阳神殿饱经风霜，曾经有过光辉的岁月，看来直到现在还有人在守护着它。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:11
msgid ""
"Once a stately mansion, this old house has long been abandoned by the original owners.  The current residents don't seem to keep the place up very well."
msgstr "这幢大楼一定有过辉煌的历史，但现在已经被废弃了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:110
msgid ""
"The Warlocks of Nighon call this extinct volcano their home.  A network of natural and carved tunnels spread away from the mountain, permitting travel throughout Nighon and across the sea."
msgstr "尼根的邪术师将这座火山视为他们的家。这里有四通八达的地道延伸到整个尼根，甚至还可以过海。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:111
msgid ""
"A huge, magical maze stretches before you as far as the eye can see.  Looking at it for long dazzles the eyes and confuses the mind."
msgstr "你的眼前出现了一座巨大的迷宫，你望了一会儿，只觉得头昏脑涨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:112
msgid ""
"Stone City is one of the great bastions of the Dwarven race in the world.  The front gate looks very secure."
msgstr "石头城是矮人们的乐园，城堡的大门看上去坚实稳固。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:113
msgid ""
"Words cannot convey the horror.  One of the pipes must be an entrance…"
msgstr "你的心中产生了一种莫名的恐惧。应该有一条通道是入口。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:114
msgid ""
"The Mercenary Guild is home to every swordsman who fails at banditry.  Visitors are unwelcome."
msgstr "雇佣兵行会里经常有各种剑客出入。这里不欢迎访客。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:115
msgid ""
"These caverns have been the hideout of pirates and ne'er-do-wells for centuries."
msgstr "许多世纪以来这些洞穴一直是海盗和歹徒的藏身之所。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:116
msgid "A trail of ominous brown stains leads downstairs and into darkness…"
msgstr "一些污垢一路指向楼梯下的黑暗地窖。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:117
msgid ""
"A mighty fortress housing the fantastic and murderous Titans.  No one has ever entered and returned to tell the tale."
msgstr "这是泰坦的城堡，谁也不知道里面有什么，因为进去的人从来没有回来过。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:118
msgid ""
"Once the proud center of a false religion, the Temple has fallen into disrepair."
msgstr "这里曾经是邪教的神庙，但现在只是一片废墟。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:119
msgid ""
"It doesn't look like much, but getting in isn't easy.  Careful not to stray from the path."
msgstr "这里看上去非常平静，但实际上绝不简单，小心不要走错路。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:12 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:14
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:230
msgid ""
"The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr "入口处阴森森的，连空气都似乎静止不动了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:120
msgid ""
"This incredible starship is but a small sample of the wonders of the Ancients."
msgstr "这艘神奇的飞船是古代文明的杰作。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:121
msgid ""
"The weathered stones of this old keep shelter empty buildings in an unused courtyard.  Faint sounds echo from a worn stairway that leads down below the keep."
msgstr "已风化的砖石遮蔽着这个耸立在土丘上的堡垒。一个破旧的阶梯通向城堡主楼地下，微弱的声音从里面回荡而出。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:122
msgid ""
"Faint chanting can be heard from beyond the doors of this Temple.  Visitors do not appear to be welcome here."
msgstr "庙宇的门外可以听到微弱的吟唱声。该寺庙似乎不欢迎访客。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:123
msgid ""
"The first fortress dedicated to magical research, its remote location provided secrecy for the mages and protection for the populace in the event of an accident."
msgstr "第一个致力于魔法研究的堡垒，其偏远的地点为法师保守了秘密，并在突发事故时避免了民众受其伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:124
msgid ""
"This pyramid seems to be made of a strange, weathered metal.  It appears to be partially buried in the sand."
msgstr "这座金字塔似乎是用一种神秘的金属建成，它的一部分已经埋没在了沙漠之中。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:125
msgid ""
"This strange structure commands a spectacular view of Paradise Valley.  The outer walls are constructed from an unknown material."
msgstr "这座奇特的建筑俯瞰着天堂谷的壮观景色，它的外壁由未知材料构成。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:126
msgid ""
"Strange squeaking echoes from behind the front doors.  At one time a temple of Baa, a foul curse caused the old inhabitants to move away."
msgstr "从大门后发出奇怪的吱吱声。这个建筑曾经是一座羊鸣庙，但因为一个魔法诅咒而导致信徒不得不全数撤离。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:127
msgid ""
"This large but simple structure has become the center of worship for a small religious group called the Order of the Fist."
msgstr "这个庞大但简单的建筑已经成为了一个名为“神拳会”的小型宗教团体的朝拜中心。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:128
msgid ""
"The temperature drops as you approach the gates to this castle.  Legend holds that this castle contains the knowledge of how to transcend death as undead."
msgstr "接近城堡大门时会感到温度下降。传说城堡里保存着关于如何超越死亡，化作亡灵生物的知识。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:129
msgid ""
"This area appears to be abandoned.  However, fresh footprints lead in and out from a recently repaired door.  Perhaps it isn’t so abandoned after all."
msgstr "本应为一座废弃的建筑，却有新近的脚印进出于一扇刚修补过的大门。也许还有人在使用这个建筑。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:130
msgid ""
"The smells of death and decay seem to fill the air near this structure.  The temple's original purpose has long since been forgotten by the new worshippers."
msgstr "死亡和腐尸的气味弥漫在此建筑的周围。新来的朝拜者早已忘记了这座庙宇原来的宗旨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:131
msgid ""
"Kriegspire no longer rests between its lakes, the earth around the castle was raised to prevent the creatures inside from escaping."
msgstr "克里格斯城堡不再仅以水环绕，城堡的四周还筑起了土丘以防止里面的生灵逃离。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:132
msgid ""
"Ancient runes above the entrance attempt to scare away the casual visitor.  Fresh goblin tracks lead into and out of the doorway."
msgstr "入口上方的古代符文试图吓退随意闯入的不速之客。门前到处是新近的大耳怪脚印。"

# imported from engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:133
msgid ""
"This forgotten shrine of the Church of the Sun still stands.  For all of its time in the humid jungle, the temple remains in surprisingly good condition."
msgstr "被遗忘的太阳神殿圣坛依然耸立着。尽管在潮湿的丛林中这么多年，太阳神殿令人惊讶地保存完好。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:134
msgid ""
"These caverns once belonged to the exiled King Rocklin, but now they are home to the new Dwarven King, Snergle."
msgstr "这些岩洞原属于被放逐的洛克林国王，现为新矮人国王斯纳格的家园。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:135
msgid ""
"Originally a place of worship for the Church of the Moon, this old sanctuary is now home to Cedric Drother’s group of Druids."
msgstr "原本是月亮神庙的朝拜地，但现在这座古老的圣地已经成为了塞德里克兄弟会的德鲁伊们的家园。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:136
msgid ""
"The original name of these caverns has been lost in time.  Now, it is named for the group of bandits that base their operations from it."
msgstr "这些岩洞本来的名字已被人忘却，现以将此地设为据点匪徒帮会的名字命名。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:137
msgid ""
"The temperature rises steadily as you approach the doors, the smell of sulfur and ash strong.  This place resembles a hideout more than a temple."
msgstr "接近大门时能感觉到温度不断升高，硫磺和烟灰的气味十分刺鼻。比起寺庙来，这个地方更像是一个隐匿之地。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:138
msgid ""
"This small post acts as an advance base for the Fraternal Order of Silver.  From here, they are able to patrol Mist in their conquest of evil."
msgstr "这个小型哨站是银色兄弟会的前线基地。从这里出发，可以在浓雾镇巡逻，镇邪驱魔。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:139
msgid ""
"The focal point of all Baa worship in Enroth, the Superior Temple only allows followers of Baa inside."
msgstr "作为恩洛斯羊鸣教朝拜的中心，顶级羊鸣庙只允许羊鸣教的教徒进入。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:140
msgid ""
"Home to the so-called Prince of Thieves, the Shadow Guild operates outside of Anthony Stone's jurisdiction.  This Guildhall is not open to the public."
msgstr "这是所谓的侠盗王子的家园，阴影教在此自由地运作而不受安东尼·斯通的管辖。这个教派大堂不向公众开放。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:141
msgid ""
"The forest of statues scattered about seems to magnify the silence on Star Island.  Certainly, the rumors of medusas living in this temple are true."
msgstr "石像零零落落四处散布，使整个星岛显得更加静谧。显然，关于美杜莎女妖生活在此庙中的传言绝非空穴来风。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:142
msgid ""
"The largest dwarven mine in Enroth, Snergle has claimed it in his succession to the dwarven throne."
msgstr "恩洛斯最大的矮人矿，斯纳格国王在即位后占有此矿。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:143
msgid ""
"The Dragoons rebuilt and refurbished this keep to serve as their headquarters.  From here, they prey on traffic to and from Free Haven."
msgstr "龙骑兵将此城堡重建并翻修一新，作为他们的总部，以便从这里出发去抢劫那些进出自由天堂的商队与路人。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:144
msgid ""
"Once the residence of Archmage Terrax, Corlagon received the Estate from Archibald for his services during the Succession Wars."
msgstr "这里曾是大法师德雷克斯的住所，考勒根因在王位争夺战争中战功卓著，从阿基巴德手中受此封地。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:145
msgid ""
"The headquarters of the Fraternal Order of Silver and Sir John Silver's home.  Silver Helms from this Stronghold patrol Silver Cove in search of evil."
msgstr "这里是银色兄弟会的总部和约翰·席尔瓦爵士的老家。银舵兵团从此出发逡巡银湾镇以搜寻邪恶势力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:146
msgid ""
"This forboding structure radiates magical power.  Druids from all over Enroth make periodic pilgrimages to visit this sacred place."
msgstr "这座可预测吉凶的建筑散发出无尽魔力，来自恩洛斯各地的德鲁伊们定期来此地朝圣。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:147
msgid ""
"Ethric, the first Sorcerer seeking life after death, still walks about his tomb, the leader of a host of undead servants.  At least, that’s how the rumor goes..."
msgstr "埃斯里克是第一个追求死后生命的巫师，他作为一群亡灵奴仆的领袖，至今仍在他自己的坟墓边游荡。至少，据说是这样……"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:148
msgid ""
"Originally used to keep creatures from escaping the Frozen Wastelands, now the keep prevents traffic to and from Castle Stromgard and town of White Cap."
msgstr "原本是为了阻止生灵逃离冰冻荒原，现在这座堡垒却阻断了斯壮姆嘉德城堡和白帽镇之间的交通路线。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:149
msgid ""
"Muted sounds of clashing metal and loud voices emanate from this imposing fortress.  No one would dare assault the Warlord’s home."
msgstr "这个气势雄伟的堡垒中不时传出金属的撞击声和喊叫声。无人胆敢攻击此军阀老家。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:15
msgid ""
"The door is unlocked and unguarded from the outside.  The iron on the doorknob is rusting, and you can see a small hornet's nest in the corner above the door."
msgstr "从外面看来，这扇门没有上锁，也没有什么防卫，连门环都已经生锈了。你看见门的上方有一个蜂巢。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:150
msgid ""
"A foul smell wafts from the entrance to these caves.  The howl of a wolf can be heard from the distance."
msgstr "这些岩洞中飘散出阵阵恶臭。能听到狼的嗥叫从远处传来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:151
msgid ""
"Fire Elementals assisted Gharik in his attempts to create powerful items here.  A handful of his students continue his experiments."
msgstr "烈火元素兽曾在此协助加里克尝试发明威力巨大的物件。他的一班学生正继续他的实验。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:152
msgid ""
"This laboratory is the birthplace for countless horrid experiments.  Its remote location was chosen for both safety and secrecy."
msgstr "这个实验室是无数可怕实验的发生地。为安全和保密起见它被建在偏远地区。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:153
msgid ""
"These caves house a strange alliance between human warriors and dragons.  The Dragon Towers were built in the towns to ward off these raiders."
msgstr "这些洞穴中驻扎着人类战士和巨龙的罕见强盗联盟。恩洛斯城镇中建立的龙塔就是为了防御这些掠夺者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:154
msgid ""
"The Control Center has been closed since the Silence, nearly twelve centuries ago."
msgstr "这座控制中心从大约12个世纪之前的“寂静”事件开始就被关闭了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:158
msgid ""
"A thunderous howl pierces your ears, provoking a feeling of dread. Whatever produced that sound is drawing near, with each step rocking the earth beneath your feet."
msgstr "雷鸣般的吼声刺穿你的耳朵，激起你的恐惧感。发出的声音越来越近，每一声都摇动着脚下的大地。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:159
msgid ""
"As you go deeper into this vast network of tunnels, your instinct tells you that many dangerous creatures dwell within. You vow to remain vigilant."
msgstr "当你深入到这个广阔的隧道网中后，你的本能告诉你，这里面有很多危险的生物。你告诉自己要保持警惕。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:16
msgid ""
"A nasty odor wafts from the entrance of this cave, propelled by an unseen subterranean breeze.  It smells like decaying meat mixed with brimstone and…peppermint?  Whatever.  Looks dangerous."
msgstr "洞穴的深处吹来一阵凉风，夹杂着令人作呕的气味，闻起来象是硫磺和烂肉，好象还有薄荷！看来里面充满了危险。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:160
msgid "This tunnel leads to Stone City."
msgstr "这条隧道通向石城。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:17
msgid ""
"The unassuming home of someone unimportant…or, at least someone who wishes to appear that way."
msgstr "看来是某个小人物的住处（也许主人希望访客有这种感觉）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:18
msgid ""
"This tomb must be the resting place of an eccentric recluse.  The tomb doesn't appear to have been disturbed in quite some time."
msgstr "这一定是某个性情古怪的隐士的住处，看来很久没人打扰过他了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:19
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The undead near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's treasure."
msgstr "路人皆知，一头巨龙居住在这些洞穴中。在洞穴周围游荡的亡灵可能是那些因为觊觎里面富可敌国的宝藏，铤而走险进洞寻宝的探险者。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:195
msgid ""
"It seems that the entrance does not lead to the Dark Dwarves' Compound."
msgstr "这个入口似乎并没有通往黑暗矮人聚集地。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:196
msgid "Enter basement of The Breach."
msgstr "进入大裂缝地下室。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:2
msgid ""
"Vampire crypts are normally well hidden. That the Shadowspire vampires operate so openly is proof of their power in the region."
msgstr "吸血鬼的墓窖通常隐藏得很好，但在影旋山脉这边则是例外，很明显的是因为他们在这边的影响力非比寻常的关系。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:20
msgid ""
"The faint smell of brimstone and the sound of creatures talking in a strange language drift from the entrance of this cave."
msgstr "从洞口飘来淡淡的硫磺气味，并隐约有窃窃私语之声，但听不懂是什么语言。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:156 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:157 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/trans.txt:161
