# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid ""
"Often carried by Elven caravan guards, these slightly under-proportioned blades are nearly, but not quite, light enough to brandish single-handedly."
msgstr "这种武器通常是由精灵商队的守卫所携带，这种武器的重量几乎可以让人以单手来持用，不过，很可惜的，在重量上还是稍嫌太重了一些。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:100
msgid "Dark Knight Plate"
msgstr "黑骑士钢甲"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:100
msgid ""
"Though lined with felt and red velvet, and decorated with enamel and gilding, this armor is no showpiece. The siertal-alloy plates are light, but tough enough that they must have been worked with tools with erudine working faces."
msgstr ""
"虽然上面装饰着极尽华丽的各种天鹅绒、珠宝等等，但这套盔甲绝不是什么装饰品。这套由席尔多合金所打造的钢甲不但轻，坚硬度更是极高，当初一定是使用依鲁丁材质的工具才能够打造。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1000
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan diamond, flawless and set in an intricate gold frame. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗毫无瑕疵、镶嵌在精美金座上的恩塔格瑞钻石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1001
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan ruby in a gold frame with several smaller rubies adorning it. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗镶嵌在金座上、周围点缀着数颗小红宝石的恩塔格瑞红宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1002 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1802
msgid "A small pile of gold coins."
msgstr "一小堆金币。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1003 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1803
msgid "A pile of gold coins."
