# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:101
msgid ""
"The technique for making plate armor of erudine sheets is not known on Jadame. In fact, it is only produced by the master armorer, Derrick Goreth of Erathia who spent a lifetime constructing his famed White Light Forgeworks."
msgstr ""
"贾丹姆大陆上没有人知道应该如何利用依鲁丁矿石打造钢甲。事实上，只有伊拉西亚大陆上的盔甲大师德瑞克·哥拉斯花了一辈子在白光熔炉中研究才找出了打造这种盔甲的方法。"

