# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:130
msgid "These gloves of poorly cured leather are worn by workmen everywhere."
msgstr "这种粗陋的皮手套是各地的工人十分爱用的配件之一。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1300 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1301 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1302
msgid ""
"A spell book.  To learn this spell, pick the book up and left-click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen.  Your character must know the Dark magic skill to Master level to learn this spell."
msgstr "一本魔法经书。要学习这个魔法，请拿起魔法经书，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。角色必须掌握大师级暗黑魔法技能才能学习此魔法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1303
msgid ""
"A spell book.  To learn this spell, pick the book up and left-click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen.  Your character must know the Dark magic skill to Grandmaster to learn this spell."
msgstr "一本魔法经书。要学习这个魔法，请拿起魔法经书，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。角色必须掌握宗师级暗黑魔法技能才能学习此魔法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1305
msgid ""
"(Speed +40, Swift) Ancient and fey, Puck's enchantments cause it to practically fly for enemy's throats.  No one knows when or where Puck was forged, but the Faerie origins are unmistakable."
msgstr ""
"（速度+40，迅捷类属性）这是一把古代的神剑，速度奇快无比，敌人往往在还没有反应过来之前就被刺破了喉咙。这把剑的来历是个迷，但它肯定是由精灵制造的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1305 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1306 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1307
