msgid "Mordred"
msgstr "莫德里德"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2023
msgid ""
"One of nine such blades in the world, Mordred was made by the Brotherhood in 428 A.S. as part of their first experiments in the development of Dark Magic.  Their hope was to find a way to extend one person's life at the expense of another's, but instead of reversing ages, they merely found a way to steal health.  (Special Powers:  Vampiric)"
msgstr ""
"天下九大利刃之一，由兄弟会在寂静时代428年打制，是他们首次扩展暗黑魔法的成果。他们本来想创造利用他人生命为自己延年益寿的魔法，但没有成功，发明的魔法只能损害他人健康。（特殊威力：吸血类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2024
msgid ""
"The origins of Thor are lost in time, but this mighty barbarian weapon is well remembered by military historians.  The weapon has been used in battles by many owners for centuries, although its last appearance was at the battle of Shimengard in 902 A.S..  The force of a blow from this hammer is so powerful that it can knock foes several feet back away from the wielder.  (Special Powers:  Force)"
msgstr ""
"尽管没有人知道这件武器出自谁之手，但钻研军事历史的专家对它却刻骨铭心。在几个世纪的战斗中此武器辗转于多位勇士之手，最后一次出现是在寂静时代902年的西蒙加德战役中。此锤威力无比，能把对手击出几步开外。（特殊威力：强力类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2024
msgid "Thor"
msgstr "索尔"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2025
msgid "Conan"
msgstr "柯南"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2025
msgid ""
"This mighty axe is enchanted to destroy dragons and devils.  It has a way of finding an owner who is both likely to come across such monsters and is strong enough to fight them.  (Special Powers:  Devil and Dragon Slaying)"
msgstr ""
"此战斧经魔法点化，专为屠龙斩魔之用。它能自动寻找它的主人，那些很容易遇到此类怪兽，而且有能力与它们战斗勇士。（特殊威力：屠魔鬼、屠龙类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2026
msgid "Excalibur"
msgstr "艾克斯卡力巴"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2026
msgid ""
"Heavy, yet seemingly light as a feather in skilled hands, Excalibur confers great might upon its wielder.  Opponents do not easily walk away from blows struck by this legendary weapon.  (Special Powers:  +30 Might)"
msgstr "尽管份量挺沉，但如果使用得当，则轻如鸿毛。艾克斯卡力巴给予使用者巨大的力量，安然避过这把传说之剑的攻击可不容易。（特殊威力：力量+30）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2027
msgid ""
"Traditionally carried by the High Druid, but lost during struggles over religious doctrine, Merlin acts as a reservoir of spell power the wielder can draw upon at any time.  Merlin is enchanted with swiftness, and rains blows upon enemies much faster than an ordinary staff. (Special Powers:  Swiftness and +40 Spell Points)"
msgstr ""
"惯例应由高级别德鲁伊持有，但在频繁的宗教派别斗争中被遗失了。莫林的内部储存着魔力，供持有者随时取用。它的速度经魔法增强，攻击对手时快如闪电，势如疾风骤雨。（特殊威力：迅捷类属性，魔法值+40）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2028 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_names.txt:397
msgid "Percival"
msgstr "帕西佛"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2028
msgid ""
"Percival was enchanted by the Archer's Guild in 912 A.S. as the prototype in an enchantment process they were developing at the time.  Unfortunately, a suspicious fire broke out at the guild hall, ruining the development plans and destroying the exotic materials needed to create more Percivals.  The guild never recovered from their losses, and sold Percival to the Elves in 918 A.S..  It has since changed hands many times.  (Special Powers:  Swiftness and Carnage)"
msgstr ""
"此物在寂静时代912年由弓箭手行会按照他们研制的程序点化。但不幸的是，当时大厅突然起火，研究计划毁于一旦，而且从海外运来用于量产的原料也被付之一炬。该行会从此一蹶不振，在寂静时代918年把帕西佛卖给了精灵族。此后又经多人转手。（特殊威力：迅捷类和屠杀类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2029
msgid "Galahad"
msgstr "格拉海德"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2029
msgid ""
"Perhaps the finest chain mail created since the Silence, Galahad's material strength enchantments are so strong they are somewhat conferred upon the wearer's body, making it capable of withstanding much more abuse than normal.  (Special Powers:  Protection and +25 Hit Points)"
msgstr "可能是自从寂静时代以来天下最完美的锁甲。盔甲上附有魔力，坚硬无比，经受沉重的打击仍然安然无恙。（特殊威力：保护类属性，生命值+25）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:203
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, widowsweep berries can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。柳条浆果可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

