msgid "Reagent"
msgstr "原料"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/potion.txt:2 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/potnotes.txt:2 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1005
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:203 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:2 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potnotes.txt:2
msgid "Widowsweep Berries"
msgstr "柳条浆果"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2030
msgid ""
"Named after an ancient knight, Pellinore fortifies the wearer with an unnatural health so strong that the wearer heals from serious injuries in a matter of hours.  The armor is quite heavy, and protects the wearer from being knocked about during combat.  (Special Powers:  +30 Endurance, Hit Recovery, and Hit Point Regeneration)"
msgstr ""
"这件盔甲以一个古代骑士的名字命名。它附有非凡的疗伤能力，使穿着者身受重伤后只要几个小时就可恢复如常。此盔甲分量不轻，可防止其主人在战斗中被击倒。（特殊威力：耐力+30，受击恢复，逐渐恢复生命值）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2030
msgid "Pellinore"
msgstr "皮里诺"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2031
msgid ""
"Commissioned by King David IV of Erathia during the Timber Wars, Valeria not only shields the user from normal blows, but helps intercept many incoming arrows by magically focusing the wielder's attention on the flight of the missile.  The same enchantment that makes the shielding effect possible also increases the wielder's accuracy enormously.  (Special Powers:  Shielding and +30 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""
"维拉里亚是在木材战争期间由伊拉西亚国王大卫四世委托制作的。它不仅可以抵御普通的攻击，而且能使其主人的注意力集中在飞来的箭矢上，将其神奇地拦截下来。此物还能大大提高使用者的准确值。（特殊威力：护盾类属性，准确+30）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2031
msgid "Valeria"
msgstr "维拉里亚"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2032
msgid ""
"In their endless quest to create the perfect Priest-King, the priests of the Church of the Sun created Arthur and imbued it with the power to heighten the wearer's personal abilities, as well as confer more magical energy.  It worked, heightening their King's natural abilities--and his pride.  In 1073, Leopold VII started a holy war against the rival Church of the Moon, grinding both organizations into poverty and ultimately resulting in their demise.  (Special Powers:  'of the Gods' and +25 Spell Points)"
msgstr ""
"为了打造一个十全十美的大主教国王，太阳教派创制了此物。为了显示使用者的超人意志和过人本领，它被赋予无穷的力量和高超的魔法。在使用时，领袖的王者之气将得到淋漓尽致的发挥。1073年，李普德七世发动了与其死对头月亮教派一决生死的大战，最后两败俱伤，相继灭亡。（特殊威力：众神类属性，魔法值+25）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2033
msgid "Pendragon"
msgstr "潘德拉根"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2033
msgid ""
"This cape originally belonged to Alastair Blane, Master thief of the Shadow Guild.  The cape increased his luck and certain thieving skills tremendously, enabling him to pursue a long and prosperous career.  Blane was never brought to justice for his crimes--he was instead killed over a card game for cheating while wearing the cloak to better his chances.  (Special Powers:  +30 Luck, Thievery, Immunity to Poison)"
msgstr ""
"这件披风原先是阴影教首领阿莱斯蒂亚·布莱恩的。披风极大地提高了他的运气和偷盗技巧，使他始终鸿运高照。布莱恩一生从未受到正义的惩罚，反而在穿着这件披风打牌时被人发现作弊而死于非命。（特殊威力：运气+30，偷窃术效果，免疫中毒）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2034
msgid "Lucius"
msgstr "路西乌斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2034
msgid ""
"No one knows where or when these magical boots were made, but many tales refer to them turning up in the most unusual places.  They grant their wearer superhuman quickness and grace of motion.  (Special Powers:  +30 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"没人知道这双具有魔力的鞋子来自哪里，何时制造。许多传说把它描述成来自某个非同寻常的神秘圣地。这双鞋子给予其使用者超人的速度，而且行进时样子幽雅迷人。（特殊威力：速度+30）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2035
msgid "Guinevere"
msgstr "珍妮弗"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2035
msgid ""
"Guinevere was created by the Alchemist Guild under the stones of Castle Kriegspire many years ago.  It boosts the magical resources available to its wearer, and eases the use of spells of the Mirrored Path.  (Special Powers:  +30 Spell Points, 'of Light Magic' and 'of Dark Magic')"
msgstr ""
"这枚戒指是克里格斯城堡地下的炼金术士教派所作。它能给予佩戴者额外的魔法能量，更使光明和暗黑魔法的施放变得简单。（特殊威力：魔法值+30，光明和暗黑魔法类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2036
msgid "Igraine"
msgstr "伊格蓝尼"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2036
msgid ""
"Lord Solomon Stone had this ring commissioned during his tenure as High Priest of the Path in 1018.  It gives a huge boost to a user's ability in clerical magic, as well as access to a good deal of magical energy.  (Special Powers:  +25 Spell Points and 'of Body, Mind, and Spirit Magic')"
msgstr ""
"此戒指问世于1018年，由大主教所罗门·斯通命人打制。它可以极大地提高使用者的牧师类魔法威力，并获得大量的魔法能量。（特殊威力：魔法值+25，肢体、心智、灵魂魔法类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2037
msgid "Morgan"
msgstr "莫根"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2037
msgid ""
"Though Morgan's origins are unknown, Morgan has had many owners in the last hundred years, all of them unknown before finding the amulet.  The amulet is so mighty, as a matter of fact, that any peasant or child that lays hands on it is sure to become a legend in his own time.  (Special Powers:  +20 Spell Points and 'of Fire, Air, Water, and Earth Magic')"
msgstr ""
"此物来历不明，在近百年中数易其主，在未得到此护身符之前他们都是名不见经传的小人物。这个神器有无穷的魔力，任何携带它的人无论是平民百姓还是三岁孩童，都将有轰轰烈烈的传奇生涯。（特殊威力：魔法值+20，火系、空气、水系、土系魔法类属性）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2038
msgid ""
"A powerful weapon said to have been delivered up from the Netherworld in response to the wish of a prolific mass murderer.  The weapon inflicts terrible wounds with its razor sharp edge and drips acid constantly.  Not only a terrible weapon, the sword bestows the cunning of a master thief for disarming traps and the luck of the devil in escaping the damage they do.  Hades draws its power from its wielder slowly and constantly.  (Special Powers:  +20 Poison Damage, +20 Luck, Thievery, and Negative Regeneration)"
msgstr ""
"这件威力无穷的兵器据说来自阴间，曾经滥杀无辜，沾满了血腥。它的刀口锋利无比，被它划破的伤口难以愈合。它不仅是件可怕的兵器，而且还可给予使用者盗贼大师般的陷阱拆卸术和魔鬼般的躲避伤害能力。只要把它拿在手上，使用者的生命就会缓慢地流失。（特殊威力：附加20点毒系伤害，运气+20，偷窃术效果，逐渐流失生命）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2038
msgid "Hades"
msgstr "哈迪斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2039
msgid ""
"A powerful war-mace, Ares burns with fires from the heart of the mountain it was made from.  The same magic that causes it to burn with a terrible fire bestows resistance to fire upon its wielder.  (Special Powers:  +30 Fire Damage, +25 Fire Resistance)"
msgstr "它是一件威力无穷的战斗钉锤，在火山中心冶炼而成。由于经过真火锤炼，可提高使用者的防火能力。（特殊威力：附加30点火系伤害，火系抗性+25）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2039
msgid "Ares"
msgstr "阿瑞斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:204
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, wolf eyes can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。狼之眼可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:204
msgid "Wolf's Eye"
msgstr "狼之眼"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2040
msgid "Poseidon"
msgstr "波塞冬"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2040
msgid ""
"This trident is probably what inspired the Regnan navy to adopt the trident as their favorite weapon of war.  Poseidon fills its wielder with a frightening battle rage, increasing the wielder's might, endurance and accuracy at the cost of personal safety.  So consuming is the wielder's desire to smite his enemies while using Poseidon that he neglects to dodge blows he might otherwise have avoided.  On the other hand, dead enemies (usually) don't fight back.  (Special Powers:  +20 Might, +20 Endurance, +20 Accuracy, -10 Armor Class, and -10 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"正是因为此兵器的出现才使雷格那的海军全体选择三叉戟为其专用兵器。它在战斗中可使挥舞者异常暴怒，从而提高力量值、耐力值和准确值，但受伤毙命的危险也随之加大。由于战斗时勇气大增，对敌人的反击不屑一顾，毫不避让，所以容易受伤。但另一方面进攻是最好的防守，毙命的对手是不会反击的。（特殊威力：力量+20、耐力+20、准确+20、防御等级-10、速度-10）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2041
msgid "Cronos"
msgstr "克洛诺斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2041
msgid ""
"More a magical curiosity than a truly useful weapon, Cronos increases the wielder's vitality fantastically, and decreases his luck by half as much.  (Special Powers:  +100 Hit Points and -50 Luck)"
msgstr "与其说它是一件兵器不如说是一件魔法物品。它可以大大提高使用者的生命值，但运气值也随之下降。（特殊威力：生命值+100、运气-50）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2042
msgid ""
"A huge sword meant for the unsubtle, Hercules fills its wielder with the strength of a hundred men.  In keeping with its 'big and stupid' theme, the sword reduces the intelligence of its wielder while held.  (Special Powers:  +50 Might, +20 Endurance, and -30 Intellect)"
msgstr "这柄巨剑造型古朴，毫无机关。它可给予使用者百人之力。但由于笨重无比，会减少使用者的智力值。（特殊威力：力量+50、耐力+20、智力-30）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2042
msgid "Hercules"
msgstr "赫克拉斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2043
msgid "Artemis"
msgstr "阿缇密丝"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2043
msgid ""
"Graced with the might of thunder, Artemus fires bolts magically charged with electricity.  While powerful, the user of the bow should be careful--elemental magics seem drawn to the bow, and do more damage when they hit the wielder.  (Special Powers:  +20 Electricity damage, -10 to Elemental Resistances)"
msgstr ""
"阿缇密丝蕴含雷霆之力，射出的箭矢带有魔法充能的电流。虽然此弓威力强大，但使用者需多加小心——元素魔法似乎会被此弓吸引，命中持有者时造成的伤害会更大。（特殊威力：附加20点电系伤害，四项元素抗性-10）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2044
msgid "Apollo"
msgstr "阿波罗"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2044
msgid ""
"This unique armor graces its owner with luck, helping him to escape the brunt of most elemental attacks.  It draws its energy, however, from the constitution of its wearer, making the wearing of this armor a risky proposition.  (Special Powers:  +20 to Resistances, +20 Luck, and -30 Endurance)"
msgstr ""
"这件独一无二的铠甲可提高穿着者的运气值，使他逃脱元素魔法的攻击。但它消耗穿着者身上的能量，穿着此盔甲带有一定风险。（特殊威力：四项元素抗性+20，运气+20，耐力-30）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2045
msgid ""
"Perhaps this suit of armor was meant only for the Gods.  Worn at times by barbarian chieftains, the armor will increase the physical vitality and magical energy the wearer has at his disposal, but at a terrible cost.  House plants have been known to score higher on intelligence tests than wearers of this armor.  One would think that accidental death would surely follow such a precipitous loss of thought, yet the luck the armor bestows seems to prevent disaster.  Often the wearer of the armor becomes so stupid he forgets to remove it.  (Special Powers:  +50 Hit Points, +50 Spell Points,  +50 Luck, and -50 Intellect)"
msgstr ""
"这件盔甲原属于众神。由于长时间落在野蛮人酋长手里，所以可以使穿着者的生命力和魔法能量有极大提高。但也要因此付出沉重的代价，穿着者会变得蠢笨如牛，说不定哪一天就会死于非命，但同时运气值会有所提高，可以抵消一些负面影响。穿着者经常会笨得连脱下盔甲也想不起来。（特殊威力：生命值+50、魔法值+50、运气+50、智力-50）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2045
msgid "Zeus"
msgstr "宙斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2046
msgid "Aegis"
msgstr "伊杰斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2046
msgid ""
"Legend has it this shield was given as a gift from the Gods to a man wishing to fight the terrible medusas in their stronghold.  The shield is reflective and prevents the wielder from being frozen by the stoning gaze of the medusa.  It also carries an enchantment that helps protect against arrows, but the shield is very heavy and will slow the user down a bit.  (Special Powers:  Immune to Flesh to Stone effects, Shielding +20 Luck, and -20 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"传说它是众神赐予人类抵御美杜莎女妖的礼物。这件盾牌可以反射美杜莎的石化目光以避免被石化。它还拥有防御弓箭的魔力。但因为此盾牌沉重无比，使用者的行动速度也随之减慢。（特殊威力：免疫石化魔法效果，护盾类属性，运气+20，速度-20）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2047
msgid "Odin"
msgstr "奥丁"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2047
msgid ""
"This crown is a mighty relic that protects against elemental magic attacks of all kinds, but has a flaw that slows the wearer down tremendously.  (Special Powers:  +50 to Elemental Resistances and -40 Speed)"
msgstr "此头冠可以抵御各种元素魔法的攻击，但穿戴者的行动速度会大大降低。（特殊威力：四项元素抗性+50，速度-40）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2048
msgid "Atlas"
msgstr "阿特拉斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2048
msgid ""
"Legends say this cape was discarded by a God who became annoyed with the cape's magical slowing of his actions.  It confers an incomparable might to its wearer, at a large cost to speed.  (Special Powers:  +100 Might and -40 Speed)"
msgstr "传说神灵因为它的魔力使行动速度减慢而丢弃了它。它可以赋予使用者无与伦比的力量，但速度大大降低。（特殊威力：力量+100，速度-40）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2049
msgid ""
"A relic from before the Silence, these boots must conceal some hidden magic as they are very heavy, yet light once worn.  They act upon the nerves and muscles of their wearer, heightening his speed and reflexes to inhuman levels, but simultaneously causing inaccuracy and over-compensation.  The boots have been owned by many through the ages, all of whom have died from some speed related accident, like running up a hill at blazing speeds and then falling down the cliff at the top.  (Special Powers:  +100 Speed and -40 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""
"这是寂静时代之前的遗物。尽管闲置不用时非常沉重，但使用时轻巧自如。使用者的肌肉和神经系统都有很大提高，行动速度将快得难以置信。但同时准确值也有所下降，有时会付出沉重的代价。此物长久以来已经数易其主，每个人都因为速度过快而死于非命，比如冲上山顶之后从悬崖上掉了下来。（特殊威力：速度+100，准确-40）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2049
msgid "Hermes"
msgstr "赫尔墨斯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:205
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, gog blood can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。哥魔血可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:205
msgid "Phial of Gog Blood"
msgstr "哥魔血"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2050
msgid "Aphrodite"
msgstr "阿芙罗黛缇"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2050
msgid ""
"Desired and sought after by the foolish for ages, this beautiful ring smoothes the skin, clears the voice, and dramatically improves the physical beauty of its wearer, as well as enhancing the personality.  The ring also carries a curse of ill luck, and the wearer usually dies of some tragic accident soon after finding the ring.  (Special Powers:  +100 Personality and -40 Luck)"
msgstr ""
"一些笨蛋找了它几个世纪。这个美丽的戒指能使皮肤光滑，嗓音清澈，体态优美，从而提高其个性值。但此物被邪恶的魔力诅咒，常会使携带者死于非命。（特殊威力：个性+100，运气-40）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2051
msgid ""
"Also known as the Scholar's Ring, Athena vastly sharpens and improves the intellect of its wearer at the cost physical might.  Though the effect upon the physical body is nearly crippling, most sorcerers find the temptation to wear the ring too great to resist.  (Special Powers:  +100 Intellect and -40 Might)"
msgstr ""
"这是学者的戒指，戴上它智力将有惊人的提高，但同时力量会急剧下降。尽管知道力量将会减弱到极限，大多数法师依然无法抵御它的巨大诱惑而心甘情愿戴上此戒指。（特殊威力：智力+100，力量-40）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2051
msgid "Athena"
msgstr "雅典娜"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2052
msgid "Hera"
msgstr "赫拉"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2052
msgid ""
"Sometimes referred to as the Amulet of the Fool, this curious relic from before the Silence dramatically increases the personal vitality, magical energy, and luck of the wearer at the expense of personality.  While the armor is worn, the face goes slack, the eyes vacant, and the voice subsides to a monotone.  (Special Powers:  +50 Hit Points, +50 Spell Points, +50 Luck, and -50 Personality)"
msgstr ""
"这件寂静时代之前的遗物有时被称为“愚者护身符”，它以牺牲个性为代价，极大地增加了佩戴者的个人生命力、魔法能量和运气。戴上它时，脸部会变得松弛，眼神空洞，声音也会变得单调。（特殊威力：生命值+50，魔法值+50，运气+50，个性-50）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2053 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2054 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2055
msgid "A small leather pouch."
msgstr "一个小皮囊"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2053 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2054 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2055
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2177
msgid "Leather Pouch"
msgstr "皮囊"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2056
msgid "Hourglass"
msgstr "时间沙漏"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2056 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:117
msgid "Hourglass of Time"
msgstr "时间沙漏"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2056
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A fine hourglass made of crystal, framed with teak wood and filled with crushed pearl dust.  It is obviously enchanted."
msgstr "任务物件：外壳为水晶玻璃，木质骨架，里面装满珍珠砂，已经魔法点化。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2057
msgid "Chalice"
msgstr "圣杯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2057
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A chalice of silver with white gold tracery work detailing the sides and base.  A faint, steady humming sound can be heard coming from the cup of the chalice."
msgstr "任务物件：此高脚杯白银打造，两边和底座镶有白金。杯中可隐约听得微弱的声音。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2057
msgid "Sacred Chalice"
msgstr "圣杯"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2058
msgid ""
"A horn from the dragon Ros, killed during the Night of Shooting Stars.  This horn enables its owner to more accurately sense the wounds of his opponent."
msgstr "是在流星雨之夜除掉的巨龙罗斯的犄角。可使其持有者更精确地感知对手的受伤情况。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2058
msgid "Horn of Ros"
msgstr "罗斯之角"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2059
msgid ""
"A large Enrothian diamond, flawless and brilliant. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯大钻石，完美无瑕，光彩夺目。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:206
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, rubies can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。红宝石可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2060
msgid ""
"An Enrothian moonstone, appearing to glow from within. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯月亮石，仿佛从内部散发着光芒。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2061
msgid ""
"A sculpted piece of Enrothian amber. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一块雕琢过的恩洛斯琥珀。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2062
msgid ""
"An Enrothian ruby with a simple, efficient cut. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切工简洁利落的恩洛斯红宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2063
msgid ""
"An Enrothian amethyst. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯紫水晶。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2064
msgid ""
"A dark Enrothian emerald. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗深色的恩洛斯绿宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2065
msgid ""
"A purple Enrothian topaz, valuable due to the unusual color. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯紫黄宝石，因其罕见的色泽而颇具价值。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2065 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:100 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:110
msgid "Purple Topaz"
msgstr "紫黄宝石"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2066
msgid ""
"A finely cut Enrothian sunstone. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切工精细的恩洛斯太阳石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2066 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:102 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:112
msgid "Sunstone"
msgstr "太阳石"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2067
msgid ""
"A pale Enrothian emerald with a rare celadon hue. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗色泽浅淡、带有罕见青瓷色调的恩洛斯绿宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2068
msgid ""
"A large Enrothian sapphire. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯大蓝宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2069
msgid "Quest Item:  A large, flawless, purple gem on a golden base."
msgstr "任务物件：金色底座上镶有一大块完美无瑕的紫色美玉。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2069 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1343 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:116
msgid "The Third Eye"
msgstr "第三只眼"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:207
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, phoenix feathers can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。凤凰羽可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:207
msgid "Phoenix Feather"
msgstr "凤凰羽"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2070
msgid ""
"A pack of cold, heavy Tarot cards.  To use,  pick the cards up and right-click over a character's portrait."
msgstr "一副又冷又沉的算命扑克。使用时请拿起扑克，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2070
msgid "Deck of Fate"
msgstr "命运台"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2071 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1617 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1679
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1680 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1681
msgid "Ankh"
msgstr "十字架"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2071
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A symbolic item given by priests of Baa to signify the faithful, this ankh is inscribed with the name 'Gerrard Blackames.'"
msgstr "任务物件：由羊鸣教神甫赐予的表示忠贞程度的饰物。上面刻有杰拉德·布莱克墨斯的名字。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2072
msgid "Candelabra"
msgstr "蜡烛台"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2072
msgid "Quest Item: A silver candelabra etched with symbols of Baa."
msgstr "任务物件：由羊鸣教制作的白银蜡烛台，为该教信物。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2073
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A tiger statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr "任务物件：一个虎形小雕像。制作精美，栩栩如生。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2074
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A bear statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr "任务物件：一个熊形小雕像。制作精美，栩栩如生。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2075
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A wolf statuette.  Though highly stylized, there is something remarkably lifelike about it."
msgstr "任务物件：一个狼形小雕像。制作精美，栩栩如生。"

