# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1493 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:691
msgid ""
"A small chunk of phylt-laced ore.  Phylt is often used in steel alloys to increase the durability and enchantability of steel.  In the hands of a skilled craftsman phylt could make a weapon, an amulet, a ring, armor, or almost any other useful item."
msgstr ""
"这是一小块含有非尔的矿石。非尔经常被用于钢铁合金中，以增加钢铁的耐久性和魔力。在熟练的工匠的手中，非尔可以制造出武器、护身符、戒指、盔甲，或者几乎任何其他有用的物品。"

