# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:97
msgid "Rusty Breastplate"
msgstr "生锈胸甲"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:97
msgid ""
"This piece of plate armor salvaged from a larger suit is so corroded it is a question whether it is equipment for a warrior or junk for the scrap man."
msgstr "这套盔甲是从本来更大的盔甲上抢救下来的，由于腐蚀的太过严重，所以很难看出来这到底是战士的装备还是捡破烂人的宝物。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:98
msgid "Banded Plate"
msgstr "箍化钢甲"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:98
msgid ""
"Bands of steel cover the mid-torso of this chain and plate chest armor. While lighter and simpler to construct than continuously formed plate, this armor offers less protection than heavier plate."
msgstr "这个结合了锁甲和钢甲的盔甲在身体的中段是由钢条所结合的保护。虽然这比一整块的钢板所打造的钢甲要轻，构造简单，但也比那样的钢甲防护力要低。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:99
msgid ""
"An example of the work produced by the Minotaur armorers of Balthazar Lair, this plate armor provides excellent mid-section protection. The arms are left free in the Minotaur-style."
msgstr ""
"这是巴尔萨煞的牛头人盔甲工匠所打造的产品最典型的范例。这种钢甲提供了极佳的防护力，而双臂则是以牛头人平常的惯例展露在外面，以提供较佳的运动性。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:99
msgid "Minotaur Plate"
msgstr "牛头人钢甲"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:991
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan mountain crystal. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一块恩塔格瑞山地水晶。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:991
msgid "Blue Quartz"
msgstr "蓝色石英"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:992
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan small topaz. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩塔格瑞小型黄宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:993
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan large emerald. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩塔格瑞大型绿宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:994
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan sapphire in a flat round brilliant cut.  As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切割成扁平圆形明亮式的恩塔格瑞蓝宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:995
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan green garnet in a unique flat square step cut. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切割成独特扁平方形阶梯式的恩塔格瑞绿色石榴石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:995
msgid "Green Garnet"
msgstr "绿色石榴石"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:996
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan gemstone with a subtle rose hue. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗带有淡淡玫瑰色泽的恩塔格瑞宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:996
msgid "Rose Crystal"
msgstr "玫瑰水晶"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:997
