# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:998
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan amethyst in an appealing round briliant shape. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切割成迷人圆形明亮式的恩塔格瑞紫水晶。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法特性，卖掉也无妨。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:999
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan topaz, step cut and set in a bronze frame. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
