"With Master Body Magic you can learn all of the Master spells for this devotion.\n"
"Higher level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\n"
"Master Body Magic can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 in Body Magic and can pay the price of 4000 gold."
msgstr ""
"在肢体魔法达到了大师级之后，你可以学习肢体魔法中所有的大师级魔法。魔法的级别越高，\n"
"更高级的法术威力更强，对你的队伍帮助也更大。\n"
"如果你的肢体魔法专家级技能达到 7 级并支付 4000 金币，大师级肢体魔法就是你的了。"

