# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:10
msgid ""
"Summons flaming rocks from the sky which fall in a large radius surrounding your chosen target.  Try not to be near the victim when you use this spell.  A single meteor does 8 points of damage plus 1 per point of skill in Fire Magic.  This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""
"召唤一大群的高热石块痛击你的目标周围的地点一次可以召唤来十六颗陨石，每个陨石可以造成8点的杀伤力，每个等级的火系魔法技能会再增加1点的杀伤力。只能在野外产生作用。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:101 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:100
msgid ""
"Enchants a weapon with the Vampiric ability.  Damage inflicted on monsters struck by this weapon will be given to the weapon's wielder as extra hit points, up to his or her normal hit point maximum."
msgstr ""
"让某个武器拥有吸血鬼的能力。该项武器对敌人所造成的伤害将可以加成到持有者的身上，上限则是持有者原先的最大生命值。有效时间则是施法者的暗黑魔法技能每个等级可以增加1小时。"

# imported from zh-cn-conflicts.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/Global.txt:124 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:101 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:100
