msgid "Reduces monster size to one half normal"
msgstr "使怪兽身躯缩小一半"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:102 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:101
msgid "Reduces monster size to one third normal"
msgstr "使怪兽身躯缩小到三分之一"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:102 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:101
msgid "Shrink Ray"
msgstr "缩身大法"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:102 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:101
msgid ""
"Shrinks even the grandest of monsters down to more manageable sizes. Duration of this spell is 5 minutes per point of skill in Dark Magic. Depending on the caster's expertise, a shrunken monster deals one half, one third, or one quarter its normal damage while shrunk."
msgstr "将目标生物的大小缩小。被缩小的生物将只能造成平日一半、三分之一或是四分之一的伤害。有效时间是施法者的暗黑魔法技能乘以5分钟。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:102 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:101
msgid "Will affect other monsters near the target"
msgstr "效果扩及到整个区域（可以将一整群的怪物体积缩小）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:103 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:102
