# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:12
msgid ""
"Among the strongest direct damage spells available, Incinerate inflicts massive damage on a single target.  Only the strongest of monsters can expect to survive this spell.  Damage is 15 points plus 1-15 per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "它是最具威力的单一目标攻击魔法之一。摧毁力极大，只有最强大的怪兽才有可能侥幸逃生。攻击力为15点加上魔法等级的1-15倍。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:109 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:25
