# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:122 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:121
msgid "Vampire Abilities"
msgstr "吸血鬼能力"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:123 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:122
msgid "Damage 5 points plus 1-5 per point of skill"
msgstr "基础杀伤力为5点，每个吸血鬼能力技能等级将可以造成额外的1-5点杀伤力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:123 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:122
msgid "Damage 7 points plus 1-7 per point of skill"
msgstr "基础杀伤力为7点，每个吸血鬼能力技能等级将可以造成额外的1-7点杀伤力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:123 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:122
msgid "Lifedrain"
msgstr "吸血"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:123 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:122
msgid ""
"Lifedrain allows the vampire to damage his or her target and simultaneously heal based on the damage done in the Lifedrain.  This ability does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 points of damage per skill."
msgstr ""
"生命吸收让吸血鬼可以对敌人造成伤害，并且同时医好自己，这伤害的能力和他所吸收的生命值有关。这个能力的基础杀伤力是3点，每个技能等级可以造成额外的1-3点伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:123 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:122
msgid "Vampire heals 1/3 the damage done by Lifedrain"
msgstr "杀伤力如同前述，但是吸血鬼可以获得对方减损的三分之一生命力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:124 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:123
msgid "Duration 3 hours per point of skill"
msgstr "每个技能等级可以让该能力的效果持续三小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:124 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:123
msgid ""
"This ability allows the vampire to levitate the party slightly off the ground, avoiding damage from drowning or lava, and also avoiding setting off ground traps."
msgstr "这个能力可以让吸血鬼把整个队伍稍稍漂浮离地面，避开溺水或是熔岩的危险，同时也不会触发地面的陷阱。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:125 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:124
msgid ""
"A vampire using this ability can charm a small group of targets in close proximity."
msgstr "吸血鬼能使用该能力魅惑附近的一小群目标。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:125 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:124
msgid "Duration permanent"
msgstr "永久持续"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:126 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:125
msgid ""
"Mistform allows the vampire to render himself immune to physical damage.  However, a vampire in Mistform cannot perform any physical attacks.  Vampires in Mistform are able to use spells and abilities and are affected by spells and abilities."
msgstr ""
"在大师等级的时候，雾化的能力可以让吸血鬼幻化成迷雾，不受物理性攻击的伤害。虽然雾化的吸血鬼不能施展物理性攻击，但是他们依旧可以使用魔法和天赋能力，同时也依旧会受到魔法和其它生物能力的影响。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:14 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:13
msgid "Air Spells"
msgstr "空气法术"

