msgstr "霹雳闪电"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:20
msgid ""
"Lightning Bolt discharges electricity from the caster�s hand to a single target.  It always hits and does 1-8 points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "霹雳闪电从施法者手中向单一目标释放电流，必定命中，每点空气魔法技能等级造成1-8点伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:22 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:21
msgid ""
"Invisibility works on the minds of nearby creatures, making them unable to notice the party unless spoken to or attacked.  Any attack you make, regardless of whether or not it hits or misses, will break this spell. This spell can't be cast while hostile monsters are nearby."
msgstr ""
"让队伍对于一般生物来说变成隐形。如果队伍开口或是攻击（不管有没有击中敌人），这个魔法就会失效。当有敌意的生物在附近时，这个魔法是无法施展的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:23 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:27 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:22
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:26
msgid "Fast recovery rate"
msgstr "快速恢复"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:23 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:22
msgid ""
"Implosion is a nasty spell that affects a single target by destroying the air around it, causing a sudden inrush from the surrounding air, a thunderclap, and 10 points plus 1-10 points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""
"这是一个肮脏的魔法，它通过破坏周围的空气，造成周围空气的突然涌入，形成霹雳，来伤害单个目标。它的攻击力为10点加上自身魔法等级的1-10倍。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:24 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:23
msgid ""
"Grants the power of flight to your characters!  This spell is very expensive and only works outdoors, but it is very useful.  Fly will drain one spell point every five minutes it is in use (i.e. when you aren't touching the ground)."
msgstr ""
"只要在魔法的有效时间内，您的队伍成员就可以飞起来。这个魔法非常的昂贵，而且只能够在室外使用，不过也算是非常的有用。队伍在空中每多待5分钟，施法者的魔法值就会被吸取一点。（只要你脚不碰地都算）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:137 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:24 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:31
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:136 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:23 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:30
msgid "No spell point drain"
msgstr "不消耗额外魔法值"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:25 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:24
msgid ""
"Calls stars from the heavens to smite and burn your enemies.  Twenty stars are called, and the damage for each star is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Air Magic. Try not to get caught in the blast! This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""
"从苍穹中呼唤来二十颗星辰，砸落在目标的四周，对目标和它周遭的生物造成严重的伤害。每颗星辰会造成20点的伤害，另外每一等级的空气魔法额外加上一点的杀伤力。只在室外有效。千万不要被卷进爆炸的范围中！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:26 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:25
msgid "Water Spells"
msgstr "水系法术"

