msgid ""
"Only useful outdoors, Water Walk lets your characters walk along the surface of water without sinking.  In addition to its casting cost, one spell point is expended every 20 minutes while your party is in contact with water."
msgstr "只在室外产生作用。让您的队伍可以在水面上行走，不至于下沉。队伍每和水接触二十分钟，就会消耗额外的一点魔法值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:31
msgid "Item loses 20% - 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "最大剩余使用次数会降低20%，每个技能等级可以扣减1%的降低值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:31
msgid "Item loses 30% - 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "最大剩余使用次数会降低30%，每个技能等级可以扣减1%的降低值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:31
msgid "Item loses 50% - 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "最大剩余使用次数会降低50%，每个技能等级可以扣减1%的降低值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:31
msgid "Recharge"
msgstr "魔力填充"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:32 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:31
msgid ""
"Recharges any magic item that uses charges.  Every time this spell is cast, the item permanently loses 50% - 1 per point of skill in Water magic of its charges."
msgstr "恢复魔法道具的使用次数。但道具的最大使用次数会减少。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:33 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:32
msgid ""
"Acid burst squirts a jet of extremely caustic acid at a single victim.  It always hits and does 9 points of damage plus 1-9 per point of skill."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射强酸。它的攻击力为9点加上自身魔法等级的1-9倍，并且百发百中。绝大多数怪兽不具有抗酸能力。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:34 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:33
msgid "Moderate strength enchantments"
msgstr "点化效果一般"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:34 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:33
msgid "Strong enchantments"
msgstr "点化效果非常好"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:34 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:33
msgid ""
"When cast, this spell has a chance of imbuing a normal item with magical powers.  The chance of success is 10% per point of skill in Water Magic.  Grandmasters can manage better enchantments."
msgstr ""
"让普通的物品附上魔法。成功的机会是每个水系魔法等级乘以10%。魔法的威力中等，不能够施展在任务所需的物品上。宗师等级的法师可以施展更强而有力的附着魔法。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:35 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:34
msgid "Does not work while hostile monsters are nearby"
msgstr "敌人在附近时不能使用"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:35 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:34
msgid ""
"Town Portal teleports the party to any town where the party has drunk from the central fountain.  Town Portal has a 10% chance per point of Water Magic skill of working when cast, and cannot be used while hostile monsters are nearby."
msgstr "把整个队伍传送到他们所拜访过的城镇。成功的机率是施法者的水系魔法等级乘以10%。当有敌意的生物在附近的时候，这个魔法无法施展。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:35 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:34
msgid "Works while hostile monsters are nearby"
msgstr "敌人在附近时也能使用"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:36 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:35
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 9 shards"
msgstr "快速恢复，可发出9块碎片"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:35
msgid ""
"Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions except the caster�s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-6 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""
"向施法者面朝的方向发射一颗冰球。冰球撞到物体时会碎裂，向除施法者外的各个方向射出7块冰屑。冰屑会弹射，直到击中生物或融化为止。每块冰屑造成12点伤害，外加每点水系魔法技能等级1-6点伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:36 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:35
msgid "Moderate recovery rate and 7 shards"
msgstr "恢复速度一般，可发出7块碎片"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:37 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:36
msgid "Lloyd's"
msgstr "时空道标"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:36
msgid ""
"Lloyd�s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill in Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place a marker or return to one.  Each beacon will decay after 1 week per point of skill in Water magic after it is placed."
msgstr ""
"时空道标允许你在某个地点放置一个标记，以便日后传送回来。能保留多久取决于你的水系魔法技能等级。想放置标记或返回某个标记时就施展此法术。每个道标在放置后，每点水系魔法技能等级可保留一周。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:38 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:37
msgid "Earth Spells"
msgstr "土系法术"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:40 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:38
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:39
msgid "Normal effect"
msgstr "威力一般"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:38
msgid ""
"Slaps a monster with magical force, forcing it to recover from the stun spell before it can do anything else.  Stun also knocks monsters back a little, giving you a chance to get away while the getting is good.  The greater your skill in Earth Magic, the greater the effect of the spell."
msgstr "可以使你用魔法击打怪兽使其失去知觉，但不能取它性命。你的魔法等级越多，该魔法的威力越大。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:38
msgid "Stronger effect"
msgstr "威力较大"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:38
msgid "Strongest effect"
msgstr "威力最大"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:40 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:69
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:66 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:68
msgid "Duration 5 min per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以5分钟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:40 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:39
msgid ""
"Halves the walking speed and doubles the recovery rate of a single monster.  Slow makes sure a monster will attack you half as often, and will have a harder time catching up to you if you choose to run.  The duration of this spell is 1 minute per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""
"使敌人行动力减半，同时恢复时间加倍。这样一来，它们攻击你的次数将大大减少，在你逃跑时，它们也很难追到你。该魔法的持续时间为土系魔法等级乘以1分钟。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:40 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:39 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:583
