msgstr "御土奇术"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:40
msgid ""
"Increases all of your characters� resistance to Earth Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Earth. The effect lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "施法者的土系魔法等级每一点可以增加目标对象对于土系魔法一点的抵抗力，每一点的土系魔法技能可以增加魔法一个小时的持续时间。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:42 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:41
msgid ""
"Summons a swarm of biting, stinging insects to bedevil a single target.  The swarm does 5 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "召唤来一群昆虫，会对单一的目标又叮又咬。杀伤力为5点，施法者的每个等级的土系魔法技能可以增加额外的1-3点伤害，而且永远不会打不中。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:42 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:41
msgid "Swarm"
msgstr "致命毒蜂"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:43 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:42
msgid ""
"Increases all of your characters' armor class by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "增加目标5点防御等级，施法者每个等级的土系魔法技能可以增加一点的防御等级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:44 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:43
msgid ""
"Fires a rotating, razor-thin metal blade at a single monster.  The blade does 1-9 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射旋转刀刃。每片刀刃的杀伤力为土系魔法等级的1-9倍。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:45 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:55 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:59
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:68 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:71 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:80
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:82 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:44 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:54
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:58 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:70
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:79 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:81
msgid "No time limit"
msgstr "无时间限制"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:44
msgid ""
"Removes the stoned condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Earth Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the �point of no return� is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"若及时施法，可解除角色的石化状态。土系魔法的技能与等级越高，状态存在多久后才会越过“不可挽回点”。越过之后，除非施展普渡众生，否则只能前往神庙解除状态。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:45 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:44
msgid "Stone - Flesh"
msgstr "解除石化"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:45 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:44
msgid "Works if stoned less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以破解的最长石化时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:45 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:44
msgid "Works if stoned less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以破解的最长石化时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:46 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:45
msgid ""
"Releases a magical stone into the world that will explode when it comes into contact with a creature or enough time passes.  The rock will bounce and roll until it finds a resting spot, so be careful not to be caught in the blast.  The explosion causes 10 points of damage plus 1-10 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""
"施放一个魔法的岩石进入这个世界，让它四处弹跳和滚动。当它击中生物或是停下来的时候，就会自动爆炸，所以请千万小心，不要被卷入爆炸范围中。每个土系魔法等级能够造成1-8点的伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:47 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:46
msgid ""
"Telekinesis lets you manipulate an object at a distance.  Switches can be thrown, objects picked up, and doors opened with this spell, all from a nice safe distance from those nasty traps."
msgstr "可以操纵远处的事物，如远距离开门、开宝箱或得到物品。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:48 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:47
msgid "Death Blsm"
msgstr "死亡之花"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:48 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:47
msgid "Faster recovery rate, double effect of skill"
msgstr "快速恢复，效果加倍"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:48 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:47
msgid ""
"Launches a magical stone which bursts in air, sending shards of explosive earth raining to the ground.  The damage is 20 points plus 2 per point of skill in Earth Magic for each shard.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr "对空中发射一颗岩石，让它爆炸成碎片。杀伤力是20点，施法者的土系魔法技能每点可以增加额外的一点杀伤力。只能够在室外施展。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:48
msgid ""
"Increases the weight of a single target enormously for an instant, causing internal damage equal to 25% of the monster�s hit points plus another 2% per point of skill in Earth Magic.  The bigger they are, the harder they fall."
msgstr "瞬间使单一目标的体重急剧增加，造成的内伤等于该怪物当前生命值的25%，外加每点土系魔法技能等级2%。体型越大，跌得越重。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:49 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:48
msgid "Mass Distort"
msgstr "力压千钧"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:50 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:49
msgid "Spirit Spells"
msgstr "灵魂法术"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:6 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:5
msgid ""
"Causes a weapon that has no special abilities to burn with a magical fire, giving the weapon the \"of Fire\" ability.  This spell lasts for one hour per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "让没有特殊属性的武器沾染上魔法火焰，从而给予武器“火焰类”的能力。有效时间是每个技能等级一个小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:6 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:5
msgid "Grants \"of Fire\""
msgstr "给予“火焰类”属性"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:6 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:5
