# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:53 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:52
msgid ""
"Fate can be used on a character to increase his chance to hit, or on a monster to decrease its chance.  The chance is modified by 20 + 1 per point of skill in Spirit Magic, and lasts until the target attacks, or 5 minutes go by."
