#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:53
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "该魔法的有效时间为魔法等级乘以1分钟再加上3分钟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:54 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:53
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "该魔法的有效时间为魔法等级乘以3分钟再加上3分钟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:54 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:70 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:53
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:69
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 5 per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以3分钟"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:54 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:53
msgid ""
"Forces all visible undead monsters to flee until the duration of Turn Undead runs out.  This spell lasts for 3 minutes plus one minute per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "使所有视野范围内的亡灵怪兽全部望风而逃。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:54
msgid ""
"Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the �point of no return� is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"若及时施法，可解除角色的诅咒状态。灵魂魔法的技能与等级越高，状态存在多久后才会越过“不可挽回点”。越过之后，除非施展普渡众生，否则只能前往神庙解除状态。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:55 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:54
msgid "Rmv. Curse"
msgstr "驱魔除咒"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:55 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:54
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长被诅咒时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:55 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:54
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长被诅咒时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:56 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:55
msgid ""
"Preservation more tightly binds the soul to the body. This will delay death due to massive hit point loss, but will not stop a character from going unconscious. If a preserved character's hit points are too low when the spell wears off, he or she will die."
msgstr ""
"借着将某个角色的灵魂和肉体之间建立更强烈的连接，这个魔法将可以提供对于立即死亡或是灰飞烟灭这类不良状态的保护，或者是怪物的类似攻击。这个魔法同时也可以让角色不会因为大量的生命值减少而死亡。这名角色将会自动陷入昏迷状态中。如果当魔法的效果消失后，这名角色所受到的伤害依旧太重，那么他将会死亡。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:56 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:55
msgid "Works on entire party"
msgstr "对整个队伍都有效"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:57 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:56
msgid ""
"Heroism increases the damage a character does on a successful attack by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Spirit Magic. This spell affects the entire party at once."
msgstr "让队伍成员攻击对方时所造成的伤害增加5点，施法者的灵魂魔法等级每增加一点，就可以增加额外的一点伤害。这个魔法的效果可以影响到所有的队员。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:58 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:57
msgid ""
"This spell weakens the link between a target's body and soul, causing 10 + 2-8 points of damage per point of skill in Spirit Magic to all monsters near the caster."
msgstr ""
"这个魔法可以借着削弱他的灵魂和躯体之间的连接来伤害对方。杀伤力是10点，施法者的每个灵魂魔法等级可以造成2-8的杀伤力。该名生物必需要十分靠近才能够让魔法生效。如果当魔法施展的时候，目标在射程之外，那么魔法将会不耗费魔法值的自动失效。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:58
msgid ""
"Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer a character can have been dead before the �point of no return� is reached.  After that, the only way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""
"若及时施法，可将已死的角色复活。灵魂魔法的技能与等级越高，角色死亡多久后才会越过“不可挽回点”。越过之后，除非施展普渡众生，否则只能前往神庙复活。施法后角色将处于虚弱状态。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:59 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:58
msgid "Works if dead less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长死亡时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:60 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:59
msgid "Adds 3 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "每个魔法等级增加3点全员总生命值"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:60 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:59
msgid "Adds 4 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "加上施法者的灵魂魔法等级的4倍"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:60 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:59
msgid ""
"Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and 3 extra points per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total. Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit points."
msgstr ""
"把生命值集合起来，再平分给队伍中的每个人。集合起来的生命值等于所有队员的生命值和，施法者的每个灵魂魔法的等级可以再增加额外的3点生命值。最后这些生命值会全部分配回去给每个角色，每个角色最多不可能获得超过最大值的生命值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:7 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:6
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 1 minute per skill point"
msgstr "持续时间为1小时加上1分钟乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:7 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:6
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 3 minutes per skill point"
msgstr "持续时间为1小时加上3分钟乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:7 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:6
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 4 minutes per skill point"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以4分钟再加1小时"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:7 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:6
msgid ""
"Reduces the time it takes for all of your characters to recover from casting spells or attacking with their weapons.  When the spell wears off, they become weak.."
msgstr ""
"减少队员行动时所需要的恢复时间，有效时间是1小时加上火系魔法的每一个技能等级可以获得额外的1分钟。在魔法效果结束之后，队伍将会陷入6小时的虚弱状态。这个魔法效果可以一次影响整个队伍。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:61 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:60
msgid ""
"Resurrects a character whose body has been destroyed.  Recovery rate is very slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit Magic.  The resurrected character will be in a weak condition after this spell is cast."
msgstr ""
"在他的身体已经被摧毁之后，照旧让一个人复活。复活之后的角色将会比较虚弱。施法者需要很长的一段时间才能够恢复行动力。但是所需要的时间将会随着灵魂魔法技能的增加而缩短。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:62 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:61
msgid "Mind Spells"
msgstr "心智法术"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:63 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:62
msgid ""
"Caster reads the target's mind, finding out exactly how much gold and what items the target has."
msgstr "与施法对象的心灵产生共鸣，可以知道他带有什么宝物以及身上有多少钱。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:107 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:63 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:66
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:96 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:106 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:62
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:65 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:95
msgid "Slow recovery rate"
msgstr "恢复较慢"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:63
msgid ""
"Removes the afraid condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the spell no longer is effective.  After that, the condition may only be removed by resting or at a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展，它可以消除目标角色的恐惧。施法者的心智魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的恐惧状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:63
msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以治疗的最长恐惧时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:63
msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以治疗的最长恐惧时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:63
msgid "Works if afraid less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以治疗的最长恐惧时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:75 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:63
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:74
msgid "Works no matter how much time has passed"
msgstr "无时间限制"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:64
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters� resistance to Mind Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Mind Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的心系抗性。增加的抗性等于心智魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于心智魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:65 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:64
msgid "Mind Resist"
msgstr "御心奇术"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:66 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:65
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of mental force which damages a single target's nervous system.  Mind Blast does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr "对准单一目标发射心灵能源束，杀伤力是3点，每一点的心智魔法技能可以造成1-3点的伤害。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:66
msgid ""
"Calms a single targeted creature and removes any hostile feelings it has towards your characters.  If this creature takes any damage, it will immediately become hostile again."
msgstr "可以使单一目标平息怒气，消除对你的敌意。但如果它遭到攻击，将立刻重新还击。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:66
msgid "Spell lasts until party leaves the map target is in"
msgstr "在队伍离开地图前该魔法一直有效"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:68 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:67
msgid "Cure P-lyze"
msgstr "治愈麻痹"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:68 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:67
msgid ""
"Cures paralysis if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the character can have been paralyzed before the \"point of no return\" is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"如果及时施展，将可以治愈目标角色所受到的麻痹效果。施法者的心智魔法技能越高，该人之前可以陷入越久的麻痹状态中。在那之后，除了普渡众生魔法之外，唯一消除这个状态的办法就是去神庙治疗了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:68 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:67
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长麻痹时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:68 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:67
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长麻痹时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:69 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:68
msgid ""
"Causes a single monster to go mad with battle lust, attacking the nearest living creature until the spell wears off."
msgstr "使施法对象充满杀意，疯狂攻击邻近的任何生物。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:69 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:68
msgid "Duration is 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "在队伍离开地图前该魔法一直有效"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:69
msgid ""
"All creatures in the caster�s sight fear the caster and flee.  If a creature takes damage while under the influence of this spell, the spell will be broken. The duration of Mass Fear is 3 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic.  Mass Fear will not work on undead creatures."
msgstr ""
"施法者视野内的所有生物都会因恐惧而逃离。若生物在此期间受到伤害，法术立即失效。凶神恶煞的持续时间为每点心智魔法技能等级3分钟。对亡灵生物无效。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/spells.txt:8 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/spells.txt:7
msgid ""
"Fires a ball of fire at a single target. When it hits, the ball explodes damaging all those nearby, including your characters if they're too close.  Fireball does 1-6 points of damage per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""
"这也是巫师最喜欢用的魔法。对准单一目标发射火球，当火球爆炸的时候，会伤及附近的任何人，如果队伍太靠近也是一样。施法者每个火系魔法的技能等级会造成1-6点的伤害。"

