# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3124 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10006
msgid ""
"The plan involves stealing the soul jars the Necromancers rely on to prolong their miserable lives.\n"
"They have them hidden somewhere in their Guild Castle, and are probably not prepared for the kind of small scale assault you people are so good at.\n"
"A quick strike--in and out--should do the trick.\n"
"Don't hang around the castle too long, or reinforcements will arrive, and try to get it right the first time, or they will permanently double their patrols.\n"
"Once you have the soul jars, bring them back here so we can dispose of them properly."
msgstr ""
"这个计划包括偷走死灵法师赖以苟活续命的灵魂罐。\n"
"他们把那些东西藏在行会城堡的某处，很可能没有准备好应对你们这些人最擅长的那种小规模突袭。\n"
"一次快速的打击——进去再出来——就能解决问题。\n"
"别在城堡里逗留太久，否则援军会赶到；而且要争取一次成功，否则他们会永久加倍巡逻。\n"
"一旦你们拿到灵魂罐，就把它们带回来，这样我们就能妥善处理掉。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10025
msgid ""
"Be well prepared when you go for the jars.\n"
"Their security won't be so lax if you have to retreat and return.\n"
msgstr ""
"你们去取罐子时要准备充分。\n"
"你们若被迫撤退再回来，他们的警戒就不会这么松了。\n"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3129 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10028
msgid ""
"[Sir Caneghem looks at the jars curiously, as though observing a poisonous snake behind glass] So these are soul jars.\n"
"I expected something more…impressive, I suppose.\n"
"Good job!\n"
"[he takes the case of jars] I will make sure these jars are never seen again."
msgstr ""
"（卡格汉好奇地看着灵魂之坛，好象隔着玻璃看一条毒蛇）这就是灵魂之坛吗？我还以为是什么神奇的东西，原来就是几个破坛子。你们这次行动非常出色，我要让这些坛子永远消失。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3136 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10046
msgid ""
"Our counterparts, the former advisors to Archibald, each carry a token called a command cube on their person that we absolutely must acquire to complete the Goal.\n"
"There is no way any of them will part with their cube willingly, which means that we must get it some other way.\n"
"You will have to take it from one of them, and we think the easiest would be Tolberti.\n"
"Unlike the rest of them, he disdains proper security and has taken up residence in one of the apartments in the Pit.\n"
"I need you to infiltrate the pit again and get the cube from him.\n"
"Be careful--he is well armed and much tougher than he appears.\n"
"When you have the Cube, return to me.\n"
"We have but a short distance to the Goal, and all will be revealed very soon."
msgstr ""
"我们的死对头是阿基巴德手下那些死灵法师。他们每个人身上都有一块控制晶片，只有拿到这个东西我们的计划才能成功。看来他们谁都不会心甘情愿地把控制晶片交出来，我们只好另想办法了。你们的任务就是想办法从他们之中的一个人身上拿到控制晶片，我们已经探听清楚了，最容易下手的是一个叫托尔伯蒂的，他不象其他人护卫众多，防守森严，而是孤身一人住在地狱城的别墅里。你们要想方设法潜入地狱城，从他身上得到控制晶片。和他交手你们得千万小心，不要被他的柔弱的外表所迷惑，他可是个很不容易对付的对手。如果你们拿到控制晶片，马上回来交给我，这样我们的计划就快大功告成了，到时候会向你们透露真相的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3148 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10080
msgid ""
"Keep trying to find his apartment.\n"
"Tolberti has never really believed anything bad could happen to him, and so far he's been right.\n"
"We need to prove him wrong.\n"
"Take the cube any way you can.\n"
"If you can do it without violence, fine.\n"
"If you must kill him, well, that's O.K. too.\n"
"Just get the cube."
msgstr ""
"你们要加紧寻找托尔伯蒂。他曾经扬言没有人能够伤他半根毫毛，我们现在就想给他点利害瞧瞧。你们要想办法把控制晶片夺过来，能够不伤他性命那最好不过，不然的话就索性把他干掉，快去吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3144 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10083
msgid ""
"[Robert takes the cube] Once again, you succeed!\n"
"The Goal is so close!\n"
"I know you have many questions, and I'm sure Resurectra will answer them all, after you do just one more mission for her.\n"
"You will find her with Gavin Magnus in the throne room of Castle Lambent."
msgstr ""
"（罗伯特拿着控制晶片）你们又成功了！我们就快大功告成了。我知道你们有许多问题想问个明白，快去瑞瑟雷克特那里吧，只要再为她完成一个任务，她就会把我们的计划和盘托出的。她现在正和格文·马格努斯在光辉城堡的宫殿里呢！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3155 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10100
msgid ""
"We need your help retrieving half of a key to a very important place from our enemies, the Wizards.\n"
"Like us, they have enshrined their half of the key in their highest temple--The Temple of the Light.\n"
"It'll be a snap.\n"
"Most so called good people spend more time defending and healing themselves than delivering damage.\n"
"How can you win if you don't fight?\n"
"Anyway, take your time and act when you're prepared.\n"
"Also, bring our half of the key to us, as well.\n"
"It is enshrined in the Temple of the Darkness.\n"
"Since you're our ally, no one should trouble you when you go there to fetch the key.\n"
"But if you feel like you need the practice, go ahead a take a whack at some of them.\n"
"They're not very important, and most of them can regenerate from even the most severe injuries.\n"
"Try it--it's alot of fun!"
msgstr ""
"我们需要你们的帮助。你们要到光明神庙去一趟。那里是我们的死对头光明法师供奉圣坛碎片的地方。你们要想方设法把那块圣坛碎片拿来。这个任务真是太简单了，这帮家伙只知道救死扶伤，治病救人，根本不会花时间去修炼致人死命的魔法，你们去拿圣坛碎片可谓轻而易举。如果准备好了，就赶快出发吧。\n"
"你们还要把另一块圣坛碎片也拿来给我，它就供奉在我们的暗黑神庙里。你们是我们的朋友，神庙里的人不会找你们麻烦的，不过你们要是觉得自己功力不够，想增加点经验值的话不妨拿神庙里的人开刀，他们都是些无足轻重的小人物，而且很多人具有自我恢复的能力，所以你们尽管痛下杀手，不必留情。杀人可是件很爽的事哦！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3174 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10120
msgid ""
"Well, I'm glad you found our half of the key, but you still need their half.\n"
"Hold onto it until you get the other half.\n"
"When you have both halves, get back over here and I'll fix them."
msgstr ""
"嗯，你们去了那么长时间，我还以为你们在光明神庙完蛋了呢！现在你们拿到他们的那块圣坛碎片了，可我们那一块还没拿到。快去暗黑神庙吧，把两块碎片配齐了送到我这儿来，我会使它们完好如初的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10123
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"[Kastore takes the two halves of the key and bangs them together.\n"
"With a bright white flash, they join together seamlessly]\n"
"The first part of the Plan is complete.\n"
"I knew we, uh, Archibald made the right decision in trusting you!\n"
msgstr ""
"好极！\n"
"[卡斯托拿过两半钥匙，把它们一撞。\n"
"一道耀眼白光闪过，它们无缝拼合]\n"
"计划第一部分完成。\n"
"我就知道我们，呃，阿基巴德信任你们是做对了！\n"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3177 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10136
msgid ""
"Finally!\n"
"I was beginning to wonder if you might have got yourselves killed already.\n"
"Well, no matter.\n"
"You forgot to get the key from the Temple of the Dark, so be on your way.\n"
"When you have it, return to me so I can make the two halves whole again."
msgstr "不错，你们拿到我们的那块圣坛碎片了，可光明神庙里的那一块还没到手。你们把两块圣坛碎片都拿到再来找我吧，我会把它们拼好的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3167 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10138
msgid ""
"No key halves yet?\n"
"Bah!\n"
"I hope you're more competent than you seem right now!\n"
"How hard can this be?\n"
"All you have to do is burst in the front door and start shooting.\n"
"When there's no one left, you can clean their place out at your leisure.\n"
"Just hurry up and bring us both key halves."
msgstr ""
"还没有拿到那两块圣坛碎片？想不到你们竟然这样没用。其实太简单了，你们只要径直闯进去，把魔法乱放一气，还没死的补他两家伙，不就完了。快去放手干吧，我可等得不耐烦了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3188 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10143
msgid ""
"Soon our plans will bear fruit, but there are a few details that must be handled before we are ready.\n"
"The Kreegan, also known as the Devils, share this world with us.\n"
"The only reason we're sharing is because they are weak right now.\n"
"If they ever get strong, they will try to kill every person in the world.Anyway, it's no fun to rule a world full of dead people, so we have to kill the Devils before they kill us.\n"
"Our plan is for you to infiltrate the Devils lair and destroy their leader, Xenofex.\n"
"The warlocks of Nighon have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the Land of the Giants-- the land of the Devils.\n"
"You can probably use that tunnel to get there."
msgstr ""
"用不了多久，我们的计划就会开花结果，但在万事俱备之前，还有一些细节需要处理。\n"
"克里根人，也就是恶魔，与我们共享这个世界。\n"
"我们之所以还能共享，仅仅是因为他们现在很虚弱。\n"
"一旦他们强大起来，就会试图杀死世界上的每一个人。不管怎样，统治一个满是死人的世界毫无乐趣可言，所以我们必须在恶魔杀死我们之前先杀死他们。\n"
"我们的计划是让你们潜入恶魔的老巢，摧毁他们的首领泽诺费克斯。\n"
"尼贡的术士们已经从他们的火山挖了一条隧道，通往巨人国度——也就是恶魔的领地。\n"
"你们大概可以借助那条隧道抵达那里。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3205 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10161
msgid ""
"Could you please hurry up with this raid against the Devils?\n"
"Archibald has promised forces, but they won't be available forever.\n"
"What's worse, the devils breed faster than rabbits.\n"
"The longer you wait, the more you'll have to fight."
msgstr ""
"你们能不能快点去执行这次针对恶魔的突袭？\n"
"阿奇博尔德已经承诺派兵，但他们不会永远待命。\n"
"更糟的是，恶魔繁殖得比兔子还快。\n"
"你们等得越久，要面对的敌人就越多。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10165
msgid ""
"THAT WAS AWESOME!\n"
"You did it!\n"
"And now the single greatest threat to our plans is gone!\n"
"We will be Kings of the World!\n"
"[Kastore throws his head back and laughs wildly] AHAHAHAHAHA!!!!! Ah ha ha. Yes.\n"
"Well, good job.\n"
"I'll even forgive you for letting that King Roland character go free--we could have used him as a bargaining chip, you know.\n"
"[he shrugs] you probably didn't have a choice, I suppose.\n"
"In any event, this is a happy day!\n"
msgstr ""
"太棒了！\n"
"你们做到了！\n"
"如今我们计划的最大单一威胁消失了！\n"
"我们将成为世界之王！\n"
"[卡斯托把头一仰，狂笑道]啊哈哈哈！！！！！！啊哈，哈。对。\n"
"好了，干得不错。\n"
"我甚至会原谅你们放跑那个叫罗兰的国王——你知道，我们本可以拿他当筹码。\n"
"[他耸耸肩]我猜你们也是别无选择。\n"
"无论如何，今天是个快乐的日子！\n"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3209 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10177
msgid ""
"Archibald has asked us to find a source of soul jars for his necromancers.\n"
"These are the jars that are needed to complete the Ritual that gives them eternal life, and we're almost out.\n"
"There are far more candidates for Lichdom than we have jars, so some of our necromancers are facing the grim possibility of real death.\n"
"The makers of the jars are the Warlocks.\n"
"Go to them and convince them to give us the jars.\n"
"If they won't hand them over, take the jars by force-- I'm done negotiating prices with them."
msgstr ""
"阿基巴德要我们去为死灵法师找一个能弄到灵魂之坛的地方。死灵法师就靠这些坛子来放自己的灵魂，进行永生仪式，只有这样他们才能得到永生，可是最近我们这些坛子都快用完了。如今要成为死灵法师的人越来越多，我们要是再搞不到灵魂之坛，恐怕有些人真的要寿终正寝了。天下只有邪术师会制作灵魂之坛，你们的任务就是去和他们商量商量，问他们要些灵魂之坛。要是他们不肯，那你们只有动武硬抢了，你们不必害怕，一切麻烦有我来应付。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3219 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10196
msgid ""
"You don't have to be nice about getting the jars from them--just get the jars any way you can.\n"
"We can renegotiate peace with them if we must, just like we renegotiate the price for each purchase of soul jars."
msgstr ""
"你们去拿灵魂之坛可别不好意思，只要能达到目的，可以不择一切手段，甚至不惜和他们撕破脸。既然我们可以为了价钱和他们谈判，自然也可以为了和平和他们讨价还价，没什么大不了的，最多死几个人罢了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10199
msgid ""
"[Maximus takes the case of jars with obvious delight] Nice work.\n"
"I won't even ask what you had to do to get them.\n"
"Success speaks for itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"[马克西莫斯接过罐箱，喜形于色]干得漂亮。\n"
"我都不问你们为弄到它付出了什么。\n"
"成功本身就是说明。\n"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10214
msgid ""
"Lord Archibald has another request--the creatures that have inhabited Clanker's laboratory must be evicted--and the teleport shield brought down.\n"
"The laboratory is on an island east of Pierpont in the Tularean Forest.\n"
"Be careful--the monsters in that lab were created by Clanker himself, and some of them are much more powerful than their more common fellows elsewhere in the world.\n"
"Take whatever you like from the place.\n"
"Lord Archibald is only interested in the real estate and the laboratory equipment.\n"
"Once the shield is down, Lord Archibald will be able to begin moving necromancers and equipment inside via Lloyd's Beacon. "
msgstr ""
"阿基巴德领主还有一个请求——占据了科兰克实验室的那些生物必须被驱逐——并把传送护盾打下来。\n"
"实验室在图拉林森林皮尔庞特以东的一座岛上。\n"
"小心——那实验室里的怪物是科兰克亲手造的，其中一些比世上别处常见的同类强大得多。\n"
"那地方的东西你们随便拿。\n"
"阿基巴德领主只对房产和实验室设备感兴趣。\n"
"护盾一倒，阿基巴德领主就能通过劳埃德信标把死灵法师和设备搬进去了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3230 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10232
msgid ""
"This is a simple task--get a move on!\n"
"Once again, the laboratory on an island east of Pierpont in the Tularean Forest.\n"
"Get the shield lowered, and your part of the job is done."
msgstr ""
"交给你们这么简单的任务，还不快去。我再说一遍，听仔细了。实验室在图拉利昂森林的匹尔邦特东面一个小岛上，你们要进去把远距离防护盾摧毁，把怪兽都干掉。听懂了吗！快滚吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3227 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10235
msgid ""
"It's good to see we can count on you.\n"
"So few of our allies are as reliable and capable as yourselves.\n"
"Thank you very much for your aid."
msgstr "能看到你们平安回来真让人高兴。说实话，我们还从来没看到过象你们这样又能干又守信的盟友，非常感谢你们的帮助。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3233 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10248
msgid ""
"Just as Archibald has us, King Magnus of Bracada has his advisors.\n"
"And, just like us, each of them wears a small token called a command cube.\n"
"We need one of their cubes, and they're not going to just hand one over to us.\n"
"We must take one of their cubes, and we have decided it should be Robert the Wise who suffers.\n"
"One of our spies in their castle has damaged the lock to his room.\n"
"They have been lax about replacing it, so you should have no trouble going through the door.\n"
"I don't care if you kill him or not--just get the cube and return to me at once."
msgstr ""
"和阿基巴德一样，马格努斯国王手下大臣也都有表明身份的控制晶片，我们必须把这玩意儿搞到手。目标已经选好了，是个叫智者罗伯特的倒霉鬼。我的手下已经有人潜入他的住宅，把他住的屋子的锁弄坏了，他们竟然懒得把锁修好，这真是天赐良机。你们的任务就是潜入城堡拿到控制晶片，把它带给我们，杀不杀他随你们的便。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3244 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10282
msgid ""
"What's wrong?\n"
"Don't tell me you're losing your nerve?\n"
"He's tough, but not immortal.\n"
"You can take him!\n"
"I wouldn't have sent you on this mission if I didn't think you could handle it."
msgstr ""
"怎么了，不要告诉我你们准备放弃了。不错，他是挺利害的，可也不是什么顶尖高手，以你们目前的功力，完全可以把他收拾了。这么一个简单的任务，是我特意留给你们让你们立功的，想不到你们这么没出息。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3240 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10285
msgid ""
"[Tolberti takes the cube] This brings us very close to completing our Plan.\n"
"I know Kastore hasn't told you exactly what the Plan is, but you'll like it, I'm sure!\n"
"I am not allowed to say much, but I can tell you your position will be much higher than simply Lords of Harmondale, you can count on that!\n"
"You will find Kastore in his place on the throne of Castle Gloaming."
msgstr ""
"（托尔伯蒂拿着控制晶片）这下我们的计划马上要大功告成了。我知道你们很想知道全部计划的真相，卡斯托还没有交代清楚吧。不过我也不能说得太多，天机不可泄露。反正我可以告诉你们，一旦我们成功了，你们的职位就不仅仅是个和谐谷城堡的小领主了，等着瞧吧，好戏还在后头呢！要找卡斯托，你们可以去黄昏城堡的宫殿看看。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3249 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10301
msgid ""
"Yes, the test.\n"
"It's simple.\n"
"Near the center of the city is a place we call the Breeding Zone.\n"
"There's a lot of foul monsters in the pit, and they regenerate constantly.\n"
"It makes for a good source of slaves, spare parts, and target practice.\n"
"All of our necromancers are tested there when they want to rise above the level of initiate.\n"
"I'm sure you'll pass the test.\n"
"Just jump in the pit and find a way out.\n"
"Kill anything you want down there.\n"
"Show no mercy.\n"
"When you escape, crawl out of the pit and come see me again.\n"
"If you complete this, I will give you membership in the Guild of Dark. *If* you complete this..."
msgstr ""
"这个考验很简单。地狱城附近有个叫再生之地的地方，那里面净是些怪兽，而且现在越来越多，能把它们捉来做奴隶倒是再合适不过了。你们要做的就是进入那个地方，杀开一条血路，从另一头的出口出来就行了。这些怪兽都是些凶残狡猾的家伙，你们可千万不要对它们手下留情。如果你们能活着回来，我就接纳你们为暗黑魔法行会的成员。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3267 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10320
msgid ""
"I am beginning to suspect my allies were right about you.\n"
"Can't you pass this simple test?\n"
"Are you too afraid, or too feeble to succeed?\n"
"Perhaps we need new allies?"
msgstr ""
"我真怀疑你们有没有资格成为我们的盟友，连这么简单的考验都通不过，以后碰到大风大浪怎么办！你们到底是胆子太小，还是本领太差了，我真搞不懂，看来我应该另选盟友了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3261 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10323
msgid ""
"You show promise, my friends.\n"
"A fine performance.\n"
"I think it will be sufficient proof of your skill for my advisors.\n"
"They are quite eager to assign tasks to you now; they can be found in the four houses in the western side of the Pit.\n"
"And don't worry.\n"
"Rewards will follow, of course."
msgstr ""
"你们干得真不错，现在我的手下可以心服口服了，他们还会争先恐后地向你们分派任务呢！他们就住在地狱城西面的四间屋子里。快去吧，要知道，他们给的报酬可是很丰厚的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10344
msgid ""
"The time has come to achieve our Goal.\n"
"The reason we have sent you on all these missions is simple:\n"
"we have been busy gathering the parts needed to open a gate to the Ancients--the ones who colonized this world ages ago.\n"
"Unfortunately, our former compatriots also seek those parts for their own dark dreams.\n"
"They wish to rebuild the Heavenly Forge from the times before the Silence, and use it to duplicate the weapons we brought with us to your world.\n"
"We have been competing with them for these parts, but at last we have what we need.\n"
"Except for one thing.\n"
"We have been unable to find the Oscillation Overthruster on your world.\n"
"All would be lost, but there is one such device aboard the Lincoln--the vehicle that brought us to your world.\n"
"It is in the sea west of Avlee and secured against entry, even from ourselves.\n"
"Now you must wear our environment suits, enter the ship, and return with the Overthruster; you will find these suits in the chest outside this throne room.\n"
"For the suit to function properly you must not be wearing any equipment.\n"
"As for us, we must stand watch at the gate, and battle our former comrades.\n"
msgstr ""
"实现目标的时刻到了。\n"
"我们派你们执行这许多任务，原因很简单：\n"
"我们一直在忙于收集开启通往远古者之门所需的零件——那些远古者在久远以前殖民了这个世界。\n"
"不幸的是，我们从前的同袍也在为他们自己的黑暗梦想寻觅这些零件。\n"
"他们想重建沉寂时代之前的天炉，用它复制我们当年带到你们世界的武器。\n"
"我们一直在与他们争夺这些零件，但我们终于凑齐了所需之物。\n"
"只缺一样。\n"
"我们在你们的世界上一直找不到振荡过载器。\n"
"本会前功尽弃，可林肯号上恰好有一台——就是载我们来到你们世界的那艘飞行器。\n"
"它在埃里以西的海里，且封闭着不让进入，连我们自己也不行。\n"
"现在你们必须穿上我们的环境服，进入飞船，带着过载器回来；你们会在这觐见厅外的箱子里找到这些衣服。\n"
"衣服要正常运作，你们身上就不能穿任何装备。\n"
"至于我们，必须守在门边，与从前的同志作战。\n"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3285 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10352
msgid ""
"You have returned!\n"
"At last!\n"
"We have the Overthruster.\n"
"Now, come with us as we open the way to the Ancients!"
msgstr ""
"你们回来了！\n"
"终于！\n"
"我们拿到超驱器了。\n"
"现在，随我们一同开启通往上古者之路吧！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3289 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10385
msgid ""
"Don't forget you'll need the wetsuits to get to the Lincoln.\n"
"These suits are in the chest outside this throne room and the Lincoln is in the sea west of Avlee.\n"
"Return here with the Overthruster as soon as possible."
msgstr "别忘了你们要上林肯号，就必须得穿我们的潜水服。它们就在宫殿外面的箱子里，林肯号在埃里西面的大海里，快去吧，记住把振荡器拿回来。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3292 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10390
msgid ""
"Our finest hour is upon us.\n"
"While you have been taking care of all those important tasks, my compatriots and I have been struggling with our former friends for the parts we need to rebuild the Heavenly Forge of legend.\n"
"By former friends, I mean the four chief advisors to King Magnus of the Wizards.\n"
"They have a plan to build a gate to the Ancients.\n"
"They could have stood with us, but threw it all away on some vague hope of a 'better future'.\n"
"But you!\n"
"You have stood with us all this time.Only one task remains--we need the Oscillation Overthruster from our old vehicle, the Lincoln.\n"
"We have been unable to find one on your world.\n"
"The ship is in the sea west of Avlee and secured against entry, even from ourselves.\n"
"Now you must wear our environment suits, enter the ship, and return with the Overthruster.\n"
"Our old environments suits have been prepared for you in the chest outside this throne room.\n"
"For the suit to function properly you must not be wearing any equipment.We will stand watch over the Forge, and defend it against our enemies.\n"
"Bring us the Overthruster, my friends, and together, we shall rule the world!"
msgstr ""
"看来我们就快大功告成了。就在你们四处奔波，费尽心机地完成我们交给你们的任务的时候，我们为了争夺能重建传说中的天堂铸造厂的宝物，和我们以前的盟友反目成仇，展开了一场激战。我们的对手就是马格努斯国王手下的四个光明法师。他们想得到宝物是为了重建通往古代伟大文明的时空之门。本来我们双方可以互相合作，各取所需，可是他们却妄想建立一个和平安详的世界，说什么上古神器不能用来发动邪恶的战争，简直胡说八道，对这种人就得好好教训教训他们。可你们就不同了，你们会永远站在我们这一边，成为我们永远的朋友。\n"
"不过我们还少了振荡器这一样东西，如果找不到它，我们可会前功尽弃。我知道有一艘叫林肯号的船上就有一个振荡器，我们就是乘这艘船才来到你们这片大陆的。这艘船就在埃里西面的海里，你们只有穿上我们的潜水服才能上船，这些衣服就在宫殿外面的箱子里。还有一件事，你们只有卸下身上所有的装备潜水服才会起作用。快去船上把振荡器拿回来吧，我们统治全世界的日子就要到了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3309 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10399
msgid ""
"Don't forget you'll need the environmental suits to get to the Lincoln.\n"
"These suits are in the chest outside the throne room, and the Lincoln is in the sea west of Avlee.\n"
"What else do you need to know?"
msgstr "记住，你们要上林肯号，就得穿上潜水服，它就在宫殿外面的箱子里。林肯号在埃里西面的大海里，快去吧，别浪费时间。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:41 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:104
msgid ""
"My brother, Isthric the Tongue, went to check on the tobersk plants on one of the lesser islands.\n"
"He has not returned!\n"
"I am afraid that he is one of those stranded by the cataclysm. He may even be hurt!\n"
"If you were to fix the Portals of Stone, he would surely be able to return, and we could get help to those who need it!\n"
"Find him for me!"
msgstr ""
"我的弟兄利舌埃斯瑞克去其它的小岛上检查托伯斯克水果的生长状况。但是他没有回来！我很担心他可能被大灾变困在其它的岛上了。他甚至可能受伤了！如果你能够修复好岩石传送门，他应该可以回来，我们也可以替那些需要帮助的人找到足够的协助！赶快替我找到他！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3703 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10442
msgid ""
"Thomas Grey runs the School of Sorcery.\n"
"If you're looking for promotion to Wizard or Honorary Wizard, he's your man.\n"
"His room is right through the door behind me."
msgstr "托马斯·格雷是魔法学院的长老。你们要是想升职为法师或荣誉法师，可以去找他。他就住在我的屋子后面。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3706 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10446
msgid ""
"Would you like a membership to the School of Sorcery Scroll Shop?\n"
"A membership allows you free access to the scrolls available in our library.\n"
"It costs 5000 gold for a six month membership, but the shop stocks once per week."
msgstr ""
"加入我们的魔法学院吧，这样你们就可以随心所欲地学习每个魔法商店里的魔法了。你们只要付5000个金币就可以成为我们学院的成员，有效期为六个月。记住，我们魔法商店里的魔法每个星期会更换一次。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3711 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10463
msgid "You don't have enough gold-- it's no use trying to fool a Wizard."
msgstr "你们的金币不够——要想糊弄我们法师是没用的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3709 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10466
msgid ""
"Here's the membership, remember it only lasts for six months.\n"
"Check the shelves in the front rooms here to see what is available."
msgstr "好了，你们现在是我们魔法学院的成员了，记住有效期为六个月。快去前面的魔法商店看看有什么你们感兴趣的魔法吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3712 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10476
msgid ""
"You want to bury the bones of Zokarr IV in our old barrows?\n"
"No dwarf here will brave the dangers, but Zokarr deserves to be laid to rest in the right place.\n"
"Look for the secret barrow, the one with only one entrance.\n"
"In there is a coffin waiting for Zokarr's bones."
msgstr ""
"你们想把佐卡尔四世的遗骨埋在旧坟墓里吗？这里没有矮人愿意冒这危险的，但佐卡尔国王确实应该被好好安葬。你们要找一个秘密墓穴，那个只有一个入口的就是他的坟墓。那里有一口棺材是用来安葬佐卡尔的遗骨的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3716 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10494
msgid ""
"We have no one to turn to but you, the new Lords of Harmondale. The Lantern of Light is a treasured holy relic, used by the temples of Erathia.\n"
"Its value is more symbolic than of power-- without it the temples servants lose faith.\n"
"This Lantern disappeared while being brought to this temple from the temple in Stone City.\n"
"We believe it was lost somewhere in the maze-like Barrows.\n"
"Please find it and return it to us."
msgstr ""
"我们现在只有靠你们找回神灯了，和谐谷的新主人们。伊拉西亚神庙里的光明灯是举世罕见的珍宝。其实它并没有什么魔力，但具有鼓舞人心的作用。没有它，伊拉西亚的僧侣们就会人心惶惶，无心修炼。神灯是在石头城运往这里的路上丢失的，我想它肯定在拜尔德斯那个迷宫般蜿蜒曲折的坟墓里，拜托你们把它取回来，多谢了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3721 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10502
msgid ""
"Have you found the Lantern of Light?\n"
"We're certain it was lost in the maze of Barrows in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr "还没有找到光明灯吗？它肯定在拜尔德斯的墓地里。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3723 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10505
msgid ""
"Thank you, Lords of Harmondale.\n"
"The Lantern's return will bolster our faith and allows us to continue our services.\n"
"Please take this small reward as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr "太感谢你们了，和谐谷的主人们。神灯回到我们的手中，这下大家又可以专心修炼了。这些酬金是你们应该得的，请拿去吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3726 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10518
msgid ""
"My, brother, Haldar passed away last month.\n"
"The family was sending his remains to me to be put to final rest.\n"
"Something happened to those delivering these remains to me; they disappeared in Nighon and not been heard from since. I fear my brothers soul will never rest unless they are found!\n"
"Please return Haldar to me if you find him? I will reward you well for this!"
msgstr ""
"我的弟弟哈尔代尔上个月去世了，本来尸体打算运到我这里妥善安葬，但在路上突发意外，在尼根他的遗体莫名其妙地不见了，从此再无消息。要是找不到遗体的话，只怕我弟弟在天堂永远不会瞑目的。麻烦你们走一趟探听一下我弟弟的尸体的下落。如果找到的话我必有重金酬谢。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3730 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10526
msgid ""
"Did you find Haldar's Remains?\n"
"His soul must be in sheer agony!\n"
"Please find the jar with his remains!"
msgstr "你们找到哈尔代尔的尸体了吗？没有尸体他的灵魂就成了无主的孤魂，那该多痛苦啊！麻烦你们再加把劲，把他的遗体找回来吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3733 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10529
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning my \"brother's\" remains!\n"
"He was a promising Warlock and his life was ended to soon.\n"
"Now that I have his remains, I will attempt to bring him back as a Lich, and together we will seek greater power and glory!"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你们把我兄弟的遗体带回来。他曾经是个有前途的邪术师，却早早地结束了生命。现在我已经有了他的尸体，我会试着把他变为巫妖，这样我们又可以一起去寻求力量和荣耀了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3736 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10542
msgid ""
"My lords, I was beset by foul bandits when I returned from Avlee and they took everything I had brought with me from the Elves.\n"
"They even took my signet ring!\n"
"Without it I cannot continue my business because I cannot seal contracts between myself and other merchants.\n"
"I've heard the bandits base themselves out of a camp in Erathia, but I'm no warrior-- I'd not last a minute against them.\n"
"Please go to Erathia and see this justice done!"
msgstr ""
"主人啊，我实在太不幸了。我从埃里回来的路上遇到一伙强盗，他们把我的财宝一抢而光，最要命的是他们抢走了我的戒指印章。没有这个东西我没法签合同，连生意都不能做了。听说这伙歹徒就盘踞在伊拉西亚东北面的巢穴里，我真想亲自找上门去教训他们，可惜我只是个手无缚鸡之力的商人。我只能请求你们去除强扶弱，为我伸张正义，事成之后我一定会重重酬谢你们的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3741 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10550
msgid ""
"You don't have my ring yet?\n"
"The bandits are south of Castle Gryphonheart in Erathia.\n"
"Please help me, I don't have anyone else to turn to."
msgstr "你们还没有拿到戒指。这伙强盗就在伊拉西亚狮鹫心城堡的南面。快去吧，你们可是我唯一的指望啊！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3744 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10553
msgid ""
"My ring!\n"
"Thank you lords.\n"
"I can now continue my business and recover my losses, and you have made the trading routes safer for all the merchants!"
msgstr "哦，这就是我的戒指。真是谢谢你们了，我的主人！现在我又能做生意了，你们真是我们商人的大恩人啊！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3747 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10566
msgid ""
"So you are the Lords of Harmondale, eh?\n"
"You don’t look like much; we shall see how history judges you!\n"
"I myself am a historian and collector of rare historical items.\n"
"Lord Markham also collects such items of interest and there is one item in particular that would complete my collection, Parson's Quill-- the Quill used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont ending the first Timber War.\n"
"I know you have dealt with Lord Markham before, it's how you became Lords of this land after all, and if you would take this letter to Lord Markham in Tatalia, I'm sure he would respond favorably.\n"
"I would be even more in your debt if Lord Markham sends this item back with you!\n"
"I would be sure to favorably record your heroic acts and deeds!"
msgstr ""
"啊，你们就是和谐谷城堡的新主人！看起来不怎么象。不过象不象不是我说了算的，老百姓自有评判。我是个历史学家，还是个历史文物的收藏爱好者。听说马克汉姆爵士在这方面和我是同道，他有一件非常珍贵的收藏---帕尔森的羽毛笔。那可不是普通的羽毛笔，结束第一次木材战争时签署匹尔邦特和平协议用的就是这支笔。你们既然能成为和谐谷的主人，和马克汉姆爵士的交情肯定不错。麻烦你们把这封信带给他，他现在已经住在泰塔利亚了。如果爵士看了这封信，能把那支羽毛笔托你们交给我，那真是感激不尽，我一定会让您名垂青史。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3754 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10575
msgid ""
"Did Lord Markham refuse to give you the Quill, or have you not even visited him yet?\n"
"His Manor is in Tatalia, please don't forget to help me."
msgstr "到底是马克汉姆爵士不给我羽毛笔，还是你们根本没有去见过他。记住，他就住在泰塔利亚，你们一定要帮我这个忙啊！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3756 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10578
msgid ""
"The actual Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont.\n"
"My collection is complete!\n"
"I will be sure to record your activities and deeds correctly and justly so that all will know you as the true Lords of Harmondale!"
msgstr "对，这就是签署匹尔邦特协议的孔雀羽毛笔。现在我的收藏可谓十全十美了。我会把这件事载入史书，让你们名垂青史。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3759 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10592
msgid ""
"A letter from Norbert Thrush the Historian? Let me see it.\n"
"[Lord Markham scans the letter briefly] Hmmmmm…he wants the Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont, does he.\n"
"Well, seeing as though he has a supposed original of the Treaty, I guess the feather should go to him.\n"
"He has promised me anything else in his collection.\n"
"Take this to him and tell him that I will come collect from him shortly!"
msgstr ""
"这是历史学家诺伯特·西拉丝的信，让我好好看看。（马克汉姆爵士很快扫了一下信）嗯，他要签署匹尔邦特协议的那支羽毛笔。既然他有了协议的原件，把羽毛笔给他倒是未尝不可，他在信里还说要用其它文物来交换。好吧，你们就把羽毛笔带给他吧，不过你们得告诉他，我很快要上他那儿去挑几件我中意的文物。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3764 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10614
msgid ""
"I hear you folk are the new Lords of Harmondale, eh?\n"
"Perhaps you could do me a large favor, and help yourselves in the process.\n"
"To the north, in Avlee, lies the Hall under the Hill, the domain of the Faerie King.\n"
"He owes me a debt from a previous service of mine, and I would like to collect it.\n"
"Unfortunately, the faeries in the Hall and the tricks they play frighten me to death.\n"
"If you would deliver this letter to the Faerie King, and return what he gives you to me, I'd be very grateful.\n"
"You would also have the chance to meet the Faerie King for yourselves."
msgstr ""
"原来你们就是和谐谷城堡的新主人，那么这件事就要麻烦你们了。不过此事如果成功，你们自己也大有好处。在埃里北面的小山底下有个地下大厅，那里是仙帝的领地。以前我为他立下一件大功，他欠我一个人情，现在该是他报答我的时候了。可是那里住的神仙很爱作弄人，我可不敢去，不然准得被他们吓得半死。我现在只有拜托你们去把这封信交给仙帝，他会托付你们把一些东西交给我，你们把它们带回来就行了，到时候我会重重谢你们。你们还可以要仙帝帮忙实现你们的心愿，肯定会不虚此行的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2208 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10622
msgid ""
"So, Johann be wanting the Faerie Pipes, eh?\n"
"I can't say I'm surprised--he wouldn't come here himself, the coward.\n"
"The Pipes will cost you, though… all your food.\n"
"Of course, I've got some delightful food down below, should thee be wanting to restock your packs."
msgstr ""
"乔安想要神笛？她自己怎么不来？我明白了，这个胆小鬼可不敢上我这儿来。要拿神笛，你们得用你们身上所有的食物来换，这两天我象是患了贪食症，老是吃不够。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3775 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10648
msgid ""
"Don't forget to give the letter to the Faerie King.\n"
"Without it, he probably won't even want to talk to you."
msgstr "记住别忘了把信交给仙帝。没有信，他理也不会理你们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1065
msgid "Balthazar of Ravage Roaming"
msgstr "野蛮漫游的巴尔萨煞"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3771 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10651
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"The Pipes!\n"
"You don't know what this means to me.\n"
"Here, take this as a reward and thank you again for your help in this!"
msgstr "好极了，你们把笛子带回来了，这东西对我来说真是太重要了。这些酬金是你们应得的报酬，你们快收下吧！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3777 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10664
msgid ""
"We request your services for only one small task.\n"
"In Castle Lambent rests a valuable tapestry taken from an attack on Watchtower 3 years ago.\n"
"I would like you to get the tapestry for me, as you must have *some* access to the Castle-- my normal associates can't even come near the place.\n"
"I hear a large band of goblins and renegade swordsmen are about... it would be a shame if they happened to find a way to Harmondale.\n"
"You have one month to get the tapestry.\n"
"Don't be late."
msgstr ""
"我们有件小事想麻烦你们。三年以前光辉城堡袭击了我们的哨塔，抢走了一块名贵的挂毯。那个地方守卫非常森严，驻扎了大批大耳怪和邪恶剑手，我的手下根本无法靠近那里。看来只有你们能胜任这个任务，想办法潜入城堡，把那块挂毯夺回来。不过记住，你们只有一个月的时间，超过期限他们就会发现你们的和谐谷城堡，并会立即发动，好了，别浪费时间了，快去快回吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:271 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1067
msgid ""
"It was my pleasure to serve under Lord Balthazar, he was the finest herd leader in my tribe’s history.\n"
"Unfortunately, my services were pledged to the Merchants of Alvar, or I may have been in the battle where Balthazar fell.\n"
"Perhaps my ability and my axe could have saved my lord.\n"
"We’ll never know now."
msgstr ""
"在巴尔萨煞大王底下服务是我的荣幸，他是我族中历史上最强悍的领导者。很不幸地，我的忠诚目前已经献给了阿尔瓦的商人，不然也许我当年可以加入巴尔萨煞大人失败的那场战争。也许我的斧头和我的技巧可以救他一命，谁知道呢？"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3783 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10687
msgid ""
"We request your services for one task.\n"
"A rare and valuable tapestry rests in Castle Gloaming, an antique from near the Silence stolen from the wizards some time ago.\n"
"I would like you to get the tapestry for me, as my normal associates don't have access to Castle Gloaming.\n"
"In return, I'll make sure that the large band of renegade swordsmen and goblins near Harmondale don't accidentally stumble upon your quiet, little village.\n"
"You have one month; don't be late."
msgstr ""
"我们需要你们帮个小忙。法师们有一块珍贵的挂毯，是从寂静时代流传下来的一件文物。黄昏城堡派人偷走了这块挂毯。那个地方守卫非常森严，驻扎了大批大耳怪和邪恶剑手，我的手下根本无法靠近那里。看来只有你们能胜任这个任务，想办法潜入城堡，把那块挂毯夺回来。不过记住，你们只有一个月的时间，超过期限他们就会发现你们的和谐谷城堡，并会立即发动，好了，别浪费时间了，快去快回吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3793 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10712
msgid ""
"I see.\n"
"Well, it would appear that the band of renegades has indeed discovered your little town, and has begun looting.\n"
"You may find your bank account a little, well, pinched.\n"
"Consider this a lesson in punctuality.\n"
"Go now and have a pleasant, pleasant day."
msgstr ""
"现在一个月的期限已经过了，那帮匪徒终于发现了你们的小城堡，如今他们正在和谐谷大肆抢劫屠杀，看来你们的全部家当都难保了。这次就当作一个教导你如何守时的教训吧。走吧，去享受这愉快的一天去吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3788 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10716
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"I see that you can be trusted to perform well when called upon.\n"
"I'll keep that in mind the next time I need a job done.\n"
"Your reward is nothing more than status quo-- things could be much worse than they already are.\n"
"Go now, I have no more time for you."
msgstr "好极了，看来你们是值得信赖的朋友，下次我们有事一定再会来找你们的。由于你们的努力，和谐谷城堡终于安然无恙了，我想这是对你们的最高奖赏。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:2239 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10725
msgid ""
"You don't have the tapestry yet, and the clock is ticking.\n"
"It would be prudent to keep to the task at hand rather than bothering me with your babble."
msgstr "你们还没有拿到挂毯，不过没关系，还有的是时间。在你们完成任务以前可别再来找我了。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:75 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1073
msgid "The Axe of Balthazar"
msgstr "巴尔萨煞之斧"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3798 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10731
msgid ""
"A few years back, while mining underneath Stone City, we came upon quite a shock.\n"
"It seems that the Warlocks from Nighon had burrowed under the sea to make a sneak attack upon the shores of Erathia.\n"
"Their careless tunneling has sunken the earth around here until now the areas around the old dwarven barrows and, of course, Stone City, rest far above the terrain.\n"
"We discovered a force of troglodytes in our mining areas, with a tunnel leading back to Nighon.\n"
"If you could help us by ridding the tunnels of the troglodytes, we could get back to mining.\n"
"Can you help us?"
msgstr ""
"几年前我们在石头城地下挖矿的时候发现了一桩大阴谋。尼根的邪术师竟挖掘了海底地道，想通过地道偷袭伊拉西亚的海岸。由于他们大肆挖掘，致使那里的地层下陷，现在石头城和原来的矮人族墓地比起那块地都高出许多了。在我们的采矿区有一条地道可以通往尼根，但现在那里被洞穴人霸占着。如果你们能帮助我们赶走洞穴人，我们就可以继续采矿了。请你们帮帮我们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3804 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10738 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10742
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10746
msgid ""
"There are still troglodytes roaming the lower mine levels.\n"
"Please remove them!"
msgstr "洞穴人还在那个低洼的矿区里逍遥自在。快去把他们赶走吧！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3806 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10749
msgid ""
"They're gone?\n"
"Routed back into the connecting tunnels to Nighon!\n"
"Excellent!\n"
"We can get back to mining immediately!\n"
"Thank you so much for your help; take this as a reward for your services."
msgstr "他们逃走了，顺着那条地道滚回尼根去了！真是太好了，我们现在可以开工采矿了，真是太谢谢你们了，这是你们应得的报酬，请收下吧。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:284 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1076
msgid ""
"Of course I would know Balthazar's Axe if I saw it!\n"
"Do you have it with you?\n"
"If you find it, return to me so that I may certify that it is indeed the axe of my late lord, Balthazar."
msgstr ""
"如果我看到了巴尔萨煞之斧，我当然认得出来！你身上有带吗？如果你找到了那柄斧头，带它过来找来，让我证明这的确是属于我的前任君主巴尔萨煞的斧头。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3811 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10761
msgid ""
"I have recently gained information that the forces of Queen Catherine, in Erathia, have begun to build a force to attack Deyja.\n"
"Because of the difficult terrain, they have begun to breed and train griffins to assist in their attack.\n"
"These griffins are being raised in both Erathia and the Bracada Desert.\n"
"I need you to kill off all the griffins in those two areas so that the Erathians will be forced to drastically delay their plans of attack."
msgstr ""
"我已经得到确切情报，伊拉西亚的凯瑟琳王后正调兵遣将想要进攻迪雅。但由于迪雅地势险要，他们正积极训练狮鹫以在战斗中助他们一臂之力。狮鹫只生活在伊拉西亚和布拉卡达的沙漠里。我需要你们去那两个地方把那些讨厌的狮鹫杀个干净，这样就可以大大推迟他们的进攻计划。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3819 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10780
msgid ""
"You've killed the griffins near Steadwick, but you haven't dealt with the griffins in the Bracada Desert yet.\n"
"Finish them both off and return to me."
msgstr "你们只消灭了伊拉西亚的狮鹫，布拉卡达沙漠里还有很多，不把它们全部消灭就别来见我。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3821 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10783 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10797
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"You've done a splendid job.\n"
"Here, take this as your reward and know you've earned the respect of Deyja for your bold success."
msgstr "好极了，你们干得真不错。这些酬金你们收下吧，整个迪雅都会感激你们的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:275 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1079
msgid ""
"Of course I would know Balthazar's Axe if I saw it!\n"
"Do you have it with you? This IS the axe!\n"
"You must take this back to Tessalar, so the Rite’s of Purity may be performed upon the axe, so it be made ready for the son of Balthazar, Masul.\n"
"Take this letter with you, it carries my personal seal, and statement that this is indeed the Axe of Balthazar!"
msgstr ""
"如果我看到了巴尔萨煞之斧，我当然认得出来！你身上有带吗？这的确就是那柄斧头！你一定要赶快带回去进行净化之仪式，好让这柄斧头能够继承给巴尔萨煞的儿子马苏尔。把这封信一起带回去，上面有我个人专属的封缄，证明这的确是巴尔萨煞之斧！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3817 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10794
msgid ""
"You've killed the griffins near Spyre Town, but you haven't dealt with the griffins in Erathia yet.\n"
"Finish them both off and return to me."
msgstr "你们只消灭了布拉卡达沙漠里的狮鹫，伊拉西亚那里还有很多，不把它们全部消灭就别来见我。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1693 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:108
msgid ""
"You found Isthric and told him how to return home?\n"
"We are indeed in debt to you, Merchant of Alvar!\n"
"I will speak well of you to Clan Leader Brekish Onefang.\n"
"Please take these potions of Cure Wounds as a reward."
msgstr "你找到了埃斯瑞克了，并且告诉他要回家了吗？我们真的非常感激你！我会告诉我们的酋长布瑞克许·单牙。请把这些疗伤药剂收下，当作我对你的回报。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3815 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10807
msgid ""
"You haven't killed off all the griffins in either Erathia or the Bracada Desert.\n"
"It is imperative that you finish this task to prevent their invasion."
msgstr "伊拉西亚和布拉卡达沙漠里的狮鹫多着呢！你们一定要把它们消灭干净才能阻止伊拉西亚的进攻。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3600 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10813
msgid ""
"My brother, Elron, was an avid Arcomage player.\n"
"Have you played Arcomage yet?\n"
"Horribly addicting game, if I do say so.\n"
"In any rate, you can only play if you have a deck, and decks are hard to come by… so I guess you probably haven't.\n"
"In any case, Elron wanted to go over some strategies to help him win more games.\n"
"Unfortunately, he didn't want to be in town because he didn't want anyone else to spy on him learn his tricks so he went to the White Cliff Caves southeast a bit from town.Elron hasn't been back in almost a week.\n"
"I'm certain something horrible has happened to him, but if he's alive I'd like to know that too.\n"
"Would you do me the service of locating him?\n"
"I don't have a lot of money to pay you back with, but I'd be greatly in your debt."
msgstr ""
"我兄弟埃尔隆是个出了名的牌鬼，玩牌简直如痴如醉，已经到了不要命的地步。这种游戏真是害死人啊！如果你们要玩牌的话，必须先找到一副纸牌，不过要找到这样一副牌也挺不容易的。我兄弟为了提高牌技，四处寻访拜师，最近有人在镇子东南面的悬崖洞穴见过他，天知道他去这么危险的地方干什么？\n"
"埃尔隆已经有一个星期没回来了，现在活不见人，死不见尸，我真为他担心。如果你们能帮我个忙，打听一下他的下落，我会重重酬谢你们的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3609 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10821
msgid ""
"Still no sign of him?\n"
"I understand.\n"
"If you do happen to find out what happened to him, please let me know."
msgstr "还没有他的消息。我知道要找他的确很不容易，你们要是有他的消息，别忘了告诉我一声。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3612 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10824
msgid ""
"Dead?\n"
"Oh dear!\n"
"Those are certainly his cards, though.\n"
"I don't want the cards; you can have them-- that game has cost me enough now.\n"
"Oh, poor Elron!\n"
"I have a little money you can keep for your help, and thank you for finding out what happened to Elron."
msgstr ""
"什么，他死了，哦，我的天啊！对，这是他随时携带的魔幻牌。这东西我不要了，我已经受够了，你们要就拿去吧，玩牌可千万不要上瘾啊，不然埃尔隆就是榜样！这里有点酬金，你们一定要收下，谢谢你们帮我打听到他的下落。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3618 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10834
msgid ""
"The School of Sorcery here in the Bracada Desert collects a number of odd magical paraphernalia.\n"
"A few years ago an item of particular interest was stolen from the School by raiders from Deyja.\n"
"This item, the Seasons' Stole, was worn by Priests of the Sun during religious ceremonies at the turn of the seasons.\n"
"As a representative of the School of Sorcery, I'm authorized to reward you for its return.\n"
"Our last information placed the stolen Stole in the Hall of the Pit; I would suggest checking there first."
msgstr ""
"布拉卡达沙漠里的魔法学院里有很多神奇的魔法物品。几年前这个学院遭到迪雅的袭击，他们抢走了一件珍贵的魔法披风，它叫四季披风。光明主教在四季交替时要举行隆重的仪式，必须穿着这件披风。我接受魔法学院的委托，希望你们能帮助我们找到这件披风。据说有人在地狱之厅见过它，你们可以去那里找找看。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3623 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10853
msgid ""
"Don't forget there is a reward for the Seasons' Stole if you are able to find it and return it to me."
msgstr "如果你们能找到四季披风，我们会给你们一大笔酬金的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3624 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10856
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"This most certainly is the Seasons' Stole.\n"
"Here is your reward; you've done both the School of Sorcery and myself a great service."
msgstr "好极了，你们这么快就找到四季披风了。这些酬金你们收下吧。你们为我们魔法学院做了件大好事，我们会记住你们的。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:324 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3826 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10868
msgid ""
"The Master instructor of the Staff, Elsie Pederton, can be found in the Bracada Desert, on a ridge in the southwest region."
msgstr "手杖大师艾尔希·培顿住在布拉卡达沙漠西南面。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3827 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10873
msgid ""
"The ultimate teacher in the ways of the Staff, Jillian Mithrit, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\n"
"Her home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "手杖宗师基里安·米斯瑞特住在埃里东北面的镇子里。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3829 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:10878
