msgstr "干的好"

# imported from terms.engine.po
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:156 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:529
msgid ""
"You have done what I feared was impossible. Though these times are fraught with uncertainties, that you have united key factions of Jadame goes a long way towards securing our continued existence.Well, I have done what I can. I leave the defense of the land to the alliance council. I hope they find the accommodations I have provided them in Ravenshore to be adequate--the guild house there is not our most luxurious. Still, I though it would be best if the council was located near the crystal.I wish them, and you, good luck!"
msgstr ""
"你完成了我原先认为是不可能的任务。虽然这些日子中，整个世界面对了许多的不确定性，但是你能够让关键的势力团结在一起面对末日，已经迈出了极大的一步。\n"
" 嗯，我已经完成了我的任务。我必须要将保护整个世界的工作交给联盟议会。我希望他们能够接受我在渡鸦海滨这里替他们所布置的会议室。毕竟这座屋子并不是我们最豪华的居所，但是，我希望议会能够靠近这个神秘的水晶。\n"
" 我希望他们，还有你们，都能够获得足够的好运！"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:1293 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:553 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5291
msgid "Game of Luck"
