# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:10
msgid ""
"Marabou is the second and last Shaman promotion: the most hit points of the line and Grandmaster ranks in every school."
msgstr "马拉布是萨满的第二次、也是最后一次晋升：拥有该系最多的生命值，并在每一系魔法上达到宗师级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:11
msgid ""
"Elementalists master Fire, Air, Water and Earth by using them: every hit of their own spells on a hostile monster advances that school, and new spells of each element open as it grows. Each offensive cast builds a stack that makes the next spells stronger and faster; stacks fade when they stop casting, and a melee or bow hit clears them. Their combined elemental skill is their Ascension. Spell books cannot teach them."
msgstr ""
"元素师通过使用来精通火、空气、水与土：自己的法术每命中一次敌对怪物，对应的魔法系便会成长，随之解锁各元素的新法术。每次攻击性施法都会积累一层增益，使之后的法术更强更快；停止施法后层数会逐渐消退，近战或弓箭命中则会清空层数。他们综合的元素技能就是其飞升。法术书无法教会他们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:12
msgid ""
"Elemental Adept is the first Elementalist promotion: more spell points per level."
msgstr "元素行家是元素师的第一次晋升：每级获得更多法术值。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:13
msgid ""
"Master of Elements is the second and last Elementalist promotion: the most spell points of the line and Grandmaster ranks in all four elements."
msgstr "元素大师是元素师的第二次、也是最后一次晋升：拥有该系最多的法术值，并在四种元素上全部达到宗师级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:2
msgid ""
"Seraphim are holy warriors who fight with sword and spear and draw on Light, Spirit, Mind and Body magic. Mind adds holy damage to their blows, every melee hit heals the most wounded companion by their Body skill, Light speeds their attacks and lets them wield two-handed swords in one hand beside a shield, and Spirit turns aside part of every hit. Once every five minutes Divine Protection saves a Seraphim from a killing blow. Seraphim never wield two swords."
msgstr ""
"炽天使是手持剑与矛的神圣战士，运用光明、精神、心灵与身体四系魔法。心灵为其攻击附加神圣伤害；每次近战命中，都会按其身体技能治疗伤势最重的同伴；光明加快其攻击速度，并让其单手持双手剑、另一手持盾；精神则偏转每次攻击的一部分伤害。每五分钟一次，神圣庇护可使炽天使免于致命一击。炽天使从不双持两把剑。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:3
msgid ""
"Angel is the first Seraphim promotion: more hit points and spell points per level, and Master ranks in Spirit, Mind and Body magic."
msgstr "天使是炽天使的第一次晋升：每级获得更多生命值和法术值，并在精神、心灵与肢体魔法上达到大师级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:4
msgid ""
"Archangel is the second and last Seraphim promotion: the most hit points and spell points of the line, and Grandmaster ranks in Sword, Spear and Light magic."
msgstr "大天使是炽天使的第二次、也是最后一次晋升：拥有该系最多的生命值和法术值，并在剑、矛与光明魔法上达到宗师级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:5
msgid ""
"Death Knights are armoured warriors of Frost, Blood and Unholy magic. Their spell points are a small fixed pool that their own melee hits refill, and their spells are blows of the weapon in hand. Frost and Unholy add damage to every swing and Frost speeds it, Blood shrugs off physical damage and drains life, and Unholy wards against magic. Their auras reserve no mana, and spell books cannot teach them."
msgstr ""
"死亡骑士是身披重甲、操纵冰霜、鲜血与邪恶魔法的战士。他们的法术值是一小池固定数值，由自身的近战命中回复，其法术就是手中武器的挥击。冰霜与邪恶为每次挥击附加伤害，冰霜还能加快出手；鲜血可抵御物理伤害并吸取生命；邪恶则抵御魔法。他们的灵气不占用法力，法术书也无法教会他们任何法术。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:6
msgid ""
"Death Lord is the first Death Knight promotion: more hit points, a larger spell point pool and Master ranks in Frost, Blood and Unholy."
msgstr "死亡领主是死亡骑士的第一次晋升：更多生命值、更大的法术值池，并在冰霜、鲜血与邪恶魔法上达到大师级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:7
msgid ""
"Lich King is the second and last Death Knight promotion: the most hit points and spell points of the line, and Grandmaster ranks in Sword, Axe, Plate and their three schools."
msgstr "巫妖王是死亡骑士的第二次、也是最后一次晋升：拥有该系最多的生命值和法术值，并在剑、斧、板甲及三系魔法上达到宗师级。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:8
msgid ""
"Shamans are warriors who use all seven schools of magic (Fire, Air, Water, Earth, Spirit, Mind and Body) to strengthen their weapon. Fire burns away part of the target's health, Earth and Spirit add melee damage, Mind and Body restore spell points and hit points with each blow, and Air and Water reduce the damage they take. Every school point also makes their spells and heals stronger."
msgstr ""
"萨满是借助全部七大魔法流派（火系、空气、水系、土系、灵魂、心智与肢体）强化武器的战士。火系魔法会烧去目标的部分生命值，土系与灵魂魔法提高近战伤害，心智与肢体魔法让每次攻击都恢复魔法值与生命值，空气与水系魔法则减少他们受到的伤害。每一点流派技能还会让他们的法术与治疗变得更强。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/class_patch.txt:9
msgid ""
"Sekhem is the first Shaman promotion: more hit points per level and Master ranks in every school."
msgstr "塞凯姆是萨满的第一次晋升：每级获得更多生命值，并在每一系魔法上达到大师级。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:109
msgid ""
"A crafting gem of tier 9. On the Workbench (Crafting) it raises whichever base enchantment of a weapon, armour piece or jewel is furthest below its cap by 3, or a skill by 1; the cap grows with the tier. Three gems of a tier combine into one of the next."
msgstr ""
"制造宝石，第 9 阶。在工作台（制造）上，它可将武器、护甲或珠宝中低于上限最多的基础附魔提升 3 点，或将一项技能提升 1 点；上限随阶数增长。三颗同阶宝石可合成一颗下一阶。"

