# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:361
msgid ""
"Raises an item's power (its damage or protection) by 2 on weapons and body armour, 4 on other pieces, up to a fifth of its owner's level. Use it on the Workbench (Crafting)."
msgstr "将物品的力量（伤害或防护）提升：武器和身体护甲 +2，其他部件 +4，最高为佩戴者等级的五分之一。在工作台（制造）上使用。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:37
msgid ""
"A crafting gem of tier 3. On the Workbench (Crafting) it raises whichever base enchantment of a weapon, armour piece or jewel is furthest below its cap by 3, or a skill by 1; the cap grows with the tier. Three gems of a tier combine into one of the next."
msgstr ""
"制造宝石，第 3 阶。在工作台（制造）上，它可将武器、护甲或珠宝中低于上限最多的基础附魔提升 3 点，或将一项技能提升 1 点；上限随阶数增长。三颗同阶宝石可合成一颗下一阶。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:370
msgid ""
"Heals 20 hit points plus a quarter of the hit points a character of the potion's power in levels would have. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "治疗 20 点生命值，另加相当于药水等级对应角色生命值四分之一的量。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:371
msgid ""
"Restores 10 spell points plus a quarter of the spell points a character of the potion's power in levels would have. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "恢复 10 点法术值，另加相当于药水等级对应角色法术值四分之一的量。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:372
msgid ""
"Cures weakness and sleep and protects against them for 6 hours. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "治愈虚弱和睡眠，并在 6 小时内免疫。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:373
msgid ""
"Cures poison and disease and protects against them for 6 hours. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "治愈中毒和疾病，并在 6 小时内免疫。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:374
msgid ""
"Cures curses and paralysis and protects against them for 6 hours. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "治愈诅咒和麻痹，并在 6 小时内免疫。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:375
msgid ""
"Cures fear and insanity and protects against them for 6 hours. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "治愈恐惧和疯狂，并在 6 小时内免疫。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:376
msgid ""
"For 6 hours the drinker has its own Haste aura: faster attacks and spells, as strong as the potion's power allows (full at 200); the stronger of it and the party's aura counts, never both. 5 drinks. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr ""
"6 小时内饮用者获得自己的加速光环：更快的攻击与施法，强度随药水力量提升（200 为满）；与队伍光环比较取更强者，两者不会同时生效。共 5 次。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:377
msgid ""
"For 6 hours the drinker has its own Heroism aura: more melee damage, as strong as the potion's power allows (full at 200); the stronger of it and the party's aura counts, never both. 5 drinks. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr ""
"6 小时内饮用者获得自己的英雄主义光环：更多近战伤害，强度随药水力量提升（200 为满）；与队伍光环比较取更强者，两者不会同时生效。共 5 次。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:378
msgid ""
"For 6 hours the drinker has its own Bless aura: better attack and hit chance, as strong as the potion's power allows (full at 200); the stronger of it and the party's aura counts, never both. 5 drinks. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr ""
"6 小时内饮用者获得自己的祝福光环：更高的攻击与命中率，强度随药水力量提升（200 为满）；与队伍光环比较取更强者，两者不会同时生效。共 5 次。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:379
msgid ""
"For 6 hours the drinker has its own Shield and Preservation auras, as strong as the potion's power allows (full at 200); the stronger of it and the party's aura counts, never both. 5 drinks. Needs power 20. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr ""
"6 小时内饮用者获得自己的护盾与保护光环，强度随药水力量提升（200 为满）；与队伍光环比较取更强者，两者不会同时生效。共 5 次。需要力量 20。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:380
msgid ""
"Adds Meditation skill levels for 6 hours: 1 + the square root of the power divided by 1.5, rounded up. 5 drinks. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "6 小时内增加冥想技能等级：1 + 药水力量除以 1.5 的平方根，向上取整。共 5 次。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:381
msgid ""
"Regenerates hit points for 6 hours, faster with more power; the stronger of it and a Regeneration aura counts. 5 drinks. (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "6 小时内持续回复生命值，力量越强回复越快；与再生光环比较取更强者。共 5 次。（饮用：拿起药水并在角色肖像上右键点击。）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:382
msgid ""
