#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:75
msgid "Solarstone"
msgstr "太阳石"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:823
msgid "Fire Magic Book"
msgstr "火焰魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:833
msgid ""
"A scorched grimoire that radiates gentle heat; a heat-seal brands the cover, and the pages grow too hot to hold unless you're versed in Fire."
msgstr "一本被灼烧过的魔法书，散发着温和的热气；封面上烙着火之封印，除非你精通火焰，否则书页会烫得无法手持。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:835
msgid "Air Magic Book"
msgstr "空气魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:845
msgid ""
"Feather-light pages hum with static; a whirling air-sigil scatters the lines to the wind, settling only for one trained in Air."
msgstr "羽轻的书页发出静电嗡鸣；旋转的空气符文将字行吹散，只有精通空气者才能令其安顿。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:847
msgid "Water Magic Book"
msgstr "水系魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:85
msgid ""
"A crafting gem of tier 7. On the Workbench (Crafting) it raises whichever base enchantment of a weapon, armour piece or jewel is furthest below its cap by 3, or a skill by 1; the cap grows with the tier. Three gems of a tier combine into one of the next."
msgstr ""
"制造宝石，第 7 阶。在工作台（制造）上，它可将武器、护甲或珠宝中低于上限最多的基础附魔提升 3 点，或将一项技能提升 1 点；上限随阶数增长。三颗同阶宝石可合成一颗下一阶。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:857
msgid ""
"Damp vellum where ink ripples like tides; a water-ward dissolves every character into droplets unless a Water adept calls them back."
msgstr "潮湿的羊皮纸上墨迹如潮水般荡漾；水之结界将每个字符化为水滴，除非水系大师将它们唤回。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:859
msgid "Earth Magic Book"
msgstr "土系魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:869
msgid ""
"Heavy as quarried rock, grit packed in the spine; a stone-seal weighs the script down, rising into legible relief for those attuned to Earth."
msgstr "重如采石，书脊间塞满砂砾；石之封印将文字压住，只有与大地共鸣者才能看清。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:87
msgid "Erudite Crystal"
msgstr "博学水晶"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:871
msgid "Spirit Magic Book"
msgstr "灵魂魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:881
msgid ""
"A calm glow lingers between the leaves; a spirit-binding sigil veils the prayers, and they fade to silence without skill in Spirit."
msgstr "书页间萦绕着平静的光芒；灵魂束缚符文遮掩了祷文，若无精神技艺，它们将归于寂静。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:883
msgid "Mind Magic Book"
msgstr "心智魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:893
msgid ""
"Margins of tight glyphs that reorder themselves; a thought-lock scrambles the text into riddles unless a Mind disciple aligns it."
msgstr "紧密符文的页边会自行重组；思想之锁将文字打乱成谜题，除非心灵门徒将其对齐。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:895
msgid "Body Magic Book"
msgstr "肢体魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:905
msgid ""
"Thick, herb-scented vellum warm to the pulse; a vigor-ward stiffens the pages, relaxing only for the steady hands of Body practitioners."
msgstr "厚实、带草药气息的羊皮纸随着脉搏温暖；活力结界使书页变硬，只有身体修习者沉稳的双手才能使其放松。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:907
msgid "Light Magic Book"
msgstr "光明魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:917
msgid ""
"A pale radiance seeps through the cover; a sun-seal flares too bright to read, dimming into clarity for those trained in Light."
msgstr "淡白的光芒从封面渗出；太阳封印耀眼得无法阅读，只有受过光明训练者才能看清。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:919
msgid "Dark Magic Book"
msgstr "暗黑魔法书"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:929
msgid ""
"Ink like pooled night that drinks the torchglow; a shadow-ward devours the lines, revealing them only to readers skilled in Dark."
msgstr "墨迹如凝滞的夜色，吞噬火炬的光芒；暗影结界吞噬字行，只有精通黑暗的读者才能看见它们。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:97
msgid ""
"A crafting gem of tier 8. On the Workbench (Crafting) it raises whichever base enchantment of a weapon, armour piece or jewel is furthest below its cap by 3, or a skill by 1; the cap grows with the tier. Three gems of a tier combine into one of the next."
msgstr ""
"制造宝石，第 8 阶。在工作台（制造）上，它可将武器、护甲或珠宝中低于上限最多的基础附魔提升 3 点，或将一项技能提升 1 点；上限随阶数增长。三颗同阶宝石可合成一颗下一阶。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:99
msgid "Erathian Sapphire"
msgstr "伊拉西亚蓝宝石"

