# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:14
msgid ""
"The Master of Ascension, Dorothy Senjac, can be found in the southeast region of Nighon."
msgstr "飞升大师道洛希·森加卡就在尼冈的东南部。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:15
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Ascension, William Smithson, instructs from his home on the eastern island of the Evenmorn Islands."
msgstr "飞升宗师威廉姆·斯密森在埃弗蒙岛东面的岛上他自己的家中授业。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:16
msgid "I can teach you Expert Alchemy if you meet the requirements."
msgstr "只要你满足条件，我就能教你炼金术专家。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:17
msgid "I can teach you Master Alchemy if you meet the requirements."
msgstr "只要你满足条件，我就能教你炼金术大师。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:18 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:2
msgid ""
"Ascension strengthens spell damage and healing at the cost of higher mana consumption and casting time. I can teach you Expert Ascension if your skill is level 4 and you pay 2000 gold."
msgstr "飞升会增强法术的伤害与治疗，代价是更高的法力消耗和更长的施法时间。只要你的技能达到 4 级并支付 2000 金币，我就能教你飞升专家。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:20
msgid "John Tuck can teach you to master the Ascension skill."
msgstr "约翰·特克能教你精通飞升技能。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:21
msgid ""
"Can identify items and grants +2 effective Ascension skill to party members who have learned Ascension."
msgstr "可以鉴定物品，并使已习得飞升的队伍成员的有效飞升技能 +2。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:22
msgid ""
"Grants +4 effective Ascension skill to party members who have learned Ascension."
msgstr "使已习得飞升的队伍成员的有效飞升技能 +4。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:23
msgid ""
"Grants +6 effective Ascension skill to party members who have learned Ascension."
msgstr "使已习得飞升的队伍成员的有效飞升技能 +6。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:24
msgid "No skill bonus is implemented for the Counselor in MAW."
msgstr "MAW 中没有为顾问实现技能加成。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:25
msgid "No skill bonus is implemented for the Barrister in MAW."
msgstr "MAW 中没有为大律师实现技能加成。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:26
msgid "Grants +4 effective Merchant skill to party members."
msgstr "使队伍成员的有效商人技能 +4。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:12 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:19 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:3
msgid ""
"Ascension strengthens spell damage and healing at the cost of higher mana consumption and casting time. I can teach you Master Ascension if your Expert skill is level 7 and you pay 5000 gold."
msgstr ""
"飞升会增强法术的伤害与治疗，代价是更高的法力消耗和更长的施法时间。只要你的专家级技能达到 7 级并支付 5000 金币，我就能教你飞升大师。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:4
msgid ""
"Ascension strengthens spell damage and healing at the cost of higher mana consumption and casting time. I can teach you Grand Master Ascension if your Master skill is level 10 and you pay 8000 gold."
msgstr ""
"飞升会增强法术的伤害与治疗，代价是更高的法力消耗和更长的施法时间。只要你的大师级技能达到 10 级并支付 8000 金币，我就能教你飞升宗师。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:5
msgid ""
"Petra Mithrit, Expert in the skill of Ascension, dwells near the Temple of the Sun in the Murmurwoods."
msgstr "飞升专家派德拉·密斯瑞住在低语之森的太阳神殿附近。"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:6
msgid ""
"Garret Mistspring, Master of Ascension, instructs all students of necromancy in the art of Ascension.\n"
"For this the Necromancers' Guild rewards him well.\n"
"His home is in the hamlet of Twilight at the base of the Shadowspire."
msgstr ""
"飞升大师加瑞特·雾春向所有研习死灵术的学生传授飞升之道。\n"
"死灵法师公会为此给予他丰厚的报酬。\n"
"他的家在影旋山脉脚下的黎明城。"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:9
msgid ""
"Wanda Lightsworn, Grand Master of Ascension, is in the hire of Charles Quixote, and instructs all of his knights in the skills of Ascension.\n"
"It is the hope of Charles Quixote that this will give his forces and edge in battle against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"飞升宗师汪达·来特史汪受雇于查尔斯·吉科德，向他麾下所有骑士传授飞升技艺。\n"
"查尔斯·吉科德希望这能让他的部队在对抗绞刑峡谷飞龙的战斗中占得先机。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/place_mon_names.txt:1
msgid "Naga Empress"
msgstr "纳迦女皇"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/place_mon_names.txt:4
msgid "Cardinal of Baa"
msgstr "羊鸣教红衣主教"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/place_mon_names.txt:5
msgid "High Cardinal"
msgstr "羊鸣教大主教"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/place_mon_names.txt:7
msgid "Goblin's Lieutenant"
msgstr "大耳怪副官"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/quests_maw.txt:1
msgid ""
"Find the Druid Circlet of Power in the Druid Circle and bring it to Dantillion in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "在德鲁伊石圈找到力量之德鲁伊头环，并将它带给低语之森的丹提理安。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:1
msgid "Also covers elemental attacks"
msgstr "同时可掩护元素攻击"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:1
msgid "Also covers spells"
msgstr "同时可掩护法术"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:1
msgid "Covers physical attacks"
msgstr "可掩护物理攻击"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:1
msgid "Hitting a monster raises the next cover chance by 15%"
msgstr "击中怪物会使下一次掩护几率提高 15%"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:1
msgid ""
"The character steps in front of blows aimed at companions. Every point adds 1% to a base 10% chance to take the hit instead, up to 40% at 30 points; of the companions whose roll succeeds, the one with the most hit points takes it. Alone, a successful cover halves the blow. Mastery comes by itself at 6, 12 and 20 points (8, 20 and 30 on Insanity and Madness), and reaching 30 points teaches Retaliation. The gem beside its name on the skills screen (or P) turns it on or off."
msgstr ""
"角色会挺身挡在针对同伴的攻击之前。每一点技能为基础 10% 的代替承伤几率增加 1%，30 点时最高达 40%；若有多名同伴判定成功，则由生命值最高者承受。单独一人时，成功掩护可使该次攻击伤害减半。精通会在 6、12、20 点时自动获得（疯狂与癫狂难度为 8、20、30 点），达到 30 点时将习得反击。在技能界面按 P 键可开启或关闭。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:2
msgid "Absorbs 25% of each hit"
msgstr "吸收每次攻击 25% 的伤害"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:2
msgid "Absorbs 50% of each hit"
msgstr "吸收每次攻击 50% 的伤害"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:2
msgid "Absorbs 75% of each hit"
msgstr "吸收每次攻击 75% 的伤害"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:2
msgid "Absorbs all of each hit while mana lasts"
msgstr "只要法力足够，便吸收每次攻击的全部伤害"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:2
msgid ""
"While it is on, mana soaks up part of every hit the character takes. Each spell point absorbs 1 + skill^1.4 / 60 damage, 5 at 50 points, where the skill stops. Mastery comes by itself at 6, 12 and 20 points (8, 20 and 32 on Insanity and Madness). The gem beside its name on the skills screen (or M) turns it on or off."
msgstr ""
"开启后，法力会吸收角色所受每次攻击的一部分伤害。每点魔法值吸收 1 + 技能^1.4 / 60 点伤害，技能上限 50 点时为 5 点。精通会在 6、12、20 点时自动获得（疯狂与癫狂难度为 8、20、32 点）。技能界面上其名称旁的宝石（或 M 键）可开启或关闭。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:3
msgid ""
"Deepens the character's mana and lightens the mana that buff auras hold. Mastery comes by itself at 6, 12 and 20 points."
msgstr "加深角色的法力储备，并减轻增益灵气所占用的法力。精通会在 6、12、20 点时自动获得。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:3
msgid ""
"Mana +0.5% per point; auras reserve as if the class had 0.5 more mana per level"
msgstr "每点法力 +0.5%；灵气占用法力的计算如同职业每级多 0.5 点法力"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:3
msgid ""
"Mana +1% per point; auras reserve as if the class had 1 more mana per level"
msgstr "每点法力 +1%；灵气占用法力的计算如同职业每级多 1 点法力"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:3
msgid ""
"Mana +1.5% per point; auras reserve as if the class had 1.5 more mana per level"
msgstr "每点法力 +1.5%；灵气占用法力的计算如同职业每级多 1.5 点法力"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:3
msgid ""
"Mana +2% per point; auras reserve as if the class had 2 more mana per level"
msgstr "每点法力 +2%；灵气占用法力的计算如同职业每级多 2 点法力"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:4
msgid ""
"After a successful cover, every point gives a 1% chance to store a counterattack for 10 seconds. The character's next hit spends it: extra damage that grows with the skill, melee power and vitality, a 25% chance per stored counterattack to stun the monster for 2 seconds (1 second on bosses), and 30% less recovery per stored counterattack. Learned when Cover reaches 30 points; mastery comes by itself at 10, 24 and 40 points, and the skill stops at 50."
msgstr ""
"成功掩护后，每一点技能有 1% 的几率储存一次反击，持续 10 秒。角色的下一次攻击会消耗它：造成随技能、近战威力与体力成长的额外伤害；每储存一次反击有 25% 几率使怪物晕眩 2 秒（对首领为 1 秒），并使恢复时间缩短 30%。掩护达到 30 点时习得；精通会在 10、24、40 点时自动获得，技能上限为 50。"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:4
msgid "Stores one counterattack"
msgstr "储存一次反击"

# imported from engine-extra.po
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_new.txt:4
msgid "Stores up to three counterattacks"
msgstr "最多储存三次反击"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/skill_des_patch.txt:2
msgid ""
"Ascension raises the power of the character's spells: damage and healing grow with every point, at the price of higher mana costs and longer casting. Each rank of mastery takes back part of the mana cost."
