# reviewed by the zh-cn translators (2.0 review)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1085 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1094 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1103
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1112
msgid ""
"Offensive spells cast from the quick or attack spell build Elemental stacks, and each cast turns that spell into another known one of the same kind: single target, shotgun or area. Each stack adds 10 % spell damage and 5 % casting speed, and raises the mana cost by 7.5 % (Elementalists cast half again as slowly without stacks). A weapon hit spends them all, a cast from the spellbook starts again at one, and they halve once you stop casting. The Rotation gem on the skills page's Magic heading (or R) turns the rotation and stacks on or off: {rotation}.\n"
"Elementalists learn spells by casting them at monsters instead of from books. {elemental_progress_line}"
msgstr ""
"从快速施法或攻击法术施放的攻击性法术会积累元素叠层，且每次施放都会把该法术换成同类的另一个已知法术：单体、散射或范围。每层使法术伤害提高 10%、施法速度提高 5%，并使法力消耗提高 7.5%（没有叠层时，元素使的施法时间延长一半）。武器命中会耗尽所有叠层，从法术书施法会从一层重新开始，停止施法后叠层会减半。技能页魔法标题上的轮转宝石（或 R 键）可开关轮转与叠层：{rotation}。\n"
"元素使通过对怪物施放法术来学会法术，而不是从书中学习。{elemental_progress_line}"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:113
msgid ""
"Sparks fires small balls of lightning into the world that bounce around until they hit something or dissipate. Each spark does 1-{dice} points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "发射小型闪电球，在地图内弹跳直到击中目标或消散。每颗火花造成 1-{dice} 点伤害（每点空气魔法技能）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1137
