msgstr "一种特殊的紫水晶，可将物品附魔强度提升 3，最高 30（右键点击带有基础附魔的物品使用）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:196
msgid "Crafting Amber"
msgstr "制造琥珀"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:201
