msgstr "一种特殊的紫黄玉，可将物品附魔强度提升 4，最高 50（右键点击带有基础附魔的物品使用）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:211
msgid "Crafting Ruby"
msgstr "制造红宝石"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:217
msgid ""
"A special Ruby that allows to increase an item Enchant Strength by 4, up to 60 (right-click on an item with a base enchant to use)"
msgstr "一种特殊的红宝石，可将物品附魔强度提升 4，最高 60（右键点击带有基础附魔的物品使用）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:219
msgid "Crafting Sunstone"
msgstr "制造日长石"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:225
msgid ""
"A special Sunstone that allows to increase an item Enchant Strength by 4, up to 70 (right-click on an item with a base enchant to use)"
msgstr "一种特殊的日长石，可将物品附魔强度提升 4，最高 70（右键点击带有基础附魔的物品使用）。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:227
msgid "Crafting Emerald"
msgstr "制造翡翠"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/patches/items.txt:233
msgid ""
