# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "This will sound odd, but bear with me, heroes. The name’s Verdant, and I am a time traveler. Something rather dire has occurred and I need your help. Actually, the world needs your help. I am but a messenger… and the probable cause of all the trouble, but that’s really not what’s important here."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这也许听上去很奇怪，但请容我道来，英雄们。我的名字叫维尔丹，是一名时空旅行者。这里发生了相当可怕的事情，我需要你们的帮助。确切地说，是这个世界需要你们的帮助。我只是个信使……也可能是这个麻烦的制造者，但这并不重要。重要的是，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "See, personally, I always found it disappointing how all the chronicles detail the lives of kings, queens, and other politicians. How they say, ‘and Queen Whatever knighted her heroes’. I don’t want to read about that, I want to read about the heroes. I want to know about mires they’ve trudged through, about the miles they’ve traversed, about the riches they hauled, and the little folk they’ve saved."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你看，就我个人而言，所有的编年史都详细记述了国王、皇后和其他贵族的生活，这总是令人失望。看他们是怎么说的，“女王终归要册封她的英雄们”。我可不想看这些，我想看那些英雄的故事。我想看他们跋涉过的泥潭，旅行过的路途，获得过的财富，还有拯救过的小人物。所以我决定自己来写一部包含这些的编年史。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "What I need you to do is really rather simple in concept. Basically, I know you’re capable of saving the world, so I will need you to do it a few more times. Just three times total, don’t worry! With the other two groups of heroes currently or permanently indisposed, you’ve got to pick up the slack or things will get really messed up. I mean, really: the history will rewrite itself, and, given the scope of changes and the amount of lives affected, who knows. The history might just say ‘Enough is enough!’ and explode everything. A wild, yet educated, guess. So you see the problem."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我需要你做的事情在概念上很简单。总的来说，我知道你有拯救世界的本事，所以我需要你多做几次。总共也就三次，别担心！由于另外两组英雄当前或者将永远身体不适，你们只能接下这个烂摊子，不然事情就真的搞砸了。我说真的：历史会自我重写，并且，给定变化的余地和影响的生命数量，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "To travel through time and step onto the paths meant to be traversed by other heroes, you will need to use dimension doors present in areas infused with magic. Fear not, they're safe. Somewhat."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "要穿越时间，踏上本该由其他英雄行走的道路，你需要借助那些藏身于充满魔力之地的维度门。别担心，它们是安全的——算是吧。你能在低语之森中找到一扇，飞龙沙漠里还有一扇，如果我没记错的话，埃弗蒙岛上也有一扇在等着你。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Good news: the whole hero-extinction mess wasn’t just my fault. Bad news: the whole hero-extinction mess wasn’t just my fault. In other news: there’s a Runaway Chaos that’s causing trouble and it must be caught and contained! More literally than one might like."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "好消息：英雄消亡的困境不仅仅是我的错。坏消息：英雄消亡的困境不仅仅是我的错。另一条消息：出现了一个惹麻烦的失控混沌，必须阻拦并遏制它！事实上也许比可能的情况更加严峻。我不想谈及技术细节，因为我说的越多，你明白的越少——这完全正常，和你的智慧一点儿也不冲突。用最简单的说法来讲，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Controlled Breach is a place the consortium has created where it’s possible to see and interact with the Runaway Chaos, and through which the Uneasy Origin Matter can be reached. It’s an artificial realm-esque area where matters *Verdant snickers* can be safely handled without jeopardizing any real world places."
#~ msgstr "可控裂缝是联合会创造的，能够观测失控混沌并与之交互的场所，而且通过它可以到达不稳定起源物质。它是一个人造领域建筑风格的区域，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "I’m glad you asked, this whole conundrum is making it rather difficult for me to sleep. I could pretend it’s the worry over the poor goobers I’ve punted out of our realm, existence, time, or whatnot that’s keeping me awake, but I’ve always been a big fan of truth telling. Lies are so much hassle to keep track of, aren’t they?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我很高兴你来问我了，这个难题让我焦头烂额难以入睡。我可以假装这担心来源于我从我们的领域、存在、时间里踢出去的可怜的傻瓜们，或是某种使我保持清醒的某种什么东西。但我也一直是说实话的忠实拥趸。毕竟让谎言维持下去实在是太麻烦了，不是么？基本上，我不太在乎被我送走的那些实习生，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "You could ask, what value does time hold to a time traveler? And hasn’t the other heroes’ suffering has already begun – or, in fact, ended centuries ago, should they have found themselves in another period? And to that I’ll tell you: stop over thinking things. Trying to make sense of it all will just give you a headache. A rookie mistake of anyone dealing with paradox-prone situations."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "你可能会问，时间对于一个时间旅行者来说有什么意义？并且其他英雄的苦难之旅难道还没有开始么？抑或是，在几个世纪以前就已经结束了？他们会不会在另一个时期发现他们自己？为此我要告诉你们：别在思考这事了。想弄清楚这一切只会让你头痛。这是一个任何人处理容易出现悖论的情况时都会犯的新手错误。用这种方式看待这个问题："

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "There’s two things to know here."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这里有两件事你们需要知道。一：我不能把失落的英雄们带回到他们各自本身的时间线上，由于我已经把你们调和进入他们的命运之路上了。我们必须把他们转移到其他什么时间上，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no such thing as a Guiding Gem, obviously, we have to make one. I will need a large round crystal for this. LARGE. ROUND. And I mean, *SERIOUSLY ROUND*. None of that shady vendor garbage. If the stream gets skewed due to an uneven orb shape I might get a nosebleed of the century when I use the Telelocator. I’ve already sprayed the halls for the century two centuries back, and also for the one six from now, and I’m definitely not into repeating that experience."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这里没有能够当做引导宝石的东西，显然，我们需要制作一个。我需要一大块圆形水晶来制作。又大，又圆。我的意思是，要特别圆。不能是那种可疑摊贩的垃圾。当我是用远程定位器时，如果由于不均匀的球体形状而导致能量流偏斜，我可能要流上一整个世纪的鼻血。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Good, good, we almost have our thing pieced together. To attach the gem to the rod I need one more thing – Wisp Wrappings. It’s basically bandages, but infused with a strong spiritual essence. That can only happen if they touched the “flesh” of an undead and have spent some time being filled with a strong spiritual presence."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "很好很好，我们快要把这东西组装好了。为了把宝石固定在棒杆上，我还需要一件物品：幽魂外皮。它本来就是绷带，但被注入了强大的精神实质。只有在绷带接触到不死生物的“躯体”，并经过一段时间充满强大的精神能量，才能形成幽魂外皮这种东西。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Infusing the Guiding Gem might turn out to be an affair more expensive than dangerous. I’d love to reimburse you but, alas, I don’t have any currency valid in this here time period. In the place I’ve last visited with an intention to buy things they stopped trading in gold. *Verdant shows you a bunch of useless paper scraps* You could get a horse for this. Fun, no?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "给引导宝石注入魔力是一件不仅危险还很昂贵的事情。我很乐意给你补偿，但是，哎呀，我完全没有在这个时间段内有效的货币。我在访问的上一个地方打算买东西的时候，他们已经停止使用黄金进行交易了。（维尔丹给你展示了一堆没用的纸片）在那里你可以用这个买一匹马，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The rod can be enchanted with just a little bit of leg work. You will need to drop by the four Elemental Planes, but before you panic – don’t. What I need can be found near the very entrance of each of them."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "棒杆只需要一点跑腿的工作就可以完成附魔了。你需要造访四个元素界面，但没必要惊慌失措。你在每个界面入口就能找到我需要的东西。你需要做的就是进入内部，用一把剑或者你手里的随便什么家伙捅进门框里，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wonderful, gorgeous, beautiful. Now that we have this puppy in one piece and magical enough, on top of being attuned to the realms, we need to do one more thing before I activate it. Well, one-ish. We need to attune it to the heroic spirits, traits found in heroes, kindred souls of valiance, call it however you want. Long story short, I need you to hold it and let it become drunk with your awesomeness. The problematic part may be, you need to actually be awesome for the device to want to drink from you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "精妙绝伦，璀璨绚丽，美丽动人。现在我们已经把这个小家伙拼凑完整并且充满魔力了，为了能够协调到领域的频率，在我激活它之前我们还需要做一件事。好吧，可能不止一件。我们需要把它与英勇的精神，英雄的个性，勇敢的灵魂调和在一起，随便你怎么称呼它。长话短说，我需要你握住它，让它沉醉在你的威严之中。问题在于，你真的要足够厉害，才能对这个装置产生吸引。幸运的是，它的胃口并不只需要一个人来喂饱。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "Pass the test Might (70) to attune the Telelocator."
#~ msgstr "通过测试力量（70）来协调远程定位器。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "We’re almost there. I can nearly hear the desperate cries for help from our punted friends! Provided they still actually exist somewhere and haven’t been straight out erased from everywhere… let’s stick to nearly hearing their cries, aye?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我们就快完成了。我几乎能听见我们被放逐的朋友们绝望的呼救声！只要他们还确实存在于某处，还没有被完全彻底地抹除……就让我们追寻他们的呼唤，好吧？现在我们遇到一个难题。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "*Verdant performs quite a lengthy ritual to activate the Telelocator, and just when you begin to worry that it may not work after all this work, the device beams up and the sorceress opens her eyes wide. She’s looking straight at you, but her gaze is absent, as she’s not seeing you, but things from realms, or times, far away or long time away from here and now. Then, she speaks, strangely mechanically.”"
#~ msgstr "维尔丹执行了一个相当长的仪式来激活远程定位器。就在你担心这仪式不起作用的时候，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Yes, we can do it. I don’t know how much you’ve heard, but I know exactly how to bring the lost heroes back into our world and place them in a more fair predicament. I will need some gruesome stuff for that. It’s all about sacrifice and suffering now, you know. Also, do make haste as always, but don’t worry about time too much. Telelocator has detached both timelines so as long as I’m alive and the universe doesn’t backflip, the heroes can be saved."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "是的，我们能做到。我不知道你们听见了多少，但我已经知道怎么把失落的英雄们带回我们的世界，并把他们安置到一个更加公平的困境之中。为此我需要一些令人毛骨悚然的材料。这一切都和献祭和痛苦有关，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "With *pleasure*?! What is that supposed to mean?! Some heroes you are! *She crosses her arms on her chest and kicks a pot your way. You mix the ingredients together and offer the sorceress the resulting goop. It is, indeed, a sight to behold… right before barfing.*"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "“乐意”效劳？！这是什么意思？！亏你们还是英雄！（她在胸前交叉起双臂，向你的方向踢了一个罐子过来。你把原料混合在一起，把得到的黏糊糊的成品递给女巫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Well, the ring seemed stuck in my throat for a moment, but I think it passed through. WHO made this recipe? *She glares at a book lying to the side then takes the device and begins to activate it again. The mechanical voice is back.*"
#~ msgstr "好吧，那枚戒指好像在我的喉咙里卡了一会，但我觉得它已经下去了。到底是谁设计的这个配方？"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "All in all, that was pretty hero-efficient, I must say. One group for the prize of three and then two to spare for future or past catastrophes. Though with all of them placed in the same spot it might be a bit of a hero-oversaturation there. On the other hand, maybe they’ll fall in love and multiply eventually? If you ask me, I think the world needs all the heroes it can get. Yes, I *know* I can just check, don’t be such a buzz kill!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "总而言之，我不得不说，这真是相当“英雄式高效”。三组队伍中的一个中了奖，另外两个作为备用品应对未来或过去的灾难。尽管他们全部都被放置在一起的那个时间点，可能会有点“英雄式过度饱和”。另一方面，也许他们将会坠入爱河，并最终开花结果？"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "You see it about in field and town,"
#~ msgstr "当其隆重大驾，城里外都有它。无色味时如纱，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "The strongest chains will not bind it,"
#~ msgstr "锁链无法束缚，沟渠难减其速。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "An untiring servant it is,"
#~ msgstr "勤劳不倦之仆，土上穿梭运物。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "With sharp edged wit,"
#~ msgstr "仗其锋芒，凭其锐意，解决纠纷，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "It is too much for one."
#~ msgstr "一人不胜，二人正好。三人成众，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "This old one runs forever,"
#~ msgstr "老家伙一直跑，却不移动一毫。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "It can move over water,"
#~ msgstr "行于水上，却不展翅。行于水下，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "It doesn't live with in a house,"
#~ msgstr "未居房内，与房相拥。入需此物，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "A shimmering field that reaches far."
#~ msgstr "一片粼粼发光，无际延向远方。穿越不留踪迹，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "This engulfing thing,"
#~ msgstr "其吞噬万物，真的很奇异。体形越庞大，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "When it comes in,"
#~ msgstr "当其默默出现，从海面到岸边，"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "My friends! I found it! The Runaway Chaos! Or maybe… maybe it found me? I don’t know, I don’t know, it all feels like a grand jest. It surrounded me with hellish creatures, monsters born of my nightmares. To scare me, perhaps, or just see what I would do. I fought to stay alive and it just laughed. As I say these words, I hear echoes of this screeching laughter piercing through my very skull. And when I finally fell to the ground, without a shred of power left to carry on, suddenly the nightmares… dissipated. Gone, every single one. But the wounds they left were real… and yet, when I looked down, there wasn’t a single cut. Only my torn clothes stood as proof that anything had happened at all."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "我的朋友们！我找到它了！失控混沌！或者……也许是它找到的我？我不知道，我不知道，这一切就像是一场巨大的玩笑。它用地狱般的生物包围了我，那些家伙就像是从我的噩梦里诞生的。也许是为了吓唬我，或者仅仅为了观察我会如何行动。我为了活下去努力战斗，它却开始大笑。在我说这些话的时候，我仍能听见这些尖锐刺耳的笑声在我的脑袋里面回响。当我最终倒在地上，没有一丁点的力量坚持下去的时候，突然间那些噩梦般的怪物……消失了。一个也没留下。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#~ msgid "Well, I have no skills to offer, but I'm good company!"
#~ msgstr "好吧，尽管我身无长技，但是个相当不错的旅行伴侣。你只要管我吃饱，"

